<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni ashinna Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ashinna Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ashinna Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu yo Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni ashinna Luka phi imoka yo ichitabu ncheshe nhina Malhehano o Naanano chinohimiacha ukumi ni makhalhelho a Yesu Kuristo. Kila imoka yo chechiyo ineehaniya “injili,” maana aya “malhove Orera.” Chechiyo ichitabu chiyo chilhepiye ni Namatayo, Namako, ashinna Luka ni Nayohana. Ashinna Luka khalhempe mwaha unomwaacha Yesu vekha ayaru, nansho aholhepa mwaha unaacha mitheko chaapangiye ni akarumiya baada yo ukhwa ni uhihimmwa wawe nhina ikitabu yo Mitheko cha akarumiya. Khaawo ata ntu mmoka nochuwelha wo ikekhiaye ikatema vaalhepiye aya Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni ashinna Luka, ama ukittu waalhepiye aya. Nansho attu o ushoma enchi anorumelhelha wiira veekinaka yaalhepiye iyaakha cho 70 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ashinna Luka phi lhepilhe, yayo aari abwana mganga. Iphiro ilhepilhe aya ni nulhumo naya chinowooniha wiira aari ntu o ushoma chinene. Ashinna Luka ahothanana ulhepa rata mwaha unomwaacha Yesu, ahimiachaka chittu cheera aya wo upangia, wiira attu akina apatte ittu yo uchuwelha vanohalha aya ushoma (nlhako wo 1:1-3). Ashinna Luka khayaari Ayahudi (Akol nlhako wo 4:10-14), aholhepa wo iphiro inohalha wooriha attu ahiri Ayahudi uchuwelha chittu chihimiye. Yayo anoonia mwaari wo iphiro inohimiacha aya makhalhelho ni meetelho a Ayahudi (nlhako wo 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni ashinna Luka anolhikaana chinene ni ikitabu chi Namatayo ni Namako, ukhalhawaya anohimiacha chittu chechiyo chechiyo wo iphiro inolhikaana. Wo chechiyo ichitabu taaru chiyo, ashinna Luka phi nohiamiacha wo nhina mwaha wo uyaria wa Nayohana Obatiiza. Ashinna Luka tho anoomindelha mwaha wo uhiyerera milhatu (nlhako wo 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) ni mwaha wo ulhapelha (nlhako wo 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Nlhako wo 1:1-4, ashinna Luka anoochuwelhiha Malhove Orera ni uhimiacha nnikwa aya wo ulhepa ikitabu iyo.</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anoohimiacha mwaha wo uyaria wa Yesu ni iphiro chaachokhonlhe awe ntheko awe (nlhako wo 1:5-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io">Vakittu venchi nhina Malhove Orera mmo (nlhako wo 4:14-21:38), ashinna Luka anoohimiacha mitheko chaapannge awe Yesu, hasahasa cho ushangiha chaapanganche awe ni meettuchiho eettuchinhe awe attu.</para>
  <para style="io">Wo umalhihera, nhina milhako milhi chiyo (nlhako wo 22-24), anohimiacha Yesu chenre awe wo ukhwa, uvithiya ni uhihimmwa wawe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Munna nnottuniya Nateofilo,</para>
  <para style="p">Attu enchi aholhepa rata mwaha waapangeelhe variyari ihu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aalhempe thoko chenre ihu wo weewa attu yoonechenshe ni anamitheko o nenno nlhove nno toka machokholhelho aya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi etu, Munna Nateofilo, ukhalhawaya kihowehaweha wo ikekhiaye chittu chonkhaye rata chene toka khalhayi, kihoona vahorera etu ulhepa wo nlhatu winyu, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ni inyu nchuwelhe mwaanene ikeekhene yiituchihiye inyu.</para>
  <para style="s">Uyaria u Nayohana Obatiiza unoohimiachiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Naherode vaari aya amwene o Uyudea, ahawo anamilhohi eehaniya Azakariya, o nlhoko wa opochera ishaani eehaniya Naabiya. Ahanu aya Azakariya eehaniya Naelisabeti, o nihimo na anamilhohi Naharuni. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Onkhaye elhi ayo aari attu aapanga chittu cho ikekhiaye mmiholho wa Nlhuku, attwaraka iphiro cho malhehero ni ikano cha Athithi wo uhikhalha ni nlhatu wo ukhuwachiya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nansho yaari ahirina ashaana ukhalhawaya Naelisabeti yaari o uhiyara, ni ayo onkhaye ayo aari anoolhuvanlhe chinene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Azakariya yaari avaraka ntheko aya wo upochera ishaani Unupani wa Nlhuku. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yaari vaathanlhiye aya thoko chaari aya chipangiyaka ni opochera ishaani, urwaa uutusherani ubani umadhubahuni. Paahi etu nkayaarwaa u Inupa ya Athithi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Attu akina yaari vathe awehereraka anlhapelhaka Nlhuku ubani vaatusheriya aya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi nkawaakhumelhelha mpaani mmo, nkaweemelha wiimonono wo madhubahu mwaatusheriya ubani. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Azakariya vonne aya nnepa uyo nkayaathukumelha ni woova chinene. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nansho nnepa wo wiirimu nkaweera, “Azakariya, nhoove! Nlhuku heewa ulhapelha winyu, ni ahanu inyu Naelisabeti anonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana. Mmweeke mwaamwiihana nchina nawe Yohana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kihochuwelha wiira nnowa mwaateelhiya chinene, ni attu enchi akina anowa uteelhiya chiicho vanohalha awe uyaria! <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nowa ukhalha ntu mulhupalhe mmiholho wa Athithi. Khanowa aawuria idivai mena utheka uriwoothe. Toka vanohalha awe uyaria ni anumwanawe noowa aachariya Iphumu ya Nlhuku, <verse number="16" style="v"/>ni weewananiha rata attu enchi o Israeli ni waapiiha wa Athithi ri Nlhuku aya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nowa waaholhelha Athithi, wo machiri ni Iphumu thoko ya Naeliya. Noowa weewananiha manyanaangoro ni achishaana aya, nowa urukunusha mirima cha attu o itiyamaru wiira avire iphiro choombone, ni weesha tayari attu a Atithi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Azakariya nkaakhulha nnepa wo wiirimu eeraka, “Kinohalha uchuwelha chani yayo malhove ayo? Mii kihoolhuvalha ni ahanu aka chiicho ahoolhuvalha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nnepa wo wiirimu nkawaakhulha, “Mii kinoolhumacha va phi Gabrieli kineemelha mmiholho wa Nlhuku, kirumme uwa uhimeriani yoyo nttenga wo urera uyo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nansho ukhalhawaya khanrumelhenlhe nttenga aka, unowa utimira waayaka. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, nnottukiya malhaku inyu, nnookhalha chiicho wo uhulhumacha mpaka nihuku vanohalha aya utimira malheheriyo aka alha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo attu yaari yaawehereraka Azakariya uno ashangaka chani woonaka ahothepa ulhokelha chinene u Inupa ya Nlhuku mmo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vaakhumme aya vathe, khooria wulhumacha, paahi attu nkayaachuwelha wiira ahoona ithikineha vaari aya u Inupa ya Nlhuku. Yaari athoonyaka wo mathatha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ikatema aya yo uvara ntheko wo upochera ishaani Unupani wa Nlhuku vaamanlhe aya, Azakariya nkayaahokolhia uwani. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Baada yo uvira mahuku, ahanu aya, Naelisabeti nkayaarupalha irukulhu. Nkayeettelha mpaani mieri nthanu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nkayoolhumacha yiiraka, “Athithi ahokuupuwelha vano, ahothamiha ishoni yoona aka mwaattuni!”</para>
  <para style="s">Uyaria wa Yesu unoohimiachiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mweri wo sita wo iweyi i Naelisabeti Nlhuku nkanruma nnepa wo wiirimu Gabrieli arwee iwani wi ilhapo yo Ugalilaya yeehaniya Nazareti. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Arweehe wowo nttenga wa mwalhi mmoka aavekiye ni ntu mmoka o iyari ya Adaudi nchina nawe Yusufu. Mwalhi aarweehelhiya nttenga uyo eehaniya Mariamu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nnepa nkawaaphiya wa Amariamu nkaweera, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu! Athithi ari ni inyu, nhovahiya nnema mulhupalhe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Amariamu veewilhe aya yayo malhove ayo nkayaathemwa chinene, nkayaashanga wo uhichuwelha maana o yayo malhove ayo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nnepa wo wiirimu nkaweera, “Amariamu, nhoove, Nlhuku hoovahani nnema. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nnoorupalha iweyi ni unnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, nnohalha inyu umwiihana nchina nawe Yesu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yoyo nowa wiihaniya Mwaana a Nlhuku Mulhupalhe, noovahiya ihiche yo imwene thoko apwiiya awe Adaudi chenre aya, <verse number="33" style="v"/>ni uwa ukhalha mwene aya iyari i Nayakhobo mahuku o uhimalha, umwene wawe khunowa waamalha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Amariamu nkaakhulha nnepa wo wiirimu, “Mii ki mwalhi kihinaatameriya. Inohalha wiiria chani etu?” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nnepa wo wiirimu nkawaakhulha, “Iphumu ya Nlhuku nowuukhuruwelhani, ni ikuru ya Nlhuku inowa ukhunelhani. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, mwaana ntakatifu nowa wiihaniya Mwaana a Nlhuku. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Moopuwelheke tho alhoko inyu Naelisabeti, Yayo yeeriya wiira khannyara, nansho vano ari veruttuni iweyi yo mieri sita, ni wulhuvalha waya. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Khiiwo ihinooria wa Nlhuku.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Amariamu nkayeera, “Mii, karumiya a Athithi, yiirieke etu thoko chinre inyu wo wulhumacha.” Nnepa uyo nkawaathama.</para>
  <para style="s">Amariamu anoweetakachera Naelisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mahuku vaavinre aya, Amariamu wo uhipicha nkayaarwaa mpaka iwani yo umiakoni Uyudea. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Aarweelhe mpaka uwani wa Azakariya ni waashikuria Naelisabeti. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Naelisabeti veewilhe aya Amariamu aashikuriaka, mwaana mwankani nkaathuphathupha munthunkwani mwaya. Naelisabeti nkayaachariya Iphumu ya Nlhuku <verse number="42" style="v"/>nkayoolhumacha akhuwelhaka wiira, “Nhovahiya ibarakha waapwaha manyopani onkhaye, ni mwaana inyu nohalha uyaria hovahiya nnema! <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ki mpani mii mpaka alha akhumelhelhe uwannyaka, anumwanaya Athithi akeetelhelhe? <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wiira, veewilhe aka tu nlhove ninyu, mwaana mwankani hothupha munthunkwani mwaka ateelhiyaka. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nhoreeriya inyu mwaarumelhenlhe wiira anowa aatimira malhove o nttenga wa Athithi ahimeriye inyu!”</para>
  <para style="s">Nchipo na Amariamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Amariamu nkayeera,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nrima aka unowaathimicha Athithi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>nrima aka uhoteelhiya ukhalhawaya Nlhuku phi moopolhi aka,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya hokuupuwelha, mii karumiya kihiphwanelhiye!</para>
  <para style="q">Uchokholha lhelho attu onkhaye anowa ukiihana mii o mpuha,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya Nlhuku o ikuru yulhupalhe hokipangelha chittu chulhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="q">Nchina nawe nitakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>uchokholha iyari imoka mpaka iyari chikina</para>
  <para style="q">hooniha ikiriri wa attu onkhaye anaathimicha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ahopanga mitheko chulhupalhe wo moono aya wo machiri</para>
  <para style="q">ni waamwarushacha attu o mahuchuru anoopuwelha chittu cho mu nrimani mwaya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Haakurushacha mamwene aholhelhi vahicheni waya,</para>
  <para style="q">nkaawelhihacha attu o wiitimarikha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Haawoniha chittu choombone attu awolhiye ithalha,</para>
  <para style="q">ni woomolhacha attu o nhakhu nkaahiya mathatharu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Hotimiriha malhehano aapannge awe ni manyaapwiiya ihu,</para>
  <para style="q">ni umwoonelha ikiriri namitheko aya Israeli.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Hoopuwelha ikiriri awe wa Aburahimu</para>
  <para style="q">ni iyari aya mahuku o uhimalha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Amariamu nkayaalhokelha mieri miraru u Naelisabeti nkayaahokolhia uwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Uyaria u Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Nkawaaya wa Naelisabeti wiithaphulha, nkayannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Amwaatamana aya vamoka ni ashilhoko aya nkayeewa Athithi chinre awe wo woonelha ikiriri, nkawaattapelhelhiya vamoka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Mwaana vaapihilhe nihuku no nane, nkaarwehiya uwiinelhiyani unyawo, ni urwaa ummahani nchina na athumwane Zakariya. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Nansho anumwane nkayeera, “Mena! Nchina nawe Yohana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Attu nkayeera, “Nansho woonaka khaawo nlhoko inyu neehaniya chiicho!” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Paahi etu, nkayaathoonya waakoha athumwane wiira ehaniyeke nchina naani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Azakariya nkayaavekelha wiira avahiye ikibau alhepe, nkayaalhepa wiira, “Nchina nawe Yohana.” Attu onkhaye nkayaashangacha! <verse number="64" style="v"/>Ni vavawo Azakariya nkayaattukuwa malhaku ni nlhimi naya, nkayoolhumacha tho, nkaachokholha untotopelha Nlhuku. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Amwaatamana nkayoovacha chinene, ni mwaha uyo nkawaawanelha ilhapo yonkhaye yo miakoni Uyudea. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Kila ntu eewilhe nkaahalha oopuwelhaka munrimani ni ukoha, “Nohalha ukhalha chani yolha mwaana ulha?” Ukhalhawaya machiri a Athithi aari vachulhu vawe.</para>
  <para style="s">Ulhohera u Nazakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Azakariya nkayaachariya Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nkayoolhumacha nttenga wa Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>“Atotopelhiye Athithi, Nlhuku a attu o Israeli!</para>
  <para style="q">Haaweelha attu awe woopolhani.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Honivaha Moopolhi o machiri unupani waya,</para>
  <para style="q">karumiya a Adaudi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Aholhumacha toka ikatema yo machokholhelho wo iphiro ya anamilhohi awe atakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>wiira anowa anoopolha wa amalhaponi ihu,</para>
  <para style="q">mmathathani mwa attu annipangelha ichimwa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Aheera wiira anowoonelha ikiriri manyaapwiiya ihu</para>
  <para style="q">ni wuupuwelha malhehano aya matakatifu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Ahaalheha apwiiya</para>
  <para style="q">Aburahimu wiira,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>anonoopolha wa amalhaponi ni univaha ntheko wa waakaviha wo uhoova,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v"/>wiira nkhalheke wo utakatifu mpangaka chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q">mahuku ihu onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v"/>Ni uwe mwanaka, unowa wiihaniya namilhohi a Nlhuku ri Mulhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="q">Unowa waaholhelha Athithi</para>
  <para style="q">wookolhelha iphiro aya,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v"/>waahimeria attu aya wiira anowa woopolhiya</para>
  <para style="q">wo uhiyereriya uwonya waya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v"/>Nlhuku ihu ri o kiriri ni nrima woombone.</para>
  <para style="q">Noniwiihera nthuko unokhuma wiirimu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v"/>ni waamwalhelha nthuko attu onkhaye ari mwiipiphini mwo nookhwa,</para>
  <para style="q">ni unooniha iphiro yo urwaa umpuhani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v"/>Mwaana nkonnuwa, nkaachara machiri mwiiruttuni ni munnepani. Nkaakhalha uthakoni mpaka veechoninhe awe vaattuni wa attu o Israeli.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Uyaria wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yayo mahuku ayo naholheheriya nlhove ni Akaisari Augusto no waahimeria attu onkhaye aari imwene yo Rumi wiira aalhakelhiye. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Waalhakelhiya attu wo upacha waari ikatema Akurenio vaari aya atawaraka ilhapo yo Usiriya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kila ntu nkaarwa urii iwani awe wiira aalhakelhiye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nayusufu ni ayo ahottuka nkwaha ukhuma iwani yaakhalha aya yo Unazareti Ugalilaya ni ukelha Ubethelehemu ilhapo yo Uyudea, waayarelhe aya Amwene Adaudi. Aarweelhe wowo ukhalhawaya yaari o iyari ya Adaudi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Aarweelhe uwaalhakelhiyani vamoka ni Amariamu, ahanu aavekilhe aya aari ve iruttuni, <verse number="6" style="v"/>vaari aya Ubethelehemu uwo, ikatema aya yo wiithaphulha yahophiya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nkayeethaphulha nttara naya, mwaana mwanlhopwana, nkayanvilhikelha ikuwo ni umwaathalhelha nnikulhani mwaalhiheriya ashinama nhiilhini ukhalhawaya khayapantte nipuro nhina inupa ya alheto.</para>
  <para style="s">Minepa ni ashunga o ikhondoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vakhiviru ni yeyo iwani iyo ahokhalha attu aashunga mihuwo ashelhelhihaka mwiithuphini, alhitelhelhaka mihuwo chaya.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:8">Ashunga anooshunga ikhondoro</figure> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi nkawaakhumelhelha, ni nthimicho wa Athithi nkawaamwalheelha kila vakittu. Nkayoovacha chinene, <verse number="10" style="v"/>nansho nnepa wo wiirimu nkaweera, “Nhoove mwaatti! Kinouhimiacherani nttenga wo urera, unohalha waateelhiha mirima attu onkhaye. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya lhelho nna iwani ya Amwene Adaudi Moopolhi inyu hoyaria, Athithi Kuristo aalhehiye ni Nlhuku! <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ni nna phi nthonyero nnohalha inyu uhimiechesha, nnokoomwoona mwaana navilhikelhelhiye ikuwo che inamwane ni waathalhelhiya nhiilhini.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wo uhipicha nlhoko mulhupalhe wo minepa o wiirimu nkawaawa vamoka ni nnepa ulhe, chiipaka ichipo cho untotopelha Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Nthimicho wa Nlhuku wiirimu uchulhu,</para>
  <para style="q">ni mpuha velhaponi va wa attu anochivelhiya awe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Minepa vaathamme aya ni uhokolhia wiirimu, ashunga alhe nkeerelhana ashineneru wiira, “Ngwee etu Ubethelehemu noonecheshe chikhumelhenlhe, chi ninohimeriya ihu na Apwiiya chi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkayaakuviacha ni waaphwanya Amariamu ni Nayusufu ni umwoona mwaana naathalhelhiye nhiilhini. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ashunga vaamwonne aya, nkayaahimeria mwaha waahimeriye aya ni nnepa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye yeewa ahoshanga choolhumachiya na ashunga. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Amariamu nkaathepa wuupuwelha mwaha wonkhaye munrimani mwaya. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ashunga nkayaahokolhia eepachaka ichipo cho untotopelha Nlhuku wo mwaha weewilhe aya ni woonechesha, waari thoko chaahimeriye aya ni nnepa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noovahiya nchina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yavireke mahuku nane, vaayilhe aya ikatema yo wiinelhiya unyawo mwaana, nkaavahiya nchina nawe Yesu, nchina naakumihiye ni nnepa wo wiirimu hinaya urupalhiya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorweehiya Unupani wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mahuku nkaaya wo Nayusufu ni Amariamu urwaa uttukuriyani, thoko chaalheheriya ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa. Paahi etu nkayankusha mwaana unrweeha Uyerusalemu, uttukuriyani wa Athithi, <verse number="23" style="v"/>thoko chaalhepiye aya nhina Malhehero a Athithi, “Kila nttara nilhopwana niihaniyeke ntakatifu a Athithi.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yaarweelhe tho uukumihani isadaka ya akaulha elhi ama makhandi o ikhunda melhi, thoko chaalheheriya ni malheheriyo a Athithi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yayo mahuku ayo ahokhalha ntu eehaniya Nasimeoni aakhalha Uyerusalemu. Yaari ntu orera nrima aapanga chaathanana awe Nlhuku awehereraka woopolhiya wo Israeli, Iphumu ya Nlhuku akhalhaka ni ayo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Iphumu ya Nlhuku aari anaahimiachenre wiira khanokhwa ahinaya umwoona Kuristo aalhehiye ni Athithi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Aholhelhiyaka ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku, Nasimeoni ahorwaa Inupa ya Nlhuku. Ni yeyo ikatema iyo manyanaangoro ahommwiiha mwaana Yesu wi Inupa ya Nlhuku uttukuriyani thoko chaalheheriya ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nasimeoni yahompochera mwaana mmiononi mwaya ni untotopelha Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Vano Pwiiya, nhotimiriha malhehano inyu,</para>
  <para style="q">munhiyeke vano karumiya inyu arwee wo mpuha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Wo miitho aka kimwanene kihoona unoopolha winyu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>nkoronshe inyu wooniye ni attu inyu onkhaye,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nthuko wo wamwalhelha attu ahiri Ayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q">ni nthuko wo nthimicho wa attu inyu Israeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Manyanaangoro o mwaana aahanlhe anoomiye uwanoni wo chittu chaahimiya ni Nasimeoni chimwaachaka mwaana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nasimeoni nkaalhepelhelha ibarakha ni weerelha Amariamu anumwanawe, “Mwaana inyu ulha hothanlhiya ni Nlhuku wo nlhatu no upotera ni uhihimulhiya wa attu enchi o Uisraeli. Nohalha ukhalha ithikineha yo uvengiya ni attu <verse number="35" style="v"/>chiicho wuupuwelha wa attu enchi unowa uchuwania. Ni inyu mwaanene nnowa ukelhiya ihuzuni yo uweria thoko uphanga wo wiithia, inoohomani munrimani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ahokhalha anamilhohi anankhwelhi o wulhuvalha, eehaniya Ana abiti Fanueli o nikosho ni Naasheri. Aakhanlhe ni owannyaya iyaakha saba tu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Aari o wulhuvalha, aaphiya iyaakha makhumi nane ni ncheshe, ni mahuku onkhaye yaari alhokelhaka wi Inupa ya Nlhuku uthana ni uhiyu, anthimichaka Nlhuku, attukaka ni unlhapelha. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo yaari anawiilhe unthimichani Nlhuku olhumachaka malhove anomwaacha mwaana wa attu onkhaye aaweherera woopolhiya wo Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Uhokolhia Unazareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nayusufu ni Amariamu vaamalhinhe aya upanga thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Malhehero a Apwiiya, yahohokolhia uwani Unazareti ilhapo yo Ugalilaya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mwaana nkonnuwa ni upatta machiri, nkaachara irusho, ni nnema wa Nlhuku waari vamoka ni uyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwanhima Yesu Unupani wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kila iyaakha manyanaangoro a Yesu yaari arwaaka Uyerusalemu unlhiani Pasaka. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu vaari awe ni malhipa o iyaakha khumi khuwa miilhi, yahorwaa unlhiani Pasaka thoko cheera aya mahuku ene. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pasaka vaamanlhe awe, nkayaachokholha nkwaha wo uhokolhia uwani, nansho mwaana mwanhima Yesu aahanlhe Uyerusalemu. Manyanaangoro awe yaari ahichuwelhaka, <verse number="44" style="v"/>yaari aanyiheraka wiira aari munkwahani mmo, paahi etu nkayeeta nkwaha wo nihuku phi yaachokhonlhe aya umwaavia mwaashilhoko aya ni manyampwana aya. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Khayaamwoonne, paahi nkayaahokolhia tho Uyerusalemu umwaaviani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nihuku no neraru, nkayamphwanya nari wi Inupa ya Nlhuku, nakhanlhe vamoka ni owiittuchiha e Iyahudi, eewelhelhaka ni waakoha chookohiya. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye yaamwiiwa ahoshanga cheera awe wo waakhulha wo irusho. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Manyanaangoro nkayoomiya uwanoni vaamwonne aya, ni anumwanawe nkayeera, “Mwaamwanaka, nlhatu waani wo upanga chiicho? Athumwana ni mii naari nuwaaviaka ninashannge.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nkaakhulha, “Mwaakavierani? Khamwaachuwenlhe wiira ihokiphwanelha ukhalha nnupani mwa Athithi?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nansho khayaachuwenlhe maana o malhove olhumacha awe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Paahi etu Yesu nkahokolhia Unazareti vamoka ni manyanaangoro awe, nkeewelhelha ni wiitimarikha. Anumwanawe nkayaashunga mwaha wonkhaye uyo munrimani mwaya. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu nkonnuwa nchusha ni ukhalha o irusho, athepaka uttuniya ni Nlhuku vamoka ni attu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nttenga u Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoha 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Iyaakha yo khumi ni nthanu yo utawara wa Nakaisari Natiberiyo, Apontio Pilato phi aari aatawara ilhapo yo Uyudea, Naherode aari atawaraka Ugalilaya ni ahima aya Nafilipo yaari atawaraka ilhapo cho Uturea ni Utrikoni. Alusaniya aatawara Uabileni, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ashinna Anasi ni Nakayafa phi yaari Opochera Ishaani Olhupalhe. Yayo mahuku ayo Nlhove na Nlhuku nkanaakhuruwelha Nayohana mwaana a Azakariya uthakoni. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi etu Nayohana nkayaarwaa ilhapo chonkhaye chaatamana mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, eettuchihaka wiira, “Nkhoromeke ni uhiya uwonya winyu mbatiiziyeke, Nlhuku nouhiyererani uwonya winyu.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Phi lhepiye aya nkitabuni mwa anamilhohi ashinna Isaya wiira,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ntu mmoka nookhuwelha muthakoni,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Nkooroshe iphiro yo uvira Apwiiya,</para>
  <para style="q">mwookolhe mitalha chinohalha aya uvira!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kila nlhikiti ninoowuhelhiya,</para>
  <para style="q">kila mwalha ni mwaako unoolhokihiya.</para>
  <para style="q">Iphiro cho uhookwaa chinowookolhiya,</para>
  <para style="q">ni mitalha chinananre chinoorerihiya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye anomwona Nlhuku opolhaka attu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Paahi etu, milhoko cha attu enchi nkayaawa u Nayohana uubatiiziyani. Nayohana nkayakoha, “Inyu iyari yo inwaa va, nhimeriye ni apani wiira nttawe ntwarusho Nlhuku unowiiha awe? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mpangeke etu mitheko cho wooniha etu wiira nhokhoroma ni uhiya uwonya winyu. Nhichokholhe vano etu wiira Aburahimu phi athumwaninyu. Kinouhimeriani wiira Nlhuku noworia uthathusha alha malhuku alha ukhalha ashaana a Aburahimu! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ipacho iri tayari ukakha mwiri vamithithaarini, miri chonkhaye chihinemma rata chinookakhiya ni urihelhiya vamooroni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Attu nkayaakoha, “Niireke chani etu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nayohana nkayaakhulha, “Ntu ri ni ikuwo pilhi ammaheke imoka ntu hirina, ni ntu rini yolhia ankawelheke nkhunanawe hirina.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Attu yaalhiviha ikhodi nkayaawa uubatiiziyani, nkayaakoha Nayohana, “Owiittuchiha, ni hii niireke chani etu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nayohana nkayaakhulha yeeraka, “Nhinlhivihe ntu upwaha chilheheriye inyu waalhiviha attu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Manyaasikaari akina ni ayo nkayaakoha, “Ni hii chiicho, niireke chani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, nkayeera, “Nhinthurulhe ntu nchurukhu awe ama umwootheria choomwotheria. Nthoshiyeke nchurukhu unolhiviya inyu uyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Attu nkaayaakhulhuvelha ittu, nkayaahalha oopuwelhaka munrimani wiira Nayohana ayo aari phi Kuristo Moopolhi aathanlhiye ni Nlhuku. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Paahi etu Nayohana nkayeera, “Mii kinoubatiizani ni maashi, nansho ntu mmoka noowa ri mulhupalhe ukipwaha mii kihinooriaka inakhalhaka uthapulha miripwe cho iratu chawe. Yoyo noowa uubatiizani wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku ni mooro. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yoyo hanaa ithelho mmoononi yo ukhungurelha cholhia, akwechaka ipuwa awe yo weepettelha ni uthokoreria ingaano nnikhupini, ni upaha iphepuwa vamooroni vahintiphiaa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Paahi etu, vamoka ni meettuchiho o Malhove Orera makina menchi, Nayohana ahaakurumicha attu urukunusha makhalhelho aya. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nansho Nayohana yahaachacheracha Amwene Naherode nlhatu no waathelha Naherodiya, aari ahanu a ahima aya ni mwaha wo uhilhoka mwinchi waapanga aya. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Paahi etu Naherode nkayaathepiha uwonya waya, nkayaavara Nayohana ni waattuka ujeerani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noobatiiziya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mako 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye vaamanlhe aya ubatiiziya, Yesu ni uyo ahobatiiziya. Vaari awe anlhapelhaka Nlhuku, irimu nkachaahulhia, <verse number="22" style="v"/>ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku aari ni iruttu thoko kaulha nkayankorwelha. Ni nlhove nkaneewiya ukhuma wiirimu niiraka, “Uwe phi Mwaamwanaka kinonttuna aka. Uhokichivelha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nihimo na Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu vaachokhonlhe awe ntheko mwaattuni, aari ni iyaakha makhumi mararu. Attu yaari amwaanyiheraka wiira aari mwaana a Nayusufu mwaana a Naheli, <verse number="24" style="v"/>mwaana a Namaatati, mwaana a Lawi, mwaana a Nameliki, mwaana a Nayanai, mwaana a Nayusufu <verse number="25" style="v"/>mwaana a Namatatiya, mwaana a ashinna Amosi, mwaana a Nanahumu, mwaana a Naesili, mwaana a Nanagai <verse number="26" style="v"/>mwaana a Namaathi, mwaana a Namatatiya, mwaana a Nasemeini, mwaana a Nayoseki, mwaana a Nayoda <verse number="27" style="v"/>mwaana a Nayoanani, mwaana a Nareesa, mwaana a Nazerubabeli, mwaana a Nashaltieli, mwaana a Naneeri <verse number="28" style="v"/>mwaana a Nameliki, mwaana a Naadi, mwaana a Nakosamu, mwaana a Naelimadamu, mwaana a Nanaeri <verse number="29" style="v"/>mwaana a Nayoshua, mwaana a Naelieza, mwaana a Nayorimu, mwaana a Namaatati, mwaana a Nalawi, <verse number="30" style="v"/>mwaana a Nasimeoni, mwaana a Nayuda, mwaana a Nayusufu, mwaana a Nayonamu, mwaana a Naeliakimu <verse number="31" style="v"/>mwaana a Namelea, mwaana a Namena, mwaana a Namatata, mwaana a Nanathani, mwaana a Adaudi <verse number="32" style="v"/>mwaana a Nayese, mwaana a Naobedi, mwaana a Naboazi, mwaana a Nasalmoni, mwaana a Nanashoni <verse number="33" style="v"/>mwaana a Naaminaadabu, mwaana a Naadimini, mwaana a Naarni, mwaana a Nahezironi, mwaana a Nafarisi, mwaana a Nayuda <verse number="34" style="v"/>mwaana a Nayakhobo, mwaana a Naisaka, mwaana a Aburahimu, mwaana a Natera, mwaana a Nanaahori <verse number="35" style="v"/>mwaana a Naserugi, mwaana a Nareu, mwaana a Napelegi, mwaana a Naeberi, mwaana a Nashela <verse number="36" style="v"/>mwaana a Nakainani, mwaana a Naarfakisadi, mwaana a Nashemu, mwaana a Anuhu, mwaana a Nalameki, <verse number="37" style="v"/>mwaana a Nametusela, mwaana a Nahenoko, mwaana a Nayaredi, mwaana a Namahalaleli, mwaana a Nakainamu <verse number="38" style="v"/>aari mwaana a Naenoshi, mwaana a Naseeti, mwaana a Adamu, aari mwaana a Nlhuku.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ulhikachiya wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2-13">Mako 1:2-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahokolhia Uyorodani nachanre Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nkaaholhelhiya ni Iphumu mpaka uthakoni, <verse number="2" style="v"/>waalhikachiye awe ni Nakare wo mahuku makhumi ncheshe. Mahuku onkhaye ayo ahottuka wo uhilhia ittu, paahi etu avireke yayo mahuku ayo nkaawolhiya ithalha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nakare nkaamwirelha, “Wakhalhaka uwe phi Mwaana a Nlhuku, ulheehereke etu wiira alha malhuku alha athathuwe nkatte.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaakhulha, “Malhove Matakatifu aneera, ‘Ntu khanlhama wo ulhia nkatte vekha.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nakare nkankusha tho mpaka vachulhu ni umwooniha imwene chonkhaye cho velhaponi va. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nakare nkeera, “Kinouvaha ikuru wo chilha imwene chonkhaye chi ni urera waya. Chonkhaye chi chiri mmathathani mwaka, kathananaka ummaha ntu kinowooria. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwakikhoromelhaka ni ukithimicha, chonkhaye chi chinookhalha chawinyu.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “iholhepiya, ‘Mwaathimicheke Athithi, Nlhuku inyu vekha aya ni uvara mitheko chaya!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nakare nkanrweeha mpaka Uyerusalemu vachulhu ishanja yo Inupa ya Nlhuku, nkeera, “Wakhalhaka uwe phi Mwaana a Nlhuku, paahi etu uthupeke mpaka vathi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera, ‘Nlhuku noolhehera minepa chawe chiwe chuwopolheni.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ni vawo tho aneera wiira, ‘Anoukushani mmathathani mwaya nhiwe mwaarakalha mmalhukuni.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaakhulha, “Iholhepiya, ‘Nhinlhikache Nlhuku, Athithi inyu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nakare amalheke unlhikacha Yesu wo kila iphiro, nkanhiya mpaka ikatema inothananiya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noochokholha ntheko awe Ugalilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mako 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu ahohokolhia Ugalilaya, ni ikuru yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku yaari vamoka ni uyo. Mwaha unomwaacha nkawaawanelha mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nkeettuchiha mu inupa chaya cho unlhapelha Nlhuku, nkaatotopelhiya ni attu onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookhotiya Unazareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mako 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Paahi etu Yesu nkaarwa Unazareti, iwani yonnuwenlhe awe, ni Nihuku no Wiittuwa nkaarwa u inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku thoko chaalhemalhenlhe awe. Nkeemelha ushoma Malhove Matakatifu <verse number="17" style="v"/>nkaavahiya nrapalha naalhepiye Malhove Matakatifu ni anamilhohi ashinna Isaya wiira ashome. Nkaapatakulha ni ushoma vakittu valhepiye wiira,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Iphumu ya Athithi uri vamoka ni mii,</para>
  <para style="q">ukhalhawaya ahokihika makhura wiira kaahimerie Malhove Orera amashikini.</para>
  <para style="q">Ahokiruma kihimiache uhiyereriya attu attukiye</para>
  <para style="q">ni woonihiya tho attu ahinoona,</para>
  <para style="q">ni woopolha attu anohuvihiya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>ni uhimiacha wiira ikatema ihaaya</para>
  <para style="q">Athithi vanohalha aya woopolha attu aya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu nkaavilhika ikitabu ni uhokolhosha wa namitheko aashunga, nkaakhalha vathi. Attu onkhaye wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku mmo nkayammweha wo miitho melhi paranda, <verse number="21" style="v"/>venre awe, “Alha Malhove Matakatifu alha ahotimira lhelho, thoko chinre inyu wo wiiwa kishomaka.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayaachivelhiya, nkayaashangacha wiiwa malhove o nnema aahimiacha awe. Nkayaakohanacha yeeraka, “Ana ulha kahiwena mwaana a Nayusufu ulha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nkeerelha wiira, “Kihochuwelha wiira nnookiirelha nlhikaaniho no wiira, ‘Namirete, wiilhamiheke umwanene.’ Ni ukiirelha tho kipangache chittu mwiiwilhe inyu kipangachaka Ukapenaumu.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye tho wiira, anamilhohi khanolhohiya uwannyaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nansho nkakiiweni, wo ikekhiaye, wahokhalha anankhwelhi enchi mwiilhaponi mu Israeli mwonkhaye mu ikatema i Naeliya, irimu vaattukiye aya, ni ipulha khayarumpe iyaakha taaru ni nusu ni ikuruna nkayaawanelha ilhapo yonkhaye. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ni Naeliya khayaarumiye wa anankhwelhi ariyoothe ahikhalhe anankhwelhi yaakhalha Userepta umwiinanoni ni ilhapo yo Usidoni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tho, yahaawo attu enchi yaawereiya makutulha mwiilhaponi mu Israeli Naelisha vaari aya anamilhohi, nansho khaawo ntu aalhamme ahikhalhe Nanaamani, ntu o Usiriya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye yaari inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku veewilhe aya chiicho, nkayaarushiya. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nkayeemelhacha, nkayankhweremiha uchereshere iwani ni unkusha mpaka vachereshere mwaako wiira ankakhelhe vathi wuuthi mwaako, <verse number="30" style="v"/>nansho nkaavira variyari aya ni urwaa.</para>
  <para style="s">Ntu o mashoka o unanara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mako 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaarwa Ukapenaumu, iwani yaari Ugalilaya, nkeettuchiha attu Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye yaari ashangaka chettuchiha awe, ukhalhawaya olhumacha wo ikuru. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nkaakhalha ntu o mashoka o unanara wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku mmo, akhuwelha chinene, <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Niuttekenlheni hii, uwe Yesu o Nazareti? Uwilhe unoomolha? Kihochuwelha chinre awo, uwe phi karumiya ntakatifu a Nlhuku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu nkoomolha nshoka no unanara nno, “Mmaalhe munkhume ulha ntu ulha!” Nshoka nkanammulhusha ntu ulhe vathi, nkanaathama wo hinrakalhiha. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayoomiya uwanoni olhumachaka ashineneru, “Ilha phi ishiyani vano? Wo machiri ni ikuru yolha ntu ulha nolhehera wiira mashoka o unanara, athamache, ni ayo anoothamacha!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mwaha wa Yesu nkawaawanelha kila vakittu velhaponi vawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhamiha attu enchi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mako 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu nkaathama wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku nkaakelha unupani wa Nasimoni. Wowo ahokohi aya Nasimoni yaari areta iruttu, Yesu nkaahimeriya. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nkaarwa vaathalhelhiye aya ni weemelha vachereshere ikori ni woomolha ureta waathame apwiyawe ayo. Ureta nkawaalhama, nkayaachokholha waaterekhelha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Uchechilho, attu yaari ni manyampwana aya yaawereia nkayaawiihacha areta ayo wa Yesu, ni uyo nkeesheracha miono chawe kila mmoka nkayaalhamacha. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mashoka o unanara ni ayo nkaayathamacha attu enchi, olhumachaka, “Uweva phi Mwaana a Nlhuku!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkoomolha mashoka o unanara wiira ahihokolhiache tho ni ayo khayoolhumanche tho, ukhalhawaya ahochuwelha wiira aari phi Kuristo Moopolhi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowiittuchiha wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mako 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Waashelhe waya Yesu ahothama vawani vawo, nkaarwa vakittu vaari awe yeekha. Attu khayaachokholha umwaavia, vaamwonne aya, nkayanchiichiha wiira hithame uwannyaya. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nansho nkeerelhacha, “Kihophwanelhiya uhimiacha Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku iwani chikina, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku kirumme wiira kipange yoyo ntheko uyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkaavira eettuchihachaka attu mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uyudea.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu noweehana Owiittucha o upachera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mako 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari neemenlhe vachengweni nttiya no Genesareti, attu vaathothokanacha aya uwa uwiiwelhelhani nlhove na Nlhuku. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkoona ikalhava pilhi vachereshere nttiya, ashinene yaari anakhuruwilhe alhokihachaka ittavi chaya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaawelha ikalhava imoka i Nasimoni, nkaalhepelha anene ayo wiira athame vachengweni vawo achusheriheke miholho vakani. Nkaakhalha nkalhavani mmo ni weettuchiha milhoko cha attu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Amalhiheke weettuchiha attu, nkeerelha Nasimoni, “Nchusheriheke ikalhava inyu mpaka variyari nttiya, mwarieke ittavi chinyu chiyo mwavare ihopa.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nasimoni nkayaakhulha, “Thithi, nihoshelhelhiha wo uhipatta ittu. Nansho wo nlhove ninyu, kinokoriaa ittavi vano.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Arieke ittavi mmaashini, nkayaarulha ihopa chinchi, mpaka ittavi waatameria upaphuwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nkayeehana ashikhunanaya yaari ikalhava ikina, awe aakaviha. Nkayaawacha, nkayaacharihacha ihopa ikalhava pilhi chonkhaye chaatameriaka utitimira mmaashini.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nasimoni Peturo voonne aya ikhumelhenlhe, nkayankhoromelha Yesu amwiirelhaka, “Nthame vawannnyaka va, Thithi! Ki ntu o uwonya mii!” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Napeturo anene vamoka ni ashikhunanaya nkayoomachiya uwanoni wo woona ihopa chinchi thoko chechiyo chaavarilhe aya chiyo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yaari chiicho ata u Nayakhobo ni Nayohana ashaana a Nazebedayo, akavihi nanaya Nasimoni. Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhoovache mwaatti, uchokholha lhelho va nnookhalha o woopolha attu.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nkayaapurulha ikalhava mpaka uchengweni, nkayaahiya kila ittu ni unttwara Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu o makutulha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mako 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nkayaakhalha wiira Yesu vaari awe iwani imoka ntu mmoka aawereiya makutulha ahomwoona, nkaawa wa Yesu. Nkeewulhusha makukhu ni unlhepelha Yesu, “Thithi, mwattunaka, nnowooria ukilhamiha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu nkookolha moono awe ni ummara ntu o makutulha uyo nkaamwiirelha, “Kihothanana, nlhameke etu!” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nkanlhehera ntu uyo wiira, “Nhirwee uhimiecheshani wa attu, nansho nrweeke mweechoniheke wa opochera ishaani, mwakumiheke isadaka inyu mwiittukurie wiira nholhama thoko chilheheriye aya ni ashinna Musa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nansho mwaha waapannge awe Yesu nkawaawanelha kila vakittu. Attu enchi nkayaathukumana uumwiiwelhelhani ni ulhamihiya mareta aya. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nansho nkaathama ni urwaa vakittu vo yekha awe, nkaakhalha wowo anlhapelhaka Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu o ririyacha moono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mako 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari eettuchihaka, Amafarisayo akina ni owiittuchiha Malhehero yaakhumme iwani cho Ugalilaya ni Uyudea ni Uyerusalemu, yaakhalhanche eewelhelhaka. Machiri a Athithi aari vamoka ni uyo wiira aalhamihe areta. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nkayaawa attu yankushilhe vankorini ntu o uririyacha iruttu, nkayaalhikacha unkelhiha mpaani mwaari awe Yesu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nansho attu chenre aya wo uchara, khayoonrie ukelha mpaani. Paahi etu, nkayankusha mpaka vachulhu nchaara, nkayaakhunulha nivatho wiira anvirihe ni ikori awe mpaka vaari awe Yesu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="5:19">Attu anomperetiha nreta vanchaarani</figure> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu vonne awe yoyo nrima aya uyo, nkaamwirelha ntu o ririyacha moono uyo, “Uhohiyereriya uwonya wao, mpwana aka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Owiittuchiha Malhehero ni Amafarisayo nkayaachokholha wiikoha ashineneru, “Ana phi mpani yolha nonlhava Nlhuku ulha! Nlhuku vekha awe phi nohiyerera uwonya!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu ahochuwelha ichuku chaya, nkeera, “Nlhatu waani wo uchukulhacha munrimani chiicho? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vaalhuwilhe vayi ana, wiira, ‘Uwonya winyu uhohiyereriya,’ ama wiira, ‘Munkweke nrweeke?’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kinowoonihani etu wiira, Mwaana a Ntu hanaa ikuru velhaponi va yo uhiyerera uwonya wa attu.” Paahi etu nkaamwiirelha ntu o moono wo uririyacha ulhe, “Kinoohimeriani wiira, munkweke, mwiirieke nkori inyu nhokolhieke uwani!” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vavawo vavawo ntu ulhe nkeemelha attu yoonaka, nkaakusha nkori waarupelha awe, nkaahokolhia uwannyawe, anthimichaka Nlhuku. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayaahalha malhaku mwaari! Aari yoovaka, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku yiiraka, “Nihoona chittu cho ushangiha lhelho!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noweehana Nalawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mako 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yamalhekeru, Yesu nkaakhuma vathe nkaamwona ntu aalhiviha ikhodi eehaniya Lawi, nakhanlhe vanupani vaalhiviha awe ikhodi. Yesu nkaamwiirelha, “Nkittware.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nalawi nkayeemelha, nkayaahiya kila ittu ni unttwara Yesu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yamalheke Nalawi nkayanterekhelha Yesu yolhia yo uchechilho, ni alheto yaalhalheiye yaari attu olhiviha ikhodi enchi aakhanlhe unlhiana Yesu vamoka ni attu akina. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Amafarisayo akina ni owiittuchiha Malhehero nkayaachukulha, nkayaakoha owiittucha a Yesu yeeraka, “Chani woonaka mwaatti nnolhia ni uwuria vamoka ni attu o ulhiviha ikhodi ni attu o uwonya?” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Attu arii akumi khanaavia abwana mganga, ihikhalhe areta phi naavia. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Akiwiilhe u weehanani attu anopanga chittu cho urera wiira akhorome, nansho attu o uwonya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo uttuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mako 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Attu akina nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Owiittucha a Nayohana anoottuka venchi ni ulhapelha, ni owiittucha a Amafarisayo anopanga chiicho, nansho owiittucha inyu anolhia ni uwuria.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani attu alhalheiye u arusini ahophwanelhiya uttuka abwana arusi anari vavawo? Mena! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nansho nihuku ninoowa abwana arusi vanowa aya uthamihiya, vavawo attu phi nowa aya aattuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimeria tho nna nlhikaaniho nna, “Khaawo ntu neesha imbaati yo naanano vachulhu ikuwo yoothalha. Eeraka chiicho, noothepiha ikuwo iyo waahuwa, ni imbaati iyo khinaathana ni ikuwo yo khalhayi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Chiicho khaawo ntu nohelha idivai yoochasha ntumpa wo nrapalha wo wuulhuvalha, ukhalhawaya idivai yoochasha iyo inoopwesha ntumpa uyo ni urihiaa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nansho, idivai yoochasha inohelhiya mu nrupa nkumi! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Khaawo ntu nothanana uwuria idivai ihinachasha amalhihaka uwuria idivai yoochasha. Attu aneera, ‘Ittu yo khalhayi phi nlhoka chinene.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo Nihuku no Wiittuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mako 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu aari etakachaka mmamatani Nihuku no Wiittuwa. Owiittucha awe nkayonthacha machashi o meelhe, nkayaatikitta ni ukhuura imbeyu chaya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Amafarisayo akina nkayaakoha, “Nlhatu waani upanga ittu ichiichihiye ni Malhehero wiira ihipangiye Nihuku no Wiittuwa?” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ana khannashoma yaapannge aya Adaudi ni ashikhunanaya vaawolhiye aya ithalha? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ahokelha Inupa ya Nlhuku, nkayaalha mikatte chaakumihiye isadaka wa Nlhuku, nkayaalhia, ni waakawelha ashikhunanaya. Mikatte chaachiichihiye ulhiya ni attu akina yaakhihale opochera ishaani vekha aya.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamalhiha eeraka, “Mwaana a Ntu phi Mwanene Nihuku no Wiittuwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ntu o moono wo ririyacha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16">Mako 3:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nihuku no Wiittuwa nikina, Yesu ahorwaa wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku ni wettuchiha attu. Ahokhalha mwommo ntu o moono wo uririyacha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Owiittuchiha Malhehero akina ni Amafarisayo nkayaavia nlhatu wo mwootheria wiira hotteka, paahi etu nkayammweha paranda yoone yakhalhaka nonlhamiha ntu uyo Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu ahochuwelha ichuku chaya nkaamwirelha ntu ulhe, “Munkweke mmweeke. Mweemelhe uholho unouno.” Nkeemelha nkaawa uholho. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkeerelha, “Kinoukohani mwaatti, Ikekhia ihu inaacha Nihuku no Wiittuwa inonilhehera nipangekeni lhelho? Upanga ittu yo urera ama yo uhilhoka? Woopolha ukumi wa ntu ama wiiva?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nkaaweha attu onkhaye yaari vavawo, nkaamwirelha ntu o moono wo uririyacha ulhe, “Wookolheke moono awo uyo.” Nkookolha, nkawaalhama nkawaakhalha nkumi tho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nansho attu yanvenga Yesu nkayaathunalhacha, nkayaakhalha ashineneru yaaviaka nlhatu wo umwiiriha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaathanlha akarumiya khumi ni elhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mako 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarwa umwaakoni ulhepelhani, nkaashelhelhiha wowo anlhapelhaka Nlhuku. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Waashelhe waya, nkeehanacha owiittucha awe ni waathanlha khumi ni elhi, ehanne awe akarumiya, <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nasimoni aavanhe awe nchina Napeturo ni ahima aya Naandorea ni Nayakhobo ni Nayohana ni Nafilipo ni Nabatolomayo <verse number="15" style="v"/>Namatayo ni Natomaso ni Nayakhobo ashaana a Alufayo ni Nasimoni eehaniya nnenchi <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nayuda mwaamwanaa Nayakhobo ni Yuda Isikariote, anthuminhe Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowiittuchiha ni waalhamiha attu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vaakhuruwilhe awe umwaakoni ni akarumiya awe, nkeemelha ni waaphwanya owiittuchiha awe enchi anathothokanne vamoka. Yayo yaari attu yaakhumme ilhapo cho Uyudea ni Uyerusalemu ni iwani cho umbwaani cho Utiro ni Usidoni, <verse number="18" style="v"/>aawachilhe umwiiwelhelhani ni uwa uulhamihiyani mareta aya. Attu yaahuvihiya ni mashoka o unanara ni ayo ahowaacha uulhamihiyani. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye yaari athananaka inakhalhaka uvara mwiinjiro wawe, ukhalhawaya machiri aari ankhumaka ni waalhamiha attu onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="s">Mpuha ni ihuzuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu nkaaweha owiittucha awe nkeera,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nhoreeriya mwaatti nnohuvelha unchuwelha Nlhuku va,</para>
  <para style="q">umwene wa Nlhuku phi wawinyu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nhoreeriya mwaatti nnowolhiya ithalha va,</para>
  <para style="q">ukhalhawaya nnoowa mwaawonihiya!</para>
  <para style="q">Nhoreeriya mwaatti nnonlha vano,</para>
  <para style="q">ukhalhawaya nnoowa mwaathiaa ni uteelhiya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Nhoreeriya mwaatti vanopangelhiya inyu ichimwa ni attu, okhotakani, oruwanakani ni uheulhacha nchina ninyu wiira nhopanga ittu yo uhilhoka wo nlhatu wo Mwaana a Ntu! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nteelhiyeke vanohalha aya ukhumelhelha yayo, ntapelhelheke wo ushangarara, ukhalhawaya wo ikekhiaye nhoshungeriya nttuvo nulhupalhe wiirimu. Kwaani ata manyaapwiiya aya aapannge chiicho, waapangelha anamilhohi a Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nansho nhothapana mwaatti attu o nhakhu va,</para>
  <para style="q">ukhalhawaya nhomalha upuha!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nhothapana mwaatti nnorupalha vano va,</para>
  <para style="q">ukhalhawaya nnoowa mwaawolhiya ithalha!</para>
  <para style="q">Nhothapana mwaatti nnothiaa vano va,</para>
  <para style="q">ukhalhawaya nnoowa mwonlha ni uthuthelha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Nhothapana mwaatti vanototopelhiya inyu ni attu, ukhalhawaya manyaapwiiya aya ahaapangelha chiicho anamilhohi o woothacha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Waattuna amalhaponi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Nansho kinouhimeriani mwaatti nnokiiwa va, mwaattuneke attu anoupangelhani ichimwa, <verse number="28" style="v"/>mwaalhapelhelheke ibarakha anoulhavani, mwaalhapelhelheke attu anoupangelhani ichimwa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ntu owaatakani nrama ninyu nimoka, munhiyereke owatekeni nikina no nayelhi nno, ntu othurulhakani nikoti ninyu, munhiyereke ni mwiinjiro winyu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ntu noovekelhani mummaheke, ntu akushaka nhakhu inyu nhintware wiira ohokolhoshereni. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Chineera inyu wo uthanana wiira mpangelhiye ni attu, mwaapangelheke ni ayo chiicho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mwaattunaka attu anouttunani vekha aya, nnohalha chani upochera nnema? Ata attu o uwonya anaattuna attu anaattuna aya! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mwapangaka moombone wa attu anoupangelhani moombone, chani nnohalha upatta chani ibarakha? Ata attu o uwonya aneera chiicho wa attu anaapangelha moombone! <verse number="34" style="v"/>Vavawo mwaashimihaka attu nnokhulhuvelha wiira anouhokolhosherani, nnohalha upatta chani ibarakha? Ata attu o uwonya anaashimiha attu anaahokolhoshera! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mena! Mwaattuneke amalhaponi inyu ni waapangelha moombone, mwaashimiheke nhikhulhuvelhaka uhokolhosheriya. Vavawo nnoowa mwaapatta nttuvo mwinchi, ni ukhalha ashaana a Nlhuku Mulhupalhe Chinene. Ukhalhawaya ri o uwiiha mpuha wa attu ahichuwenlhe ushukuru ni o unanara mirima. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nkhalheke attu o kiriri thoko Athumwaninyu chiri aya o ikiriri.”</para>
  <para style="s">Waahukumulha attu akina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-6">Mat 7:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Nhaahukumulhe attu akina, Nlhuku khanowa ohukumulhani, nhaakuphulhache attu akina, ni inyu nhiwe mwaakuphulhachiya, mwaahiyerereke attu akina, Nlhuku ohiyererekeni ni inyu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mwaavaheke attu akina, Nlhuku nouvahani ni inyu. Chiicho etu nnoowa mwaapochera wo winchiva chinene, nikaviho mmathathani mwinyu. Maphimelho inyu wa attu, phi maphimelho nnohalha inyu uphimelhiya ni Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimeria nna nlhikaaniho nna, “Ntu ohoona khanooria unholhelha ntu ohoona nanawe, eeraka chiicho, onkhaye elhi ayo anootumbuchira munlhikitini. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Khaawo owiittucha naapwaha owiittuchiha awe, nansho owiittucha amalhaka wiittucha phi nolhikaana awe ni owittuchiha awe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Nlhatuni etu no woona ikokholha nnithoni mwa nhima inyu uno nhoonaka nipattu niri nnithoni mwinyu mwaanene? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nnohalha wiira chani wa nhima inyu, ‘Nhima aka nkankani kuuthamihe ikokholha nnithoni mwao,’ nansho nhithamihaka nipattu niri nnithoni mwinyu mwaanene? Mwa anafiki inyu! Nthamiheke thoko nipattu nnithoni mwinyu, vavawo phi nohalha inyu wooria uthamiha ikokholha nnithoni mwa munninyu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwiri ni maphepu aya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:33-35">Mako 12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Mwiri wo ukonda khunemma pufia, mena mwiri wo uhikonda khunemma maphepu oombone. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mwiri uriwoothe unchuwania wo maphepu unemma aya, khavanooria urukulha ittini munrokani ama urukulha izabibu va mwiri wo miiwa. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ntu o nrima woombone nopanga mitheko choombone chiri munrimani mwawe, ntu o uhilhoka nopanga chittu cho unanara chiri munrimani mwawe. Malhaku anoolhumacha chittu chichanre munrimani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Atheki elhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Nlhatuni no ukiihana mii, ‘Thithi, Thithi,’ uno nhipangaka thoko chineera aka wo ulheherani? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ntu nokiweelha ni wiiwelhelha malhove aka ni uvarechesha Kinouhimeriani chiri awe. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nokhalha thoko ntu, notheka inupa awe, athipaka chinene ni utheka nsingi vamwalhani. Mwoolhoko nkawaapaphulha maashi ni ukhita inupa iyo nansho kayaatikhinyelhe, ukhalhawaya yaaholhipihiya vaathekiya aya. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nansho ntu riyoothe neewa malhove aka wo uhivarechesha, nokhalha thoko ntu notheka inupa awe wo uhithipa nsingi vathi, maashi atikhinyeke inupa iyo, yahowulhuwa phiyaru wo nkhito urrrr!”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha karumiya a nholhelhi o manyaasikari o Urumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu amalhiheke waahimeria attu yayo malhove onkhaye ayo, nkaarwa iwani yo Ukapenaumu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nholhelhi o manyaasikari o Urumi ahaana namitheko anttuna aya chinene, yoyo aari nreta chinene amwaatameriaka nookhwa.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="7:2">Nholhelhi a manyaasikari o Urumi</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nholhelhi uyo veewilhe aya mwaha wa Yesu, nkaaruma ashulhupalhe Ayahudi amwiirelhe awe anlhamiha namitheko awe uyo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkayaarwaa wa Yesu ni ummenda, ampepechaka wiira, “Yolha ntu ulha hophwanelhiya wiira mwankavihe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Noottuna ilhapo ihu, tho honikaviha utheka inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paahi etu Yesu nkaattukana. Vaari awe naatamenrie vawani, nholhelhi uyo nkaaruma attu anhimerie Yesu wiira, “Thithi, mii akiphwanelhiye wiira inyu nkelhe unupani waka, <verse number="7" style="v"/>phi nlhatu etu akoonrie uwa kimwanene uwiihanani. Mulhumacheke nlhove tu, namitheko aka noolhama. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mii kimwanene, ki ntu o ipilhi wa attu akina, kihanaa ikuru yo wemelhelha manyaasikari. Kamwiirelhaka mmoka, ‘Nrweeke!’ Khurwaaka, nkina kamwiirelhaka, ‘Nkaawa va!’ Khuwaaka, kaarumaka anamitheko aka, ‘Mpangeke ilha!’ Khupangaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu nkaashanga veewilhe awe nna nlhove nna, nkaarukunuwa ni weerelha attu anttwara ayo, “Kinohimia wiira, akinapacha woona nrima thoko ulha, ata mwiilhaponi mu Israeli mwonkhaye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Anamitheko nkayaahokolhiacha waarumiye aya ni umphwanya karumiya nreta ulhe nalhamme.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonhihimusha mwaana a anankhwelhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kaanyuma vakani, Yesu nkaarwa iwani yeehaniya Unaini, aattukanaka vamoka owiittucha awe ni mphingo mulhupalhe wa attu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vaaphiya awe wowo, nkaakumaana attu aarwaa unvithani ntu. Ntu aakhwilhe uyo aari mwammirawo o yekha wa anumwane, yaari anankhwelhi, avelhelhiyaka ni nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Athithi vonne aya anankhwelhi ayo, nrima waya nkawaakelhiya ihuzuni yo woonelha ikiriri anankhwelhi ayo, nkeerelha, “Nhunlhe.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nkaachushera, nkaapaapelha ikori yaatheshelhiye ntembo uyo, attu aawelhe ayo nkayeemelhacha. Yesu nkeera, “Mmirawo! Kinowiirelha wiira, wunkweke!” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mmirawo aakhwilhe uyo nkaakhalha ni uchokholha wulhumacha, Yesu nkanhokolhosha wa anumwane. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayoovacha chinene, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku, yiiraka, “Namilhohi a Nlhuku mulhupalhe honikhumelhelha! Nlhuku howa uwoopolhani attu awe!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yoyo mwaha waapannge awe Yesu uyo, nkawaawanelha ilhapo yo Uyudea yonkhaye ni ilhapo chaatamana aya.</para>
  <para style="s">Akarumiya ukhuma u Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Owiittucha a Nayohana nkayaahimeria Nayohana yoyo mwaha wonkhaye uyo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nayohana etu, nkaaruma owiittucha ya elhi arwee yaakohe Athithi wiira, “Chani inyuva phi alhe aahimiye ni Nayohana wiira, phi nowa ama naaweherereke akina?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Paahi vaaphilhe aya wa Yesu, nkayeera, “Nayohana Obatiiza ahoniruma nuukoheni wiira inyuva phi alhe aaromonlhe aya wiira haawo nowa ama nimmweherereke ntu nkina?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo Yesu aari aavahaka attu enchi nnema wo ulhamihiya mareta aya, ikwerere ni mashoka o unanara ni waattukulha miitho attu ohoona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nkaakhulha akarumiya a Nayohana wiira, “Nhokolhieke mwaahimerieke Nayohana chittu chonne inyu, attu ohoona anowoona, attu oheeta anoweeta, attu o makutulha anoolhamihiya, attu ohiiwa anowiiwa, attu akhwilhe anoohihimushiya ni attu anokwana anoohimeriya Malhove Orera. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ahoreeriya attu ahiri ni nipampa ni mii!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Owiittucha yaarumiye ni Nayohana vaathamanche aya, Yesu ahochokholha waahimeria attu mwaha unaacha Nayohana, “Vaarwelhe inyu u Nayohana uthakoni ulhe, mwaanyihera wiira nnokowoonani? Nthalhe utikhinyiyaka ni iphioo? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mwaanyihera anoonieke chani? Thoko ntu warenlhe ikuwo chorera? Attu anowara chittu cho nthimicho ni ukhalha apuhaka yayo anokhalhacha uttato! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nkihimerieke etu, mwaakenlhe woonani? Woona anamilhohi a Nlhuku? Eiyo, nansho nkamwoona chaathempe anamilhohi a Nlhuku. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya Nayohana phi alhe ahimiye ni Malhove Matakatifu wiira, ‘Nlhuku heera, Kinonruma karumiya aka oholhelheni akooroshe iphiro inyu.’ ” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera tho, “Nayohana phi olhupalhe waapwaha attu onkhaye apanche ukhalha velhaponi va. Nansho ntu ri mwankani nhina Imwene ya Nlhuku phi mulhupalhe waapwaha Nayohana Obatiiza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayaamwiwa, attu aalhiviha ikhodi nkayaarumelhelhacha ni utotopelha mitheko choombone cha Nlhuku, akhalhaka phi attu yaapochenre ubatiizo u Nayohana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nansho Amafarisayo ni owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ahokhotacha unrumelhelha Nlhuku, ni ukhota ubatiiziya ni Nayohana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera tho, “Vano etu, kinohalha ulhikaaniha ni ittu yaani ilha iyari ilha? Attu aya ari thoko chani? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ari thoko ashimirawo aakhalhanche mmapuwani nnopangiya maronda ni wiichiirelha ashineneru, ‘Nahowopelhani ikoma nansho khamwenne! Naheepa ichipo cho nunlhiho nansho khamwonlhilhe!’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nayohana Obatiiza yahowa, ahottuka, khaawunrie idivai, mwaatti nkamweera, ‘Mmwooneke, ri ni nshoka no unanara!’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mwaana a Ntu nkaawa, nkaalhia ni uwuria, ni mwaattiva nkamweera, ‘Nkamwooneni yolha ntu ulha! Ntu o menyekha ni uhapalhiya, mpwana aya attu anolhiviha ikhodi ni attu o uwonya!’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Irusho cha Nlhuku, inakhalhaka chiicho, chinohimiecheshiya wiira cho ikekhia ni attu anrumelhelha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vawani va Nasimoni Afarisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Afarisayo yahonlhalhia Yesu wiira alhie yolhia vamoka ni ayo, nkarwaa uwannyaya nkaakhalha ulhia yolhia. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yeyo iwani iyo ahokhalha opani amoka aapangacha chittu cho uhilhokalhoka. Nkayeewa wiira Yesu aari alhiaka yolhia wa Afarisayo, nkayaakusha ichupa yo malhuku o alabasta yaachanre makhura o unukhelha <verse number="38" style="v"/>nkayeemelha amwaatameriaka Yesu uno onlhaka, nkayaammorihelha miithori chaya, vamietoni. Nkayaapoholha ni ikharari mmuruni, nkayaanukhanukha, nkayanhikahika makhura o unukhelha ayo. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Afarisayo ayo vonne aya, nkayeera munrimani mwaya, “Ulha ntu ulha akaari namilhohi, anochuwelha chiri aya alha opani anommarakacha alha, aanachuwelha chiri aya ntu o uwonya!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu nkoolhumacha eeraka, “Nasimoni, kihanaa nlhove no uhimeriani.” Afarisayo nkayaakhulha, “Aye, Owiittuchiha, nkihimerieke.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Ahaawo attu elhi yaashimme nchurukhu wa ntu. Mmoka aashimme nchurukhu idinari imia nthanu ni nkina aashimme nhakhu idinari makhumi nthanu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Attu ayo voochenlhe aya ulhiva, aheehanacha ni waahiyerera milhatu chaya onkhaye. Paahi etu, wa yayo attu elhi ayo, phuuyi nohalha waattuna chinene attu aashiminhe nchurukhu alhe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nasimoni nkayaakhulha, “Mii kinoona wiira, ntu aahiyereriye nchurukhu mwinchi ulhe, phi nohalha unttuna chinene yoyo ntu uyo.” Yesu nkeera, “Vavawo nhohukumulha rata.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nkaarukunuwelha opani alhe nkeerelha Nasimoni, “Nnoowona alha opani alha? Vaawilhe aka unupani winyu, khamwaakivanhe maashi o ukhucha mieto chaka, nansho alha opani alha ahokikhuchiha inyaa ni miithori aya nkayaapoholha ni ikharari chaya. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Khankipochenre rata ni ukibuusu, nansho alha ikatema yonkhaye ari vaa vamoka ni mii. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Khankivanhe makhura o wiihika mmuruni, nansho alha ahokootiha makhura o unukhelha mmietoni. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wiira, uttuna woninhe aya uhaapanga ahiyereriye uwonya waya wonkhaye. Nansho nohiyereriya makani, yoyo nottuna vakani.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha opani alhe, “Nhohiyereriya uwonya winyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Attu akina yaakhalhanche vayolhiani vawo, nkayoolhumacha ashineneru, “Phi ntu ani yolha, naahiyerera attu o uwonya ulha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeerelha opani alhe, “Nrima inyu uhowoopolhani, nrweeke wo mpuha.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Manyopani anttukana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Athameke vavawo, Yesu ahorwaa nkwaha wo mmawani ni ittoko ahimiachaka Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku. Akarumiya awe khumi ni elhi yaari anttukanaka. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tho, akina yaari manyopani oomolhelhiye mashoka o unanara ni Yesu ni ulhamihiya mareta aya. Yayo phi anganya Amariamu eehaniya Magidalena, omolhelhiye mashoka saba, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nayoana mahanu a Nakuuza attu aapanga ntheko upuwani u Naherode, Asusaana ni manyopani enchi akina aakumiha nhakhu waya unkavihera Yesu ni owiittucha awe.</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no namwaalha imbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mako 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Milhoko cha attu nkachaarwa wa Yesu chikhumaka iwani imoka baada ye ikina. Vaari aya anachanre, Yesu nkaahimeria nna nlhikaaniho nna,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Ahokhalha ntu mmoka aarweelhe uwaalhani imbeyu cho meelhe. Vaalha awe aari amichaka, nkachaakhalha chaamonre vaphironi, nkachaanyikalhachiya na attu, ni ashinuni o wiirimu nkayaalhiacha. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Chikina chaamorenlhe vamwalhani, vaamenlhe aya nkachaanyalha, ukhalhawaya ittaya khayaari ni maashi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Imbeyu chikhwawe chaamorenlhe vaari ittaya yoombone, chahomelha ni utiyelhelhiya ni miiwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Chikina chaamorenlhe vachaayirani chinene, minyepu nkachonnuwa ni uyara meelhe, kila nchashi imbeyu imia imoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaamalhiha eeraka, “Ri ni maaru eeweke!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ulhamulhiya malhikaaniho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mako 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe nkayankoha Yesu maana o yayo malhikaaniho ayo, <verse number="10" style="v"/>ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Irusho cho uchuwelha chittu cho Imwene ya Nlhuku nvahiye mwaattiva, nansho attu akina yayo anohalha uchuwelha wo malhikaaniho, vano anooweha nansho khanoona, anowiiwa nansho khanowa aachuwelha.</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no ntu o waalha imbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mako 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Maana o nlhikaaniho nno phi wiira, imbeyu phi nlhove na Nlhuku. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Imbeyu chaamonre vaphironi chinooniha attu aneewa, nansho Nakare noowa ni ukusha nttenga uyo mmamirimani mwaya wo waachiichiha wiira ahirumelhelhe ni woopolhiya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Imbeyu chaamonre vamwalhani chinooniha attu aneewa nttenga ni upochera ateelhiyaka munrimani. Nansho khachinkhalha ni mithithaari nhina mwaya, anorumelhelha wo ikatema ikani, ni ulhikachiya wawaakaru anowulhuwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Imbeyu chaamonre vamiiwani chinokhalha phi attu onkhaye aneewa, nansho nipampa ni nikakata ninowaakelha ni waatiyelhelha wiira ahiyare. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Imbeyu chaamorenlhe vachaayirani chinooniha attu aneewa nttenga ni upochera wo nrima worera, ni ayo khuvilhelhaka mpaka vanoyara aya maphepu oombone.</para>
  <para style="s">Ikhandiri ni ittutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mako 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Attu khanoparihelha ikhandiri ni ukhuneelha ittutu ama weesha nkhwikwichiri. Nansho anothomia vachulhu ikiango, wiira attu yoone nthuko aya uyo amwalheelhiye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Ittu iriyoothe ivithiye inowa yaawiihiya voonene, ni ittu iriyoothe ikhuneelhiye inowa yaapatakulhiya ni uwiihiya voonene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Nhiittialhe, mmweheke rata chittu chineewa inyu chiyo, ukhalhawaya attu ari ni ittu anowunchereriya, nansho attu ahirina ittu, ata ikani anaanyihera aya wiira ahanaa iyo inookushiya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Anumwanawe ni ashihima awe Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mako 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vavawo anumwanawe Yesu vamoka ni ashihima awe nkayaawa, nansho ahoochelha umwaatameria wo nlhatu no uchara attu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ntu mmoka nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Anumwaninyu ni ashihima inyu arii vathe vawo anothanana uwoonani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Anumwanaka ni ashilhoko aka ari phi attu onkhaye aneewelhelha malhove a Nlhuku ni uvarechesha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noomaalhiha iphioo munttiyani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mako 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Yesu ahowelha nkalhavani owiittucha awe nkayanttwara, nkeerelha, “Nngwee nilhapuwe nttiya nirwee ukhopelhelhe.” Paahi etu nkwaha nkawaachokholha. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mphironi, Yesu ahowolhiya ikhove nkaarupa. Vahipinche, iphioo yo machiri nkayaawuka munttiyani, ikalhava nkayaachokholha uchara maashi, ni attu onkhaye yaari ntatakoni. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Owiittucha nkayanrwelha ummushani, yeeraka, “Owiittuchiha, Owiittuchiha! Niri ntatakoni!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkonkwa ni umaalhiha iphioo ni iyo nkayaamaalha, nttiya nkanaakhalha shiriri. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nkaakoha owiittucha, “Uri vayi nrima inyu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nansho yaari anoomiye uwanoni yoovachaka, yeerelhanaka ashineneru, “Phi ntu ani yolha? Nochachera iphioo ni mawimbi wiira chimaalhe, ni chiyo chinomwiiwelhelha!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowoomolha mashoka o unanara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mako 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu ni owiittucha awe nkayaaphiya iwani yo Ugerasi, inowehana ni nttiya no Ugalilaya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vaakhuruwa awe umbwaani, nkankumaana ntu mmoka o mashoka o unanara. Wo iyaakha chinchi, yoyo ntu uyo aari eetaka wo uhiwara ikuwo hikhalhaka uwani, alhokelhaka umahiyeni. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vaamwonne awe Yesu, nkaakhuwelha, eewulhushaka vamietoni vawe, ni ukhuwelhacha, “Yesu, Mwaana a Nlhuku Mulhupalhe Chinene! Unothanani uwannyaka? Kinoulhepelha wiira, uhikoomolhe!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>olhumacha chiicho ukhalhawaya Yesu ahoolhumacha nlhove no ulhehera uthama nshoka nno. Ni nenno nshoka nno naari nimmaraka ikatema chinchi, ata vaattukiya awe mittondoro wiira heetakache aari akwatulhachaka, attawihiyaka ni nshoka no unanara nno wiithuphini.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu nkankoha, “Nchina ninyu apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkaakhulha, “Nchina naka ‘Nlhoko,’ ” ukhalhawaya mashoka enchi aari anankenlhe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mashoka nkayanlhepelha Yesu wiira, hilhehere wiira oomolhelhiye unaminepa unohalha aya utwarushiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vavawo vakittu vawo vaari vahuwiyaka ikulhuwe, chilhiachaka umwakoni. Paahi mashoka nkayanlhepelha Yesu wiira aahiye akelhe nkulhuweni, ni uyo nkaahiyerera. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mashoka nkayankhuma ntu ulhe ni ukhelha nkulhuweni. Mphingo wonkhaye wo ikulhuwe nkawaattawelha vathi uhito ni ukelha chititimiraka mmaashini.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Attu yaahuwacha ikulhuwe ayo nkayaattawacha, vonne aya ittu ikhumelhenlhe, ni urwaa uwanelhihani mwaha uyo mmawani ni mmamatani mwonkhaye. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Attu nkayaawa yoone chikhumelhenlhe. Vaaphilhe aya wa Yesu, nkayamphwanya ntu aakumihiye mashoka nakhanlhe vamietoni va Yesu, nawanre ikuwo ni irusho chinankhanlhe rata mmuruni, attu onkhaye nkayoovacha. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Alhe yonne, nkayaahimiachera akhunanaya chinre awe wo ulhamihiya mashoka wa ntu ulhe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Attu o iwani yo Ugerasi ayo nkayoovacha chinene. Nkayanlhepelha Yesu wiira athame. Paahi etu nkaawelha ikalhava nkaathama. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ntu aalhamihiye mashoka ulhe ahonlhepelha Yesu wiira, “Ni mii nkittukane.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nansho Yesu nkankhotelha, amwiirelhaka, <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Nhokolhieke uwani mwahimieke chipangelhiye inyu ni Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ntu uyo nkaavira mmawani ahimiachaka chinre awe wo upangelhiya ni Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Abiti Yairo ni nthiyana mmoka anoolhamihiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mako 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu vaahokolhelhe awe ukhopelhelhe nttiya, attu yahompochera, ukhalhawaya yaari ammwehereraka. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Paahi ntu eehaniya Yairo nkaawa, aari nholhelhi neemelhelha inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku. Nkeewulhusha makukhu ammekelhaka Yesu wiira arwee uwannyawe, <verse number="42" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya mwaamwanaya o vekhawe, mwamwalhi o malhipa o iyaakha khumi ni pilhi aari nnookhwani.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu vaari awe arwaaka, attu yaari anthothokelhaka uno ni uno. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mmoka aya aari opani amoka aawereiya ireta yo ukhuma iphome, nchorochoro wo iyaakha khumi ni pilhi, amalhihaka nhakhu aya uvira mmireteni, nansho ahilhamaka. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nkayanttwara Yesu utulhi, nkayaavara ikuwo awe, iphome nkayaamaalha vavawo vavawo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha, “Apani akivanre?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kila ntu nkaakhota, ni Napeturo nkayeera, “Owiittuchiha, attu ahourukureriani uno ni uno!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Hawo ntu kivanre, kihochuwelha ukhalhawaya machiri ahokikhuma.” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Opani alhe vonne aya wiira khanooria wiivitha, nkayeewiha uno athukhumelhaka ni wiiwulhusha vamietoni va Yesu. Nkayeehimiacha vaattuni vawo, ahimiachaka nlhatu waani wo uvara mwiinjiro ni chinre aya wo ulhama ikwerere aya. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Mwaamwanaka, nrima ao uhoolhamiha. Urweeke wo mpuha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu voolhumacha awe chiicho, karumiya aya o weemelhelha inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku nkaawa, nkeerelha, “Mwamwalhi inyu hokhwa, nhaahuvihe tho Owiittuchiha ayo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeewa, nkeerelha Nayairo, “Nhoove, mpisheke nrima, noolhama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Vaaphilhe aya vanupani, nkaachiichiha ntu unkelhana mpaani ahikhalhe Napeturo ni Nayohana ni Nayakhobo ni manyanaangoro o mwalhi uyo. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kila ntu vavawo aari onlhaka umunlhelha mwalhi uyo. Yesu nkeera, “Umaalhiye uhuunlhiye. Mwalhi ulha kanakhwa, howiraka urupa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayanthiacha, ukhalhawaya yaari achuwelhaka wiira hokhwa. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkammara moono nkeera, “Mwalhi, wunkweke!” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Nrima awe nkawanhokolhelha, nkonkwa, Yesu nkaalhehera wiira avahiye yolhia. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Manyanaangoro awe yaari anashannge, nansho Yesu nkaalhehera wiira ahinhimerie ntu riyoothe mwaha ukhumelhenlhe.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaaruma owiittucha khumi ni elhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkeehana owiittucha khumi ni elhi alhe, nkaavaha machiri ni ikuru yo woomolha mashoka o unanara ni waalhamiha areta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Paahi nkaaruma yayo khumi ni elhi ayo avire ahimiachaka Imwene ya Nlhuku, ni waalhamiha areta onkhaye. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nkeerelhacha, “Nhikushe ittu iriyoothe munkwahani, nhiwie ikopo mena nrupa mena mashurupu mena nchurukhu, ni mena mmoka inyu hikushe mwiinjiro wo nayelhi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inupa iriyoothe inohalha inyu upocheriya iyo, mwakhalheke vavawo mpaka vanohalha inyu uthama vawo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vahinopocheriya uhimiechesha winyu, mwathameke yeyo iwani iyo ni ukukutta ntukurukhu nnyaani wo waamuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Owiittucha nkayaathamacha nkayaarwa mmawani, ahimiachaka Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku ni waalhamiha attu awereiya.</para>
  <para style="s">Nipampa ni Naherode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mako 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Naherode Amwene o Ugalilaya veewilhe aya chittu chaapangiaa, nkayoova, ukhalhawaya attu akina yeera wiira Nayohana Obatiiza ahohihimmwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Attu akina eera wiira Naeliya ahoonia, akina yiiraka anamilhohi o khalhayi ahohihimmwa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Naherode nkayeera, “Nayohana kihaahitha, nansho ulha ntu kinomwiiwaaka ulha phi mpani?” Nkayaathanana umwoona Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhiha attu maelufu nthanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoha 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Akarumiya yahokolhieke, nkayanhimeria Yesu kila ittu yaapannge aya. Nkaakushacha nkayaarwa iwani yo Ubethsaida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Attu vanchuwenlhe aya, nkayanttwara. Nkaapochera, nkoolhumacha mwaha wo Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku, ni waalhamiha mareta yaarina aya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nchuwa veelha aya, akarumiya khumi ni elhi nkayanrweelha ni unhimeria wiira, “Mwaahiyeke attu ayo ahokolhiacheke uwannyaya ni uvira yaaviaka yolhia mmawani ni mmamatani, yaavie yolhia ni mapuro o urupa, ukhalhawaya vari ihu va vauthakoni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Mwaavaheke yolhia mwaattiva.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaakhulha, “Ittu nirina ihu iri mikatte nthanu ni ihopa pilhi. Chani nirweeke nathumeke yolhia yo waavaha attu onkhaye alha?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Attu yaari vavawo aari alhopwana maelufu nthanu.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Mwaakhalhiheke attu vathi milhoko cha attu makhumi nthanu kila nimoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Owiittucha yamalheke waakhalhiha attu mmapuroni, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakusha mikatte nthanu ni ihopa pilhi, nkaaweha wiirimu, nkalhapelhelha ibarakha, nkaamianihacha, nkaavaha owiittucha yaakawelhe attu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayaalhia, nkayaawonacha, ni owiittucha nkayaarokottacha mahalhahalha aahanlhe, nkayaachariha ni ukusha makaya khumi ni melhi.</para>
  <para style="s">Napeturo anonhimiechesha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mako 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari alhapelhaka vekha awe, owiittucha nkayaawacha, nkaakohacha, “Ana attu aneera mii phi mpani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nkayaakhulhacha yiiraka, “Akina aneera, Nayohana Obatiiza, akina aneera Naeliya, ni akina aneera inyuva mmoka a anamilhohi o khalhayi hihimmwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nkaakoha, “Ni inyu mwaatti chani, nneera mii phi mpani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Napeturo nkayaakhulha, “Inyuva phi Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonhimiacha nookhwa awe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mako 8:30-9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaachiichiha wiira ahinhimiachere ntu riyoothe yoyo mwaha uyo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nkaahimeria tho, “Mwaana a Ntu nowa utwarushiya ni ukhotiya ni ashulhupalhe ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero. Noowa eeviya nansho nihuku no neraru nowa uhihimmwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nkeerelha attu onkhaye, “Ntu riyoothe nothanana ukittwara eeruneke mwanene, akusheke nsalaaba awe kila nihuku akittwareke, <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe nothanana woopolha ukumi awe, noopoteriha, nansho ntu riyoothe noriha ukumi awe wo nlhatu waka nowa woopolha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ntu nohalha upattani wo upatta mpuha wonkhaye wo velhaponi va, nansho apoterihaka ukumi awe mwanene? Mena khiiwo! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ntu oonaka ishoni wo nlhatu naka ni meettuchiho aka, Mwaana a Ntu ni uyo nowa umwoonelha ishoni vanohalha awe uwa wo nthimicho wa Athithi ni minepa chitakatifu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kinoohimeriani ikekhia wiira, ahawo akina vaa ahinowa aakhwa ahinaya woona Imwene ya Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorukunuwa ikhove</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mako 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yavireke ijuma imoka toka voolhumanche awe yayo malhove ayo, Yesu nkaakusha Napeturo ni Nayohana ni Nayakhobo nkayaarwaa umwaakoni ulhapelhani. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vaari aya alhapelhachaka, ikhove awe nkayaarukunuwa, ni ikuwo chawe nkachaateelha chinene. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nkoonia attu elhi amwaarerihanaka Yesu, ni ayo yaari ashinna Musa ni Naeliya, <verse number="31" style="v"/>aakhumelhenlhe wo nthimicho, nkaamwaarerihana mwaha wo umalhiha ntheko wa Nlhuku nnookhwani ukhumelhelha Uyerusalemu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Napeturo ni akhunanaya yaari anarumpe, yeyo ikatema nkayonkwa ni woona nthimicho wa Yesu ni attu elhi emenlhe vamoka ni uyo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Attu elhi ayo vaathama aya wa Yesu, Napeturo nkeera, “Owiittuchiha, ihorera hii ukhalha vaa! Ninootheka etu mahema mararu, nimoka nawinyu nikina na ashinna Musa ni nikina ni Naeliya.” We ikekhiaye khayaari achuwelhaka inoolhumacha aya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Napeturo voolhumacha aya, nihute nkanaakhuruwa ni waakhuneelha, vaawa aya owiittucha alhe yaari yoovaka chinene. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nlhove nkaneewiya ukhuma wiirimu neeraka, “Ulha phi Mwaamwanaka, kinonttuna aka, mmwiiwelhelheke yoyo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nlhove vaamaanlhe aya, Yesu aari vekha awe. Owiittucha nkayaamaalha wo unhihimeria ntu riyoothe yoyo mwaha uyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowoomolha mashoka o unanara ammanre mwammirawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mako 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Waashelhe waya Yesu ni owiittucha araru ahokhuruwa umwaakoni, ni nlhoko mwinchi wa attu nkawankumaana Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vavawo, ntu mmoka nkaakhuwelha, “Owiittuchiha! Kinoulhepelhani chonte mummwehe mwanaka, mwanaka o yekha awe! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nshoka ninonkelhakelha, khummulhushaka venchi, khukumaka niphoru mmwano, khunhuvihachaka chinene wo uhinhiya! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kahaalhepelha owiittucha inyu wiira oomolhe nshoka nno, nansho khayonrie.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwaatti iyari ihiri ni nrima, iwonnye va! Kinohalha ulhokelha ni uvilhelhani mpaka iyaakhani?” Nkeerelha athumwanawe mwaana ayo, “Mummwiiheke mwaamwaninyu uyo vaa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mwaana vaawihiya awe, nshoka no unanara nkanammulhusha vathi ni unhelha ichilhichilhi. Yesu nkaachachera nshoka nno, mwaana nkaalhama, nkanhokolhosha wa athumwanawe. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayoomiya uwanoni woona ikuru chulhupalhe cha Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonhimiacha tho nookhwa awe.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mako 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Attu yaari ashangaka chittu chonkhaye chaapangiye ni Yesu, venre awe wo owiittucha awe, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Mwiiwelhelheke alha kinohalha aka uhimeriani! Mwaana a Ntu nokelha uhelhiya mmathathani mwa attu.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nansho owiittucha khayaachuwenlhe yaahimia awe, ukhalhawaya yaari inavithiye uwannyaya. Nkayoova unkoha maana aya.</para>
  <para style="s">Mpani ri mulhupalhe aya?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-4">Mat 18:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mako 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nkawaachokholha ukohaniya owiittucha ashineneru wiira phi mpani ri mulhupalhe aya. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu nkaachuwelha choopuwelha aya munrimani, paahi etu nkankusha mwanhima, nkaamweemesha vaari aya, <verse number="48" style="v"/>nkeera, “Ntu riyoothe nompochera mwanhima thoko ulha wo nchina naka nokipochera mii, ni ntu nokipochera mii, naapochera akirumilhe. Ukhalhawaya ri mwankani waapwaha onkhaye munlhokoni mwinyu, yoyo phi mulhupalhe inyu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Hinoovengani yoyo ri vamoka ni inyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mako 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nayohana nkayoolhumacha, “Owiittuchiha, nahomwoona ntu oomolhaka mashoka wo nchina ninyu, nkananchiichiha, ukhalhawaya khari nyu ninonttukana ihu vamoka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhichiichihe, ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe hinoovengani yoyo ri vamoka ni inyu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwani ya Asamariya inonkhota Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ikatema vaatamenrie aya ukushiya Yesu wiirimu, nkoona mbaya arwee Uyerusalemu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Nkaaruma akarumiya anholhelhe, arwee Usamariya akooroshe vakittu vanohalha awe uphiyelha. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Nansho anenchi o Usamariya ahokhota umpochera ukhalhawaya aari alhukamaka Uyerusalemu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Paahi etu owiittucha Nayakhobo ni Nayohana vonne aya chiicho, nkayeera, “Thithi, chani niihaniheke mooro wo wiirimu naamalhihe yalha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarukunuwa ni waachachera. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaathama mwanene vamoka ni owiittucha awe nkayaarwaa iwani ikina.</para>
  <para style="s">Aphwanelhiye ukhalha owiittucha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Vaari aya munkwahani, ntu mmoka nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Kinouttwarani uriwoothe unohalha inyu urwaa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwaakhulha, “Anancheto ahana milhiwi ni ashinuni o uchulhu urimu ahanaa iphuuru chaya nansho Mwaana a Ntu kharina nipuro no waathalhelha muru awe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Nkaamwirelha ntu nkhwawe, “Nkittware.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nansho ntu ulhe nkeera, “Thithi, nkihiye thoko kirwee kaavithe athumwanaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, nkeerelha, “Mwaahiyeke attu akhwilhe yaavitheke attu aya khwilhe. Inyu nrweeke mwahimiacheke Imwene ya Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Ntu nkina nkeera, “Thithi kinouttwarani, nansho nkihiye thoko kalhehe uwani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Ntu riyoothe nolhima uno awehaka utulhi, yoyo khanooria ittu nhina Imwene ya Nlhuku.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaaruma akarumiya makhumi saba ni elhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yamalheke yayo, Athithi nkayaathanlha akina makhumi saba ni elhi, nkaaruma elhielhi arwee aholhelhe kila iwani ni kila vakittu vaathanana awe urwaa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkeerelhacha, “Nlhaalha uri mwinchi, nansho anamitheko o ukhungura ari vakani. Nlhepelheke etu anene nlhaalha yaawihe anamitheko oowa ukhungurani cholhia chaya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nrweeke etu! Kinourumani mwaattiva thoko ikhondoro umiichini. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nhikushe nchako wo nchurukhu mena nrupa mena iratu, nhinkohache ntu riyoothe mphironi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vanophiya inyu vawani, nchokholheke wo wiira, ‘Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu,’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Akhalhaka haawo ntu noopocherani mwommo, nhiyeke mpuha inyu vavawo, aahikhalheke, nhokolhosheke mpuha inyu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwakhalheke vavawo, mwalhieke ni uwuria ittu iriyoothe nnohalha inyu uvahiya, ukhalhawaya namitheko hophwanelhiya malhivo. Nhikelhe mwaakukuriacha uno ni uno. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwaphiyaka vawani mpocheriyaka, nlhieke yolhia nterekhelhiye inyu iyo, <verse number="9" style="v"/>mwaalhamiheke areta ni waahimeria attu o wowo wiira, ‘Imwene ya Nlhuku ihaatameria.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nansho mwaphiyaka vawani vahinopocheriya inyu, nthameke, ni vanovira inyu mmaphironi mwaya mweereke, <verse number="11" style="v"/>‘Ata ntukurukhu no vawani winyu ninivanre nnyani nno, ninookukutta vano wooniha wiira nihouhiyerani mwaashinene! Nansho nchuwelheke wiira, Imwene ya Nlhuku ihaatameria.’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye wiira, Nihuku no uhukumulhiya attu nno, inowa ukhalha ittu yo waalhuwa chinene wo iwani yo Usodoma uvilhelha ntwarusho upwaha yeyo iwani iyo!”</para>
  <para style="s">Uthapana iwani chihinorumelhelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu iwani yo Ukorazini! Nhothapana iwani yo Ubethsaida! Ukhalhawaya cho ushangiha chipangiye uwaninyu chikaapangiye Utiro ni Usidoni, attu yammwara majuniya ni wuupuruwa vaatuurani wooniha wiira ahokhoroma uhiya uwonya waya! <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nansho nihuku no ihukumu nno, inowa ukhalha ittu yo waalhuwa wo iwani cho Utiro ni Usidoni wooria uvilhelha ntwarusho naya upwahani mwaattiva. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ni inyu Nakapenaumu! Chani nnothanana wiiwelhiha mwaanene wiirimu? Nnoowa mwaawulhusheriya unaminepa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Ntu riyoothe nowiiwelhelhani, hokiiwelhelha mii, ntu riyoothe nookhottani nokikhota mii, ni ntu nokikhota mii naakhota akirumme.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uhokolhia makhumi saba ni elhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Makhumi saba ni elhi aarumiye alhe nkayaahokolhia, yaari anateelhiye chinene yeeraka, “Thithi, ata mashoka ahoniiwa vaaromonlhe ihu nchina ninyu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kahomwoona Nakare awulhuwaka thoko uverunya ukhuma wiirimu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwiiweke etu! Kihohuvahani ikuru, yo unyikalha inwaa ni makharang'andha ni ikuru yo unnyikalha mmalhaponi inyu ulhe, ihikhalhaka ittu cho uhilhoka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nansho nhiteelhiye ukhalhawaya nshoka nihowiiwani, nansho nteelhiyeke ukhalhawaya machina inyu aholhepiya wiirimu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nooteelhiya nrima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo, Yesu ahoteelhiya wo ikuru yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku nkeera, “Thithi, Athithi o wiirimu ni o velhaponi! Kinoushukuruni ukhalhawaya nhaavitha attu o irusho ulha mwaha ulha, nkamwaapatakulhelha akani. Aye, Thithi, phinre aya wo uchivelhani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nkeera tho, “Athithi ahokivaha chittu chonkhaye. Khaawo nchuwenlhe Mwaana ahikhalhe Athithi ni khaawo aachuwenlhe Athithi ihikhalhe Mwaana ni attu athanlhiye ni Mwaana wiira aapatakulhelhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarukunuwelha owiittucha awe nkaahimeria wo nivitho, “Nhoreeriya mwaatti ukhalhawaya miitho inyu ahoona chi chittu chinoona inyu chi! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wiira, anamilhohi a Nlhuku ni mamwene enchi yahothanana alha anoona inyu alha, ahoone ni wiiwa, nansho khayoonne, ahottuna wiiwa thoko mwaattiva nansho khayeewilhe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no Nsamariya orera nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Owiittuchiha Malhehero rata nkayaawa ni unkoha Yesu wo unlhikacha. “Owittuchiha, kipangekeni kipatte ukumi wo uhimalha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Malhehero alhepiye chani? Nnoshomani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yoyo ntu uyo nkaakhulha, “Munttuneke Nlhuku inyu wo nrima inyu wonkhaye ni nnepa inyu wonkhaye ni machiri inyu onkhaye ni irusho chinyu chonkhaye ni waattuna amwaatamana inyu thoko chineettuna inyu mwaanene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhaakhulha rata. Mpangeke etu ni ukhalha thoko chiicho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nansho ochuwelha Malhehero rata ayo nkayaathanana wiichooniha wiira aari ntu o nrima woombone, paahi ahonkoha Yesu, “Amwaatamana aka phi apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu mmoka aari alhukamaka Uyeriko akhumaka Uyerusalemu. Nkaavariya ni attu o uvara makhuche, nkayanrulha ikuwo, nkayanthurulha nhakhu awe nkayaamwata chinene, nkaahiya nakomweelhe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani amoka nkayaavira vavawo, nansho vaamwonne aya khayanlhohilhe, nkayaavira uchereshere. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Chiichammo, Nlawi mmoka nkaaphiya vavawo, nkaamwona nkaavira uchereshere. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nansho Nsamariya mmoka eeta munkwahani ahophiya vavawo, vaamwonne awe ahomwonelha ikiriri. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nkaamwaatameria, nkanhapiha makhwata, nkanhika makhura ni idivai ni unttukelha. Amalheke nkammwelhiha vachulhu iphuta awe, nkanrweha inupa ya alheto ammwerehe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Washeeke, nkaakumiha nchurukhu wo malhivo o mahuku melhi ummaha mwanene inupa ni umwiirelha, ‘Mummwereheke ntu ulha, ni ittu inohalha wunchereria kinoowa kaalhiva vanohalha aka uhokolhia.’ ” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaakoha, “Wo irusho chinyu inyuva, wo yayo attu araru ayo, phi mpani aari namwaatamana e ikekhiaye a ntu aatakachiye ni attu o uvara makhuche ulhe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ochuwelha Malhehero rata alhe nkayaakhulha, “Aari ntu amwonenlhe ikiriri ulhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkeera, “Ni inyu etu nrweeke, mwapangeke thoko chiicho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu uwani u Namatha ni Amariamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu ni owiittucha awe vaari aya munkwahani, yahophiya iwani yaapocherie awe uwani wa opani amoka eehaniya Namatha. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yayo yaari ni arokoraya eehaniya Amariamu, aakhanlhe vathi vamietoni va Athithi ni wiiwelhelha meettuchiho aya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Namatha nkayaathunalha woona wiira aapanga vekha aya ntheko wo waaterekhelha alheto, nkayaarwaa ni wiira, “Thithi, woonaka khannoona wiira arokoraka ayo ahokihiyera ntheko vekha aka? Mweerelheke aweeke aakikaviha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Athithi nkayaakhulha, “Namatha, Namatha! Nnothemwani. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ittu imoka tu phi renre. Amariamu ahothanlha ittu yoombone ihinooria uthurulhiya ni ntu riyoothe.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowiittuchiha ulhepelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari alhapelhaka vo vekha awe. Amalhiheke, owiittucha awe mmoka nkaamwirelha, “Thithi, nniittuchiheke ni hii ulhepelha, thoko chinre aya Nayohana wo weettuchiha owiittucha aya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Vanolhapelha inyu mwiireke,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Athithi nri wiirimu,</para>
  <para style="q">Nchina ninyu nithimichiye,</para>
  <para style="q">imwene inyu iwe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nnivaheke yolhia ihu kila nihuku.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nnihiyerereke uwonya wihu,</para>
  <para style="q">thoko nineera ihu wo waahiyerera anittekenlhe.</para>
  <para style="q">Nnoopolhe muulhikachiyani.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelhacha tho owiittucha awe, “Ikhalhe wiira mmoka inyu norwaa wa ampwana awe uhiyu variyari ni uhimia wiira, ‘Mpwana, nkaashimihe mikatte miraru, <verse number="6" style="v"/>alheto ahokiphwanya ampwana aka ari munkwahani, ni mii akirina ittu yo waavaha!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ni ayo anari mpaani nkayaakhulha, ‘Nthame uwo nhikihuvihe mii! Kihottia nlhako, mii ni achishaana aka nihokelha mpaani urupani. Paahi akinonkwa kiwe kouvahani ittu iriyoothe.’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inohalha wiiria chani etu? Kinouhimeriani ikekhia wiira khanoonkwa uwaavahani nkatte wo nlhatu no umpwana waarina aya, mena, nansho wo nlhatu no waanyakulha ni uthepa uvekelha, phi chiichammo chinohalha aya wunkwa ni waavaha ittu inovekelha aya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Paahi etu, Nvekelheke nnoovahiya, mwaavieke nnoopatta, nhodisheke vankhorani nnoohulhelhiya. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe novekelha noovahiya, ni ntu naavia noopatta, ni ntu nohodisha vankhorani noohulhelhiya. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Chani mwaana vanovekelha awe ihopa wa anaangoro awe, novahiya inwaa kuhiwe ihopa? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ama novahiya nikharang'andha vanovekelha awe nnyoche? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inakhalhaka nri attu o unanara mirima nansho nhochuwelha chittu choombone cho waavaha achishaana inyu. Chani etu, athumwaninyu o wiirimu khanouvahani chittu choombone wo upwaha, anowaavaha Iphumu ya Nlhuku attu anaavekelha!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Belzebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mako 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari omolhaka nshoka no unanara nantunke ntu huulhumache. Paahi etu vankhumme aya, ntu ulhe ahooria wulhumacha tho, mpaka nlhoko wa attu nkawoomiya uwanoni. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nansho attu akina nkayeera, “Noomolha mashoka wo ikuru yo Belzebuli, nholhelhi o mashoka o unanara, phi nommaha ikuru yo woomolha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Attu akina yaari athananaka unria Yesu, paahi nkayamwiirelha wiira apange cho ushangiha cho wiirimu oonihe wiira Nlhuku ri vamoka ni uyo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu ahochuwelha choopuwelha aya, nkeera, “Imwene iriyoothe imianelhe yaatakanaka ineeneru yeyo khinolhokelha chinene, chiicho iwani imianelhe yaatakanaka ineneru inowulhuwa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Paahi yakhalhaka etu imwene yo Nakare iheemianiha yaatakanaka ineeneru, inohalha ulhokelha chani? Mwaatti nneera wiira eti kinoomolha mashoka wo uvahiya ikuru ni Belzebuli. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka kinoomolha mashoka wo ikuru yo Belzebuli, owiittucha inyu etu anoomolha wo ikuru ya apani? Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu ashaana inyu mwaashinene phi nowa uhukumulhani mwaatti. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nansho yakhalhaka kinoomolha mashoka wo ikuru ya Nlhuku, nchuwelheke wiira Imwene ya Nlhuku ihomalha uphiya uwaninyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Ntu o machiri vanolhitelhelha awe inupa awe ni ikerero, inupa ni nhakhu awe chinoolhama. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nansho awaaka ntu o machiri chinene o mpwaha ni umwaata ni ummulhusha, yoyo nookusha ikerero chaakhulhuvelha awe chiyo ni umwaakha nhakhu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Ntu riyoothe hiri vamoka ni mii, yoyo nookivinga, hinokhungura vamoka ni mii yoyo phi noomwarusha.</para>
  <para style="s">Uhokolhia nshoka no unanara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nshoka no unanara vanoomolhiya aya mwiiruttuni mwa ntu, nivovira neetakachaka uhiri maashi naaviaka nipuro no wiittuwa. Naahooneke, vavawo phi neera aya, ‘Kinoohokolhia unupani waka.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Paahi noohokolhia ni uphwanya inupa mwaari inakwechiye ni urerihiya. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Paahi tho, phi norwaa aya ni waakusha mashoka makina saba o uhilhoka umphwaha uyo, ni uwa uukhalhani vamoka ni uyo. Vanomalha aya, ntu uyo nokhalha muuhuvani chinene upwaha khalhayi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mpuha we ikekhiaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu voolhumacha awe, opani amoka nkayeera, “Ahopuha athiyana uyanreni ni uwaamwiihani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nansho areeriye chinene, phi ayo aneewa nlhove na Nlhuku ni uvarechesha!”</para>
  <para style="s">Uvekelhiya cho ushangiha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nlhoko wa attu voonchereria aya, Yesu nkeera tho, “Ilha iyari ilha iri yo uhilhoka ilha! Inovekelha woona cho ushangiha, nansho khinoonihiya yo ushangiha iriyoothe ihikhalhe i Nayona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Chiichammo etu Nayona chenre aya wo waashangiha attu o Uninavi, phi chiichammo Mwaana a Ntu chinohalha awe waashangiha attu o ilha iyari ilha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nihuku no uhukumulhiya attu nno, Ahano o Usheeba anowa weemelha ni waahukumulha attu e ilha iyari ilha, ukhalhawaya ahovira toka utayi awe eewelhelha irusho chi Naselemani, ni mii kinohimia wiira vaa haawo Yesu, ntu mulhupalhe naapwaha Naselemani. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nihuku no uhukumulhiya attu, attu o Uninavi anowa weemelha waahukumulha attu o ilha iyari ilha wiira ahowonya. Ukhalhawaya attu o Uninavi ahokhoroma veewilhe aya meettuchiho a Nayona, nansho vaa hawo mulhupalhe naapwaha Nayona!</para>
  <para style="s">Nthuko wo iruttu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Khaawo ntu noparihelha ikhandiri awe ni ukhuneelha ittutu, nansho nothomia vachulhu ikiango wiira yaamwalhelhe attu anokelha mpaani. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Miitho inyu phi nthuko wo iruttu. Miitho inyu akhalhaka makumi, iruttu yonkhaye inokhalha voonene, nansho miitho awereiyaka iruttu yonkhaye inokhalha yo unanara, inokhalha mwiipiphini. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mwiiraniheke etu, nthuko uri nhina mwinyu uhikhalhe ipiphi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Paahi etu, iruttu inyu yonkhaye yakhalhaka voonene, wo uhikhalha mwiipiphini, iruttu inokhalha voonene thoko vanomwalhelhiya aya ni nthuko.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaakuphulhacha Amafarisayo ni owiittuchiha Malhehero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mako 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu amalhihekeru wulhumacha, Afarisayo amoka ahomwiirelha arwee alhie yolhia uwannyawe. Nkaarwa ulhiani yolhia, nkaakhalha ulhia. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Afarisayo ayo nkayaashanga woona wiira Yesu aari alhiaka wo uhinyawa mathatha rata. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Paahi Athithi nkayeera, “Mwaatti Amafarisayo va, nnohapiha ikahi ni iphache wo vatheru, nansho nhina ncharaka chittu cho nanrokotolhe chihinlhoka. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nhophupuwalha inyu ayi! Nlhuku phi kooronshe vathe ni nhina chiicho. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nansho mwaavaheke attu ahirina chittu chiri nhina, ni chikina chonkhaye chiyo chinookhalha chorera uwaninyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu Mwaamafarisayo va! Ukhalhawaya nnaahukumulha ni waalhiviha attu isadaka yo nifungu no khumi ata yo mathaakhuru o uhelhiya mmathapani, nchicha ni mathaakhuru makina, nansho nhilhohaka mwaha wo uvarechesha ikekhiaye ni uttuna wa Nlhuku. Yayo yaaphwanelhiye wooniya wiira nhovarechesha rata nhilhiyalhaka makina ayo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu Mwaamafarisayo va! Mwaatti nnottuna ukhalha miholho mapuro o nthimicho wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku ni ukohachiya wo nthimicho vanopangiya maronda. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nhothapana inyu! Mwaatti nri thoko mahiye o uhichuwania, attu aneeta aya vachulhu waya ahichuwelhaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa amoka nkayaamwiirelha, “Owiittuchiha, venre inyu chiicho, nhoniruwana!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nhothapana ni inyu Owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa va! Nnaaria attu misigo cho ulhemelha, nansho mwaanene nhookolhaka nikokho nhaakavihaka ukusha chechiyo misigo chiyo. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nhothapana inyu! Ukhalhawaya nnoovaka mahiye a anamilhohi a Nlhuku eevakachiye ni manyaapwiinyu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Paahi etu nnohimiechesha ni uvarechesha mitheko cho manyaapwiiya inyu, ukhalhawaya yayo phi evilhe anamilhohi ni inyu vano nnoovaka mahiye aya. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Wo nenno nlhove nno etu, irusho cha Nlhuku chineera, ‘Kinowaarweehelha anamilhohi ni akarumiya, anokoweeva akina ni waatwarushacha akina.’ <verse number="50" style="v"/>Paahi etu attu o ilha iyari ilha anowa utwarushachiya wo weeva anamilhohi a Nlhuku onkhaye toka voopiye aya ilhapo, <verse number="51" style="v"/>toka wiiviya wa Nahabilu mpaka wiiviya u Nazakariya, yeeviye variyari madhubahu ni Inupa Itakatifu. Eiyo, kinouhimeriani wiira, attu a ilha iyari ilha anowa utwarushiya wo mitheko chaya!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>“Nhothapana inyu owiittuchiha Malhehero! Ukhalhawaya nhokusha mittukulho cho nlhako wo inupa yo irusho, mwaanene nhikelhaka, mwaachiichihaka attu anlhikacha ukelha wowo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Vaathama awe, Amafarisayo alhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero nkayaachokholha unchopeyacha chinene wo unkohakoha chookohiya chinchi, <verse number="54" style="v"/>alhikachaka unria wiira ammare wo malhove awe.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Waamukiya attu aneepanga unchuwelha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Attu maelufu menchi vaathukhumana aya vamoka, anyikalhanachaka ashineneru, Yesu nkeerelhacha owiittucha awe thoko, “Mwiichinanelheke ni ihengedure ya Amafarisayo, yaani unafiki waya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kila ittu ivithiye inowa uhumbukulhiya ni kila ittu ivithiye inowa yaapatakulhiya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi etu, kila ittu yuulhumachilhe inyu mwiipiphini, inowa yeewania voonene, ni ittu yaapilhe inyu nlhako unatteiye, inowa yaahimiachiya vanchaarani.</para>
  <para style="s">Mpani nooviya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Kinouhimeriani, manyampwana aka, nhoove attu aneeva iruttu nansho ahooriaka ittu ikina iriyoothe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kinowoonihani vano etu, mpani o umwoova. Mmwooveke Nlhuku, nooria wiiva, amalhaka wiiva, hanaa ikuru yo unrihelha ntu umooroni Ujehannamu. Nkirumelhelheke mii, yoyo phi vekha awe o wooviya!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Chani, athooche athanu khanthumihiya wo isenti pilhi? Nansho Nlhuku khanonlhiyalha ata mmoka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wo ikekhiaye, ata ikharari chinyu cho mmuruni chihaalhakelhiya chonkhaye. Nhoove etu, mwaatti nri o ukhulhuvelhiya chinene waapwaha athooche enchi va!</para>
  <para style="s">Unrumelhelha ni unruna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye wiira, kila ntu norumelhelha vaattuni wiira phi awaka, Mwaana a Ntu ni uyo noowa aarumelhelha wo minepa cha Nlhuku wiira phi awawe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nansho attu onkhaye anokikhotta vaattuni, Mwaana a Ntu nowa ni uyo nowa unkhota wo minepa cha Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Ntu riyoothe noolhumacha nlhove no unvinga Mwaana a Ntu nowa uhiyereriya, nansho attu anohalha wulhumacha malhove o nlhava Iphumu ya Nlhuku, khanowa aahiyereriya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Vanohalha aya uweemeshani mu inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku ama wa aholhelhi ama wo attu o ikuru yo utawara, nhikelhiye nipampa wiira nnohalha wulhumachani wiira mwaakhulhe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iphumu ya Nlhuku nowa owiittuchihani yeyo ikatema iyo nlhove naani no wulhumacha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho na ntu o nhakhu o uphupuwalha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ntu mmoka o nhakhu mwaattuni mmo nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Owiittuchiha, mmwiirelheke nhima aka wiira nikawane nhakhu nihiyeriye ihu na athumwanihu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwaakhulha, “Mpwana, mpani kivanhe mii ntheko wo uhukumulhani ama ukawaniha nhakhu inyu mwaatti elhi va?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nkaathepa waahimeria attu onkhaye eeraka, “Mwiichinanelheke ni iphiro chonkhaye cho nlhulha, ukhalhawaya ukumi wa ntu khumpangiaa ni chittu chirinawe ama wo nhakhu urinawe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaahimeria nlhikaaniho nna, “Ahaawo ntu mmoka o nhakhu wo imata yaaruweria awe chinene. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nkaakhalha oopuwelhaka mwaneneru, ‘Akirina nikhupi no uthokoreria cholhia chaka. Kiireke chani etu?’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nkeecheerelha, ‘Kinoophomolha ichikuti chaka ni utheka nikhupi nulhupalhe chinene, ninohalha aka uthokoreria cholhia ni chittu chaka chonkhaye. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vavawo phi nohalha aka wiira, Nhoreeriya! Nhanaa vano akhiba yo chittu chonkhaye chaathemwelha inyu iyaakha chinchi chinene. Mwiittuweke etu vano, nlhieke, mmwurieke ni ulhia mpuha ene!’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nansho Nlhuku nkaamwirelha, ‘Nhophupuwalha inyu! Ulha uhiyu wo lhelho ulha, ukumi inyu phi noweiya aya, ni nhakhu wonkhaye nshungilhe inyu unohalha ukhalha wa apani?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamalhiha eeraka, “Phiri aya chiicho wa ntu neecheshera nhakhu awe mwanene, uhikhalhaka nhakhu unomphwanelha Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="s">Munrumelhelheke Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Mwaatti kinouhimeriani wiira, nhikelhiye nipampa no mwaha wo yolhia wiira nlhame ama ikuwo cho uwara mwiiruttuni mwinyu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ukumi phi renre upwaha yolhia ni iruttu upwaha ikuwo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mwooneke anakhuku, khanaalha imbeyu ama ukhungura vanlhaalhani, kharina ichikuti mena nikhupi, Nlhuku phi naalhiha! Ni inyu mwaatti nri o ukhulhuvelhiya waapwaha ashinuni! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mpani munlhokoni mwinyu wo ukhalha ni nipampa, nowooria wuncherera ukumi awe vakani? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Paahi etu, yakhalhaka wiira khannooria ata vakani upanga ittu thoko yeyo, nipampa ne ishiyani etu? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mwooneke ituva chineera aya wookonda, khachirina ntheko mena khachinotiva. Nansho kinouhimeriani wiira ata Amwene Naselemani anene ayo, ni mpuha waya wonkhaye khayaawanre ikuwo yo nthimicho thoko imoka aya ituva chi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka etu Nlhuku phi nokondiha chiicho mathaakhuru o mmatani ari lhelho ahaawo, meelho ahorihiya vamooroni, chani khanoria uwarihani mwaatti wo upwaha? Mwaatti chani woonaka mirima chinyu chiri chikani!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Paahi etu nhikelhiye nipampa, nhuvihiyaka ni chittu cho ulhia ni uwuria. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya chechiyo chittu chonkhaye chiyo chinohuvelhiya velhaponi va ni attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku. Athumwaninyu o wiirimu ahochuwelha chittu chonkhaye nnothanana inyu chiyo. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nansho mwaatti nchenjeukelheke thoko Imwene ya Nlhuku, ni inyu nnoowa mwaavahiya ni wuncherereriya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nhakhu wiirimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nhoove, inyu mwaatti nri nlhoko mwankani wa owiittucha aka, Athumwaninyu o wiirimu ahochivelhiya uuvahani mwaatti Imwene. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nthumiheke nhakhu inyu ni waavaha nchurukhu uyo amashikini. Nkoorosheke mirupa chihinthaalha, ni wiishungera nhakhu wiirimu uhinowukuwa aya. Wowo, attu o wiiya khaneeiya mena nrenje khunolhia. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Vanohalha ukhalha nhakhu inyu, nrima inyu unohalha ukhalha vavawo.</para>
  <para style="s">Akarumiya o ukhulhuvelhiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Nhiittialhe, nkhaalheke rata, ni ikhandiri chinyu chikhalheke tayari, <verse number="36" style="v"/>thoko anamitheko anaaweherera anene ntheko ahokolhie ukhuma u arusini, awe aahulhelha vanohalha aya wiihana vankhorani. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ahoreeriya yayo anamitheko ayo, anohalha uphwanyiya ni anene ntheko ashelhelhihaka! Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira, anowa urulha nikoti naya, ni waakhalhiha wiira aaterekhelhache. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Areeriye chani yayo anamitheko ayo anohalha uphwanyiya ashelhelhihaka inakhalhaka uhiyu veriyari ama mapikoosha! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nchuwelheke wiira, anene inupa akaachuwenlhe ikatema o wiiya vanowa aya, khaarupa, anshelhelhiha alhitelhelhaka inupa aya ihiphomolhiye. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ni inyu mwaatti chiicho, nhittialhe, ukhalhawaya Mwaana a Ntu nowaa ikatema ihinaanyihera inyu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Akarumiya o ukhulhuvelhiya ni o uhikhulhuvelhiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayeera, “Thithi, nna nlhikaaniho nna nawihu vekha ama ni attu akina chiicho?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Athithi nkayaakhulha, “Paahi etu, phi karumiya ani nokhulhuvelhiya o irusho? Phi yoyo novahiya ipilhi, weemelhelha ni waalhiha anamitheko nanawe waayakaru. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Horeeriya yoyo karumiya uyo vanophwanyiya awe ni anene ntheko apangaka chiicho vanohokolhia aya uwani! <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ikekhiaye nowa ummaha ntheko mulhupalhe wo weemelhelha nhakhu aya wonkhaye. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nansho, karumiya uyo echiirelhaka munrimani mwaneneru wiira anene ntheko khanohokolhia chitema, nkaachokholha waatakacha anamitheko akhunanawe, ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana alhiaka ni uhapalhiya, <verse number="46" style="v"/>anene ntheko phi nohokolhia aya chitema nihuku nihinaanyihera awe ni ikatema ihichuwenlhe awe. Anene ntheko anowa untwarusha ni unkakhelha wa attu ahinonrumelhelha Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Karumiya nochuwelha mathananelho a anene ntheko, nansho hiicheshaka rata, nowaatiya chinene. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nansho karumiya nopanga wo uhichuwelha nowa utwarushiya vakani. Vahiye chinchi nowa ukohiya chinchi, vahiye chinchi chinene nowa ukohiya chinchi chinene.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowamwalhaaniha attu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Kiwilhe uparihelha mooro velhaponi, ukaari unapharenlhee! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kihanaa ubatiizo wo utwarushiya ukiphwanenlhe, kinthemwa chani wiira utimire! <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nnaanyihera kiwanne mpuha velhaponi va? Mena, akiwanne mpuha, kiwanne umwalhaana. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Uchokholha vano nna, iwani ya attu athanu inomwalhaana, attu araru wa attu elhi ni elhi wa araru. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Manyanaangoro ashilhopwana avenganaka ni achishaana aya ashilhopwana, ni ashaana ashilhopwana aavengaka ashithumwanaya, manyanaangoro athiyana aavengaka ashaana aya ashithiyana, ni ashaana ashithiyana aavengaka manyanaangoro, ahokohi aavengaka ashihokohi aya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uchuwelha ikatema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimeria tho attu, “Vanoona inyu nihute nikhumaka uneelha nchuwa, mwaatti nneera, ipulha inoorupa lhelho, ni iyo khurupaka. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Vanoona inyu iphioo iwukaka uchawa, nneera, ntukutta ninoopaha lhelho, khuupahakani. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mwa anafiki inyu! Nhochuwelha uweha vathi ni wiirimu ni uhukumulha ittu yaani inohalha ukhumelhelha, nnoochelha chani etu uchuwelha maana o ikatema chi?</para>
  <para style="s">Mmwiiwananeke mmalhaponi inyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>“Chani woonaka khannooria wiihukumulha ittu yorera yo upanga? <verse number="58" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya ntu munttekenlhe inyu orwehakani umilhatuni, iri mbaya umwiiwanana nnari mphironi nhinaphiya, huurweeheni wa aholhelhi anohukumulha milhatu, ni inyu nkamwaattukiya wa attu anaatuka attu, nhelhiyaka njeerani. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Ikekhiaye khannowa mwaakhuma wowo mpaka nhomalha ulhiva isenti yo umalhihera nlhatu winyu.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nhiyeke uwonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo, nkayaawa attu akina ni umwiirelha Yesu mwaha wa attu o Ugalilaya yeevakachiye ni Napilato ni iphome aya nkayaathakanihiya ni isadaka yaakumihiya wa Nlhuku. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani nnaanyihera wiira yayo attu ayo aari o uwonya waapwaha Agalilaya akina, wo wowo uttwaruwa uwo? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mena! Ni mii kinouhimeriani wiira, mwaahikhoromeke ni uhiya uwonya winyu, nnookhwacha onkhaye thoko chinre aya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ama attu khumi ni nane yaawulhuwelhiye ishanja Usiloamu ulhe nkayaakhwa, yaari attu o uwonya waapwaha attu yaakhalha Uyerusalemu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mena! Kinouhimeriani wiira, mwaahikhoromeke ni uhiya uwonya winyu, ni inyu nnookhwa chiicho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no ntiini wo uhimma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaahimeria nna nlhikaaniho nna, “Ahaawo ntu mmoka aalhilhe mwiri wo ntini umatani waanlhe awe izabibu. Nkaawa uuwehani kila iyaakha oone wiira uhemma athomolhe, nansho wo uhiphwanya ittu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nkaamwiirelha ntu aashunga imata uyo, ‘Nkoonani! Iyaakha taaru chonkhaye chi kihowa va wo uhiphwanya ittu ata mena. Vano etu nkakheke mwiri uyo! Weeshiyani uthepa ulhia ittaya wo uhikhalha maana?’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nansho ntu aalhita imata uyo nkaakhulha, ‘Nkahiyani pwiiya, ukhalhe iyaakha imoka ilha, kinookhureria ni uhelha ichaayira. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mwaahiino wemmaka aye, waahimmeke, vavawo etu mmweeke mwaakakha.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha nthiyana Nihuku no Wiittuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nihuku no Wiittuwa nimoka Yesu aari eettuchihaka wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vavawo ahokhalha nthiyana mmoka awereiya mashoka o unanara iyaakha choomalhaka khumi ni nane, iruttu aya yaari inaremanre ahookokwaka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu vonne awe, nkaamwiihana ni umwiirelha, “Amma, nholhamihiya ikwerere inyu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nkamweeshera moono awe, ni yeyo ikatema, iruttu awe nkayookwaa tho, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nansho olhupalhe emelhelha inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku nkayaarushiya chinene woona wiira Yesu honlhamiha ntu Nihuku no Wiittuwa. Paahi etu, nkeerelha attu, “Arii mahuku sita o upanga ntheko, mmweeke yayo mahuku ayo mmwe mwaalhamihiya, nansho kuhiwe Nihuku no Wiittuwa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Athithi nkayaakhulha, “Mwa anafiki inyu! Mpani mmoka inyu hinonthaphulha mwannama awe ama iphuta awe nhiilhini wiira awurihe maashi Nihuku no Wiittuwa? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vano etu vaa hawo Mwaana a Aburahimu aremarihiye ni Nakare iyaakha khumi ni nane. Chani khireenre wiira ahulhelhiye Nihuku no Wiittuwa?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nlhove naakhunlhe awe, nkanaahelha ishoni amalhaponi awe, nansho attu akina onkhaye yaari anateelhiye wo woona chittu cho nthimicho chaapangelhe.</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no imbeyu yo iharadali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha, “Imwene ya Nlhuku inolhikaana ni? Kilhikaaniheke ni ishiyani? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Inolhikaana thoko choo. Ntu aawelhe imbeyu ikaani chinene yo iharadali nkaalha umatani wawe. Nnyepu nkawonnuwa ukhalha mwiri mulhupalhe, ashinuni o uchulhu wiirimu nkayaathekacha iphuuru chaya mmarittani mwaya mmo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no ihengedure</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha tho, “Kilhikaanihekeni ni Imwene ya Nlhuku? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Thoko, opani amoka aawelhe ihengedure nkoothuwaniha iphepa madebe melhi ni ntikha nkayaarurummwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhako wo yevayeva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarwa miholho nkwaha awe wo Uyerusalemu aviraka mmawani ni nttokoni mwonkhaye, eettuchihaka attu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ntu mmoka nkankoha eeraka, “Thithi, chani attu vakani phi nohalha ulhama?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mwiikayeke uvira nlhako wo uyevayeva, ukhalhawaya attu enchi anoolhikacha uvira nansho ahooriaka. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Anoowa mahuku anene inupa vanohalha aya uttia nkhora, ni inyu mwaatti mweemelhaka vathe mwiihanaka mwiiraka, ‘Pwiiya, nnihulhelhe.’ Nansho yayo anowa uwaakhulhani, ‘Akuuchuwenlheni mwaattiva!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ni inyu nnoowa mwaakhulha, ‘Hii phi alhe naalhia ni uwuria vamoka ni inyu, nkamweenittuchiha uwanihu!’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ayo anowa wiira vavawo tho, ‘Kinre wiira akuuchuwenlheni mwaatti. Nthamache va, inyu mwaatti o uwonya va!’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Phi nohalha aya ukhalha nunlhiho ni ukhura miino, vanohalha inyu woona Aburahimu ni Naisaka ni Nayakhobo ni anamilhohi onkhaye nhina Imwene ya Nlhuku, nansho mwaatti nkamwaakhotiya! <verse number="29" style="v"/>Attu anoowa ukhuma unosha nchuwa ni akina uneelha nchuwa, uchulhu ni uchawa ni ukhalha ukaraamuni Imwene ya Nlhuku. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Eiyo, wo ikekhiaye ahanlhe utulhi anowa ukhalha o uholhelha, ni ayo aholhenlhe vano ayo anowa ukhalha o umalhihera.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uttuna wa Yesu iwani yo Uyerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo, Amafarisayo akina nkayaawa wa Yesu ni umwiirelha, “Nthame vaa nrwee vakittu vakina, ukhalhawaya Naherode anothanana uwiivani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwaakhulha eeraka, “Nrweeke mwaahimerieke anancheto ayo, ‘Kinoomolha mashoka o unanara ni waalhamiha areta lhelho ni meelho, nihuku no neraru kinomalhiha ntheko aka.’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Inakhalhaka chiicho, lhelho, meelho ni nroto kiri munkwahani mwaka, khavanlhoka namilhohi wiiviya uriwoothe ihikhalhe Uyerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Uyerusalemu, Uyerusalemu! Nneeva anamilhohi, nnaata malhuku akarumiya arumiye ni Nlhuku! Vachani kilhikanche aka waathothokaniha achishaana inyu, thoko nankutu chineera awe wo wooramelha achishaana awe mmapuphani mwawe, nansho khamwaattunne. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Haya etu, iwani inyu inoophomolhiya. Kinouhimeriani wiira, khannokoona mpaka vanohalha inyu wiira, ‘Atotopelhiye uyo nowa wo nchina na Athithi uyo.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha nreta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nihuku no Wiittuwa nimoka, Yesu ahorwaa ulhia yolhia uwani wa Afarisayo aholhelhi, ni attu aari vavawo yaari ammwehawehaka. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ntu mmoka eepilhe mieto ni miono nkaawa wa Yesu, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha owiittuchiha malhehero ni Amafarisayo, “Chani, Malhehero ihu anonivaha ikuru yo upanga cho urera unlhamiha nreta Nihuku no Wiittuwa ama uhipanga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nansho khayaakhunlhe nlhove. Yesu nkankusha ntu uyo, nkanlhamiha, ni unhiya ahokolhie uwani. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Paahi nkeerelha attu ayo, “Mpani munlhokoni mwinyu mwaamwanawe ama iphuta awe yatumbuchiraka munlhikitini, hinorwaa ni unkumiha inakhalhaka niri Nihuku no Wiittuwa?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Attu ayo khayoonrie umwaakhulha ittu.</para>
  <para style="s">Nrima woombone ni wiitimarikha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu nkoona attu akina alhalheiye cheera aya wo uthanlha ihiche choombone, nkeerelha nna nlhikaaniho nna, <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ntu olhalhiakani u arusini, nhikhalhe mapuro o nthimicho, hiwe nlheto nothimichiya uupwahani inyuva. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vavawo ntu olhalhelheni mwaattiva onkhaye, nowa uwiirelhani, ‘Nthameke mwaaviriheke alha.’ Phi vavawo vanowa inyu wuulhihiya muru vaattuni ni urwaa uukhalhani utulhi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nansho, mwalhalheiyaka nrweeke, mwaphiyaka mwakhalheke utulhi, anenchi inyu ayo owihanekeni, eereke, ‘Mpwana uweeke waakhalha uholho unouno.’ Vavawo nnowa mwaapatta nthimicho vaattuni va alheto onkhaye vawo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe neewelhiha, nookurushiya, ni ntu neekurusha noowelhihiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkeerelha anenchi awe ayo, “Mwaaterekhelhaka attu yolhia, uthana ama uhiyu, nhaalhalhie ashilhoko inyu ama manyampwana inyu ama attu o nhakhu, ukhalhawaya ni ayo anowa uulhalhiani, nkayolhivani. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vanoterekha inyu yolhia ya ikaramu, mweehanacheke ashikini, attu o uremara, attu o makutulha ni attu ohoona, <verse number="14" style="v"/>vavawo nnooreeriya, ukhalhawaya yayo kharina ittu yo ulhivani. Nlhuku phi nohalha uulhivani nihuku na attu orera nrima vanowa aya uhihimushiya nnookhwani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no ikaramu yulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ntu mmoka aari nakhanlhe vavawo veewilhe awe, nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Ahoreeriya yayo attu anohalha ukhalha ukaraamuni alhiaka wi Imwene ya Nlhuku ayo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu mmoka ahoterekha ikaramu yulhupalhe yeehanne awe attu enchi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vaayilhe aya, nkaamwiirelha karumiya awe arwee ehanache alheto, ‘Mmweeke vano mwaatti, ikaramu ihaaya!’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nansho onkhaye khayaawilhe, kila mmoka ahimiaka nlhatu ni urwaa unthekoni wawe, o upacha alhepelhaka eeraka, ‘Nkakihiyeni kirwee kawehe imata kithumme aka, nkihiye etu kirwee wowo.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nkhwawe uyo aholhepelha ni wiira, ‘Kihothuma ing'ope khumi cho ulhima elhi elhi ni vaa kiri munkwahani ulhikachani, nkakihiyeni kirwee wowo.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nkina nkeera, ‘Kithenlhe naanano, paahi etu akinowa.’” <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Karumiya nkaahokolhia ni waahimeria anrumme. Anene ntheko nkayaarushiya chinene nkaamwirelha karumiya uyo, ‘Waakuvieke urweeke mmaphironi ni mmawani, mweehaneke amashikini ni attu oremara ni attu ohoona ni attu oheeta.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Karumiya nkaahokolhia nkeera, ‘Thithi, malhehero inyu ahopangia, nansho attu khari enchi khanachara.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Anene nkayamwiirelha karumiya tho, ‘Urweeke etu vano mmaphironi ni nchereshere mmo, waakhupeke attu awaacheke awe aachariha inupa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wiira, khaawo ata ntu mmoka kinlhalhelhe aka nohalha ulhawiha yolhia iterekhiye ukaraamuni waka va!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Iphiro yo ukhalha owiittucha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vavawo milhoko minchi cha attu chaari chinttwaraka Yesu, nkaarukunuwa ni weerelha, <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Ntu riyoothe nowa uwannyaka, ahikittuneke mii ni waavenga athumwanawe ama anumwanawe ni ahanu awe ni achishaana awe ni ashihima awe ni ashirokorawe ata ni ukumi awe mwanene, khanooria ukhalha owiittucha aka. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ntu hinokusha nsalaaba awe ni ukittwara khanooria ukhalha owiittucha aka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ntu mmoka inyu athananaka utheka ishanja, nochokholha ukhalha thoko vathi aalhakelhe nhakhu unthananiya, oone wiira nowooria yoyo ntheko uyo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Aahikhalhaneke, khanooria upanga ata ntheko wo utheka nsingi, ni attu onkhaye anowa unthiaa, <verse number="30" style="v"/>yiiraka, ‘Yolha ntu ulha ahochokholha rata, nansho hoochelha umalhiha!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Ama mwene ani nothanana waatakana ikhoto ni mwene nkina hinokhalha nipuro ni wuupuwelha thoko. Noopuwelha wiira, chani manyaasikari elufu khumi arina awe anowooria waatakana ikhoto ni amwene akina? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Oonaka wiira khanooria, phi naaruma awe attu o urweeha nttenga wo mpuha wo wiiwanana ni yoyo mwene uyo ahinakumaana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Chiichammo etu, khaawo ata mmoka inyu nokhalha owiittucha aka aahihiyereke kila ittu rina awe.</para>
  <para style="s">Maakha othuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mako 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Maakha ari o uchiva, nansho athuwaka, anohalha uchivihani? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Khanlhoka tho nttayani mena ukhalha ichaayira, anokhalha o rihiya. Ri ni maaru eeweke!”</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ikhondoro yoopotera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka attu o ulhiviha ikhodi ni attu o uwonya enchi yahowa umwiiwelhelhani Yesu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Amafarisayo ni owiittuchiha Malhehero nkayaachokholha utukutuwacha, “Mmwooneke yolha ntu ulha! Naapochera attu o uwonya ni waalhiana yolhia!” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaahimeria nna nlhikaanihero nna,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Ntu ri ni ikhondoro imia imoka, oonaka imoka ihopotera, neera chani? Noohiya chikina makhumi tisa ni tisa chiyo wiithuphini, ni urwaa uuthothani imoka ipotenre iyo mpaka oone. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Oonakaru, khuchishaka vanikhathani <verse number="6" style="v"/>ni uhokolhia attapelhelhaka. Khweehanaka manyampwana awe ni amwatamana eeraka, ‘Nittapelhelheke etu mwaatti, ikhondoro yaapotenre ihoonia!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Chiicho kinouhimeriani wiira, phi nohalha aya uttapelhelhiya wiirimu ntu mmoka o uwonya vanokhoroma awe ni uhiya uwonya, waapwaha akina makhumi tisa ni tisa ahinovarechesha ikekhia.</para>
  <para style="s">Nikhobilhi nipotenre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ama nnoona chani, opani amoka ari ni makhobilhi khumi, naapoteraka nimoka anohalha wiira chani? Anooparihelha ikhandiri ni ukwecha inupa aaviaka rata mpaka oone. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vanoona aya, phi neehana aya manyampwana aya ni amwaatamana vamoka, eeraka, ‘Mwaatti, nkanngwe nittapelhelhe nikhobilhi naakipotenre nihoonia!’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Chiichammo etu, kinouhimeriani wiira, minepa cha Nlhuku phi neera aya wo uttapelhelha ntu mmoka o uwonya vanokhoroma awe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaana aapotenre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nkaathepa waahimeria eeraka, “Ahaawo ntu aari ni ashaana elhi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mwankani uyo nkeerelha athumwane, ‘Athumwanaka, nkivahe nhakhu unkiphwanelha.’ Nkaakawelhachiya elhi ayo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Avireke mahuku vakani, nkaathumiha nhakhu awe ni urwaa nkwaha wo utayi ni ihera chonkhaye chaarina awe. Wowo nkaakhalha ni ulhia chonkhaye pufia. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vaamalhinhe awe kila ittu, nkawaakhumelhelha ikuruna, nkaachokholha uthemwathemwa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nkaarwa upangani ntheko wa ntu mmoka nnenchi o yeyo ilhapo iyo, anrweehilhe umatani wawe alhihe ikulhuwe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nkaathanana ata ukhura makova aalhiya ni ikulhuwe, ukhalhawaya khaawo ntu anlhoha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Voopuwenlhe awe, nkeera, ‘Wa athumwanaka, anamitheko enchi anoolhia ni urupalha, ni mii uno kikhwaaka ithalha! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kinoohokolhia etu uwani wa athumwanaka keerelhe, Athumwanaka, kihowonya irimu ni uwaninyu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Akinophwanelhiya wiihaniya mwaamwaninyu, nkipangeke thoko mmoka a anamitheko inyu.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkaachokholha nkwaha wo uhokolhia uwani.”</para>
  <para style="p">“Nari utayi, athumwanawe nkaamwona, nrima nkawaakelha ikiriri, nkayaattimakacha, nkayampochera ni unkumbatira mwaamwanaya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwaamwanaya nkeera, ‘Athumwanaka, kihowonya wa Nlhuku wiirimu ni uwaninyu. Akiphwanelhiyaka tho wiihaniya mwaamwaninyu.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nansho athumwanawe nkeehana akarumiya aya, eeraka, ‘Mwaakuvieke, nkawaani! Mmwiiheke ikuwo choombone chiyo, mmwe mwammwariha. Mummwariheke ni pete nnikokhoni ni iratu mmietoni mwawe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwamalhaka nrweeke mwanhitheke mwang'ope o uneneva uyo, nittapelhelhe! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya mwaamwanaka ulha ahokhwa nansho vano ri nkumi, ahopotera, nansho vano hoonia.’ Nkayaachokholha uttapelhelha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Yeyo ikatema iyo, mwaana mulhupalhe uyo aari umatani. Vaahokolhia aya, aatameriaka vawani, nkayeewa ikoma choopiyaka attu eenaka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkaamwiihana karumiya mmoka ni unkoha, ‘Ana urini?’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Karumiya nkaakhulha eeraka, ‘Nhima inyu hohokolhia uwani, ni athumwaninyu ahonhithelha mwang'ope o uneneva ulhe, ukhalhawaya ahompatta nari nkumi.’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mmirawo mulhupalhe uyo nkaathunalha chinene nkaakhota ukelha mpaani, athumwane nkayaawa ni umpepecha wiira akelhe mpaani. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nansho uyo nkaakhulha, ‘Nkoonani thithi, iyaakha chonkhaye chi kinovara ntheko uukavihani thoko ipotta, mena akinawonya malheheriyo inyu. Nkivanheni? Khannakivaha ata mwaapuri wiira kiipuhihe ni manyampwana aka! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nansho ulha mwamwaninyu ulha, holhia pufia nhakhu wonkhaye ni ashithiyana o ulhavalhava, ni vano vahokolhelhe awe, nhonhithelha mwang'ope o uneneva!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Athumwanawe nkayaakhulha, ‘Mwaamwanaka, uri ulhokelhaka ni mii, ni kila ittu iri yawawo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nansho ninttapelhelha ukhalhawaya nhima inyu ahokhwa, nansho vano ri nkumi, ahopotera nansho vano hoonia.’”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Akarani o woothacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Ahaawo ntu o nhakhu aari ni akarani o ipilhi yo weemelhelha nhakhu awe. Nkaahimeriya wiira akarani ayo aari alhiaka pufia nhakhu awe uyo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Paahi nkeehana ni weerelha, ‘Urini anaa, malhove kineewa aka alha? Nkaalhakelheke etu nhakhu aka, ukhalhawaya khanrina tho ipilhi yo ukhalha akarani aka.’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Akarani nkayeechiirelha aneneru, ‘Anene ntheko alha ankelha ukithurulha ipilhi aka. Kiireke chani vano etu? Akooriaka ulhima, koonaka ishoni unlhepelha ntu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Aye, kihochuwelha cho wiira! Vanohalha aka uhiihiya ipilhi aka munthekoni vawo, kinowa kaapatta manyampwana o kipochera mii mmanupani mwaya.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Paahi nkeehana attu onkhaye aashimihiye nchurukhu ni anene ntheko. Nkaakoha o upacha, ‘Ana mwaashimme nchurukhu nchani?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nkaakhulha, ‘Mapipa imia o makhura o uto, maalhakelhiyo ayo alha vaa.’ Akarani nkayeera, ‘Nkhalheke nlhepeke wiira yaari makhumi nthanu.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nkankoha nkina, ‘Haya ni inyu mwaashimme nchani?’ Nkaakhulha, ‘Kaashimme mirupa imia imoka cho ngaano. Maalhakelhiyo ayo phi alha vaa.’ Nkeerelhiya ni uyo, ‘Nlhepeke wiira yaari mirupa makhumi nane.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Paahi etu, anene ntheko ayo nkayaapuhiha yayo akarani o ipilhi o uhilhoka ayo wo irusho chaarina aya. Ukhalhawaya attu o velhaponi ari o upenya waapwaha attu o nthuko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu nkoolhumacha tho, “Ni mii kinowiirelhani wiira, mpangeke umpwana ni nhakhu wo mwiilhaponi, vanohalha aya umalha vawo, mmwe mwaapocheriya mu nihema no mahuku o uhimalha.” Vavawo nkeerelha, “Mwaatti nneepanga orera nrima mwaattuni, nansho Nlhuku achuwelhaka mirima chinyu. Ukhalhawaya ittu inoonia uteelha waattuni, Nlhuku noona wiira phiri yo uhilhoka. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ntu riyoothe nokhulhuvelhiya wo makani nowa ukhulhuvelhiya wo chittu chuulhupalhe, ntu hinokhulhuvelhiya wo makani, khanowa aakhulhuvelhiya wo chittu chulhupalhe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwaahirumelhelhiyeke wo chittu cho mwiilhaponi, nnohalha ukhulhuvelhiya chani etu wo nhakhu we ikekhiaye? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vavawo mwaahiphwanelheke munhakhuni mwa ntu nkina, mpani etu nohalha uuvahani ittu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Khaawo namitheko nooria waatumikelha ashinene ntheko elhi, apangaka chiicho, nowa unvenga mmoka ni unttuna akina ama nookhulhuvelhiya wa ntu mmoka ni uhikhulhuvelhiya wa ntu nkina. Khannoria ukaviha ntheko wa Nlhuku ni nhakhu vamoka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Malhikaaniho makina a Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mako 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Amafarisayo veewilhe aya chaahimiya ni Yesu, nkaayaathunalhacha wo nlhatu no uttuna nchurukhu chinene. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelhacha, “Mwaatti phi inyu nneepanga attu o nrima woombone mwaattuni, nansho Nlhuku achuwelhaka uwonya winyu. Ukhalhawaya chittu chinoonia wiira phi chorera mwaattuni chechiyo phi cho uhilhoka wa Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni malhove alhepiye ni anamilhohi chaari chihimiyaka mpaka ikatema i Nayohana Obatiiza, ukhuma vavawo, Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku phi nohimiachiya, ni kila ntu akelhaka wo machiri. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nansho vari vowaalhuwa irimu ni ilhapo uvira, upwaha inakhalhaka nlhove nimoka nilhepiye no Malhehero ufutiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ntu riyoothe naavaha mahanu awe italaka ni waathelha athiyana akina, holhavalhava, ni ntu naathelha opani ayo, ni uyo holhuva.</para>
  <para style="s">Ntu o nhakhu ni Nalazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Ahaawo ntu mmoka o nhakhu aawara ikuwo cho nchurukhu mwinchi cho thereria ni ukhalha mumpuhani mahuku onkhaye. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nkaakhalha tho ntu nshikini eehaniya Lazaro, aachanre makhwata iruttu yonkhaye, aawiihiya kila nihuku vankhorani va ntu o nhakhu ulhe, <verse number="21" style="v"/>amirelhaka ishenye cholhia chaamoramora vamezani va ntu o nhakhu ulhe. Ni ashipwa aari awaaka alhathaka makhwata awe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Nshikini ulhe, nkaakhwa, nkaakushiya ni minepa wiirimu ukhalhihiyani vamoka ni Aburahimu. Ntu o nhakhu ni uyo nkaakhwa, nkaavithiya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Unaminepa nkaakhalha muuttwaruwani chinene, nkaapathusha miitho nkoona Aburahimu anakhanlhe utayi vamoka ni Nalazaro. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkayeehana, ‘Apwiiya Aburahimu! Nkoonelhe ikiriri, mwaarume Nalazaro inakhalhaka apaphe vachulhu nikokho naya mmaashini, awe aatipiha nlhimi naka nna, ukhalhawaya mooro uri mu ukipahani chinene!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nansho Aburahimu nkayaakhulha, ‘Muupuwelheke anaka, wiira vaari inyu akumi valhe mwaari mpuhaka chinene, Nalazaro ahuvaka. Nansho vano uno ari mumpuhani, ni inyu nhuvaka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Inakhalhaka chiicho, variyari ihu hii ni inyu mwaatti, vari nlhikiti nulhupalhe, khavanooria ntu uwa uno ni attu o uno uwa wowo.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ntu aari o nhakhu ulhe nkeera, ‘Kinolhepelha etu pwiiya wiira, mwaarume Nalazaro ayo arwee uwannyaka wa athumwanaka, <verse number="28" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya ahohalha ashihima aka athanu, arwee aamukache, ni ayo ahiwe aaphiyelha nna nipuro no ntwarusho nna.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Aburahimu nkayeera, ‘Ashihima inyu ahana malhove alhepiye a ashinna Musa ni anamilhohi akina o waamuka, eewelhelheke yayo.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ntu o nhakhu ulhe nkaakhulha, ‘Yeyo vekha aya khinthosha, pwiiya Aburahimu! Nansho ntu akaahihimmwe ni urwaa wowo, vavawo anokhoroma ahiyaka uwonya waya.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nansho Aburahimu nkayeera, ‘Yaahiiweke malhove a ashinna Musa ni anamilhohi, khanowa aarumelhelha attu ariyoothe anakhalhaka ahihimmwe nnookhwani.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Uwonya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mako 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimiachera owiittucha awe wiira, “Chittu chinaahelha attu mu uwonyani lazima chikhumelhelhe, nansho hothapana ntu naawonyiha attu akina! <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ikaari mbaya yoyo ntu uyo akaattukelhelhiye nshilho nshikoni ni urihelhiya ubaharini kuliko ummwonyiha mmoka aya alha ashinkani alha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Paahi etu mwiichinanelheke!</para>
  <para style="p">“Nhima inyu awonyaka, munchachereke, akhoromaka munlhevelhelheke. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ottekelhakani imara saba wo nihuku nimoka, ni kila ikatema awaaka ni wiira, ‘kihokhoroma,’ munlhevelhelheke.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukhalha ni nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Akarumiya nkayeerelha Athithi, “Nnuncherereke nrima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Athithi nkayaakhulha, “Mwakaari ni nrima wo upisha inakhalhaka mwankani thoko imbeyu yo iharadali, mwaneerelha ulha mwiri wo nkhuyu ulha, ‘Mwiikhulhe mwaanene mweephateelhe ubaharini!’ ni uyo waanowiiwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Ntheko wa akarumiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Niire wiira mmoka inyu hanaa karumiya nonlhimelha ama noshunga ikhondoro chawe. Chani vanohokolhia awe umatani, noomwiirelha, waakuvieke, ukhalheke, ulhieke yolhia? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mena! Nomwiirelha, ‘Ukiterekhelhe yolhia mii thoko, mwiichesheke rata ni ukitumikelha mii vanolhia aka ni uwuria vawo, wamalhaka uterekheke yawao.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Chani aterekhaka nonttuna yoyo karumiya uyo wo ntheko ulheheriye awe? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ni inyu mwaatti chiicho, mwapangaka ntheko ulheheriye inyu, mwiireke, ‘Hii niri akarumiya o uhikhulhuvelhiya, nihopanga tu thoko chilheeheriye ihu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaalhamiha attu khumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu vaarwaa awe Uyerusalemu, ahovira mmwiinanoni mwo Usamariya ni Ugalilaya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vaaphiya awe iwani imoka, nkaakumaana attu khumi o makutulha eemenlhe utayi <verse number="13" style="v"/>akhuwelhachaka, “Yesu! Thithi! Nnoonelhe ikiriri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu vonne awe nkeera, “Nrweeke mweechooniheke wa opochera ishaani.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vaari aya mphironi arwaachaka, nkayaalhamacha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mmoka vonne awe wiira holhama, nkaahokolhia, anthimichaka Nlhuku wo nlhove nulhupalhe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nkeewulhusha vathi oopuruwaka vamietoni va Yesu ni unshukuru. Yoyo ntu uyo aari Nsamariya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Yaari attu khumi alhamihiye, akina tisa ayo ari vayi etu? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Chani woonaka ulha nlheto ulha vekha awe phi wilhe unthimichani Nlhuku?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaamwirelha ntu uyo, “Munkweke nrweeke, nrima inyu uhoolhamihani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uwa Imwene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Amafarisayo akina nkayankoha Yesu Imwene ya Nlhuku inohalha uwa iyaakhani. Aakhunlhe eeraka, “Imwene ya Nlhuku khinowa thoko chinaanyihera inyu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Khaawo ntu nohalha wiira, ‘Alha va!’ Ama wiira, ‘Irii valhe!’, ukhalhawaya Imwene ya Nlhuku iri nhina mwinyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Paahi nkaahimeria owiittucha awe, “Ikatema inoowa vanohalha inyu wunlhelha woona ikatema yo Mwaana a Ntu, nansho nhoonaka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ahawo anohalha uwa uwiirelhani, ‘Nkoonani, rii valhe!’ Ama ‘Nkoonani rii vaa!’ Nansho mwaatti nhirwee ummwehani. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya thoko chineera aya wo uverunya uno ni uno wiirimu, phi chiichammo Mwaana a Ntu chinohalha awe wiira nenno nihuku nno. <verse number="25" style="v"/>nansho ahinaya yayo mahuku ayo, hophwanelhiya uhuva chinene ni ukhotiya ni attu o ilha iyari ilha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Thoko chaari aya ikatema ya Anuhu, phi nohalha aya ukhalha nihuku no Mwaana a Ntu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Attu yaari alhiaka ni uwuria, athelhaka ni uthelhiya, mpaka nihuku Anuhu vaawelha aya isafina. Igarika nkayaawa nkayeevakacha attu onkhaye. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Inottuna ukhalha thoko mahuku a Nalutu. Attu yaari alhiaka awuriaka, athumihaka ni uthuma aalhaka imbeyu ni utheka manupa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nihuku Nalutu vaathama aya Usodoma, malhuku o mooro nkaarupa thoko ipulha ukhuma wiirimu ni weevakacha attu onkhaye. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Phi nohalha aya ukhalha nihuku Mwaana a Ntu vanohalha awe upatakulhiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Nenno nihuku nno, ntu riyoothe nohalha uphwanyiya vanchaarani hikhuruwe vathi uwa ukusha nhakhu awe, chiicho ntu riyoothe nohalha uphwanyiya utimani hihokolhie uwani. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Moopuwelheke ahanu a Nalutu! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ntu nothanana woopolha ukumi awe noopoteriha, ntu nokumiha ukumi awe nowa woopolha. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yoyo uhiyu uyo, Kinouhimeriani wiira, attu elhi anowa urupa vamoka, mmoka nowa ukushiya, nkina ahiiyaka utulhi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Manyopani elhi anowa ushilha meelhe vamoka, amoka anowa ukushiya akina ahiiyaka utulhi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Attu elhi anowa ulhima mmatani vamoka, amoka anowa ukushiya akina ahiiyaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Owiittucha nkayankoha Yesu, “Thithi, vayi wowo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Vakittu variwoothe vari ntembo, phi vakittu vanothukumanacha marepo.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho ni anankhwelhi ni Ohukumulha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Paahi, Yesu nkaahimiachera nlhikaaniho no weettuchiha wiira ikatema yonkhaye anthananiya akhalhe anlhapelhaka Nlhuku wo uhocha ntu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkeera, “Iwani i naneshe ahaawo Ohukumulha mmoka ahanthimicha Nlhuku mena waalhoha attu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ni wowo akhalhaka anankhwelhi aawa kila ikatema uwaalhepelhani aakavihe apatte yaahuvelha aya, eeraka, ‘Nkikavihe kipatte ikekhia inohuvelha aka ukhuma wa mmalhaponi aka!’ <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wo mahuku menchi Ohukumulha ayo yaari akhotaka, nansho wo umalhihera nkeera aneneru munrimani mwaya, ‘Inakhalhaka akimoovaka Nlhuku ama waalhoha attu, <verse number="5" style="v"/>nansho wo nlhatu wo uhuvihiya chinene ni anankhwelhi alha, kinowenkelha ikekhia aya. Kaahiireke chiicho anoothepa ukinyoonyiha, ni ukoocheeha!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Athithi nkayaathepa wulhumacha, “Paahi mwiiweke etu, chenre aya wo wulhumacha yayo o uhukumulha o uhilhoka ayo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Chani etu, Nlhuku khanowa aalhakelhaka ikekhia attu athanlhiye, anomunlhelha kila nihuku uthana ni uhiyu? Chani noocherewa waavaha inonlhelha aya? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wiira, nowaavaha ikekhia wo uhicherewa. Nansho chani, Mwaana a Ntu nowa aaphwanya attu o nrima vanohalha awe uwa?”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho na Amafarisayo ni attu o ulhiviha ikhodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimiacha tho nna nlhikaaniho nna wa attu eecherumelhelha woona urera nrima ni waaveehacha attu akina. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Ahaawo attu elhi aarweelhe u Inupa ya Nlhuku uulhapelhani, amoka yaari Afarisayo, ni akina yaari olhiviha ikhodi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Afarisayo nkeemelha vachereshere vo vekha aya, nkaalhapelha munrimani, ‘Kinoushukuru Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya akirii thoko akina o uhilhoka, akihiwe ntu omenyekha mena owiiya mena ntu o ishembwere thoko attu akina chiri aya. Kinooshukuru tho akirii thoko ntu olhiviha ikhodi emenlhe ulha va. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kinoottuka mahuku melhi kila ijuma, kikumihaka ikikhumi yo nhakhu kinopatta aka.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Nansho olhiviha ikhodi ayo, eemenlhe utayi oochelhaka upathusha miitho wiirimu, nansho echaataka vakhakaachani onlhaka ahiyereriye, eeraka, ‘Nlhuku nkoonelhe ikiriri mii ntu o uwonya va!’ ” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wiira, “Ntu olhiviha ikhodi ulhe aahokolheelhe uwani naalhakelhiye ikekhia. Nansho kuhiwe wa Afarisayo ayo, ukhalhawaya kila neewelhiha nookurushiya, ni kila neekurusha noowelhihiya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noweeshera miono ashaana ashinkani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mako 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Attu nkayammwiihera Yesu ashaana ashinkani awe eesheracha miono chawe. Owiittucha vonne aya nkaachiichihacha ni waachacheracha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeehanacha eeraka, “Mwaahiye ashaana ashinkani ayo we uwannyaka, mena nhaachiichihe, ukhalhawaya Imwene ya Nlhuku phi yawaya attu thoko alha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Muupuwelheke wo ikekhiaye wiira, ntu riyoothe hinopochera Imwene ya Nlhuku thoko mwaana mwankani khanowa aakhelha mwiimweneni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ntu o nhakhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mako 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nholhelhi mmoka a Ayahudi nkankoha Yesu, “Owiittuchiha orera nrima, kipangeke ittu yaani kipatte ukumi wo uhimalha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu ni uyo nkaakoha, “Chani woonaka nnokiihana orera nrima? Khaawo ri orera nrima ahikhalhe Nlhuku vekha awe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nhochuwelha malheheriyo, ‘Nhilhavelhave, nhiive, nhiiye, nhimwootherie ntu, mwaathimicheke athumwaninyu ni anumwaninyu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nholhelhi uyo nkeera, “Mii kihovara yayo meettuchiho ayo toka kinari mwanhima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu veewilhe awe, nkaamwirelha, “Nhohalhiha nimoka nnothananiya inyu upanga. Nthumiheke chittu chinyu chonkhaye ni nchurukhu uyo mwaavaheke amashikini, ni inyu nnowiishungera nhakhu wiirimu, mwamalhaka vavawo nkittwareke.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nansho ntu ulhe veewilhe awe chiicho, nkaakelhiya ichuku chinene, ukhalhawaya aari ntu o nhakhu chinene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu nkoona ichuku chawe nkaamwirelha, “Vari voorikarika chinene attu o nhakhu ukelha wi Imwene ya Nlhuku! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Eiyo, khavanorikarika wa ingamiya uperetta va niitho no ntotto, kuliko wa ntu o nhakhu ukelha wi Imwene ya Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Attu yeewa nkayeera, “Mpani etu, nohalha ulhama?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chihinooria wa nttuni, chinowooria wa Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Paahi Napeturo nkayeera, “Mwooneke etu, hii nihohiya kila ittu ni uuttwarani inyuva.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha attu onkhaye, “Eiyo, ikekhia kinouhimeriani, ntu riyoothe hilhe inupa awe ama amwaarawe ama ashihima awe ama manyanaangoro awe ama ashaana awe wo uttwara Imwene ya Nlhuku <verse number="30" style="v"/>nowa upochera menchi wo upwaha ilha ikatema ilha ni ukumi wo uhimalha ikatema inowa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonhimiacha nookhwa awe voneraru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mako 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakusha owiittucha khumi ni elhi vathetho nkeerelha, “Mwiiwelhelheke! Vano ninorwaa Uyerusalemu, wowo kila ittu ilhepiye ni anamilhohi imwaachaka Mwaana a Ntu inokootimira. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nokoohelhiya mmathathani mwa attu ahiri Ayahudi anohalha umpangelhacha ncheche ni unruwana ni unshuwelha ishenye. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Anokoomwaata ni umwiiva, nansho nihuku no neraru noohihimmwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nansho owiittucha khayaari achuwelhaka yoyo mwaha uyo, maana aya aari anavithiye, ahichuwelhaka ittu yaahimia awe Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu ohoona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu vaatameria awe Uyeriko, nkamphwanya ntu mmoka ohoona aakhanlhe vachereshere iphiro, avekelhaka. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Veewa awe attu enchi aviraka nkaakoha, “Anaa urini?” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nkaakhulhiya wiira, “Yesu o Unazareti phi novira.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nkaakhuwelha eeraka, “Yesu! Mwaana a Adaudi ukoonelhe ikiriri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Attu yaaholhenlhe ayo nkayanchachera wiira amaalhe. Nansho uyo nkaathepa ukhuwelha, “Mwaana a Adaudi, ukoonelhe ikiriri!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu nkeemelha ni ulhehera wiira ehaniye. Vaawiihiye awe, Yesu nkankoha, <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Unothanana kuupangelheke ittu yaani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkaakhulha, “Thithi, kinolhepelha woona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Uvahiyeke woona etu! Nrima awo uhoolhamiha.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema, ohoona ulhe nkoona, nkanttwara Yesu uno anthimichaka Nlhuku. Attu onkhaye vonne aya, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Nazakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkaaphiya Uyeriko, nkeetakacha mmaphironi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wowo ahaawo ntu olhiviha ikhodi mulhupalhe eehaniya Zakayo. Yoyo aari ntu o nhakhu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Aari athananaka umwoona Yesu chiri awe, nansho aari akani o khuvia oocheelhaka umwoona Yesu rata wo nlhatu no uchara attu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkaattimakacha uholho, nkaawelha munkhuyuni amwoone Yesu rata vanohalha awe uvira. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu vaaphilhe awe vavawo, nkaaweha nchulhu ni uwerelha Nazakayo, “Nazakayo, nkhuruweke mwaakuvieke, lhelho mii ki nlheto uwaninyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nazakayo nkayaakhuruwa ni umpochera Yesu athaatheelhaka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye oona nkayaachukulhacha, “Yolha ntu ulha nokelha uukhalhani wa ntu o uwonya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nazakayo nkayeemelha ni wiihimia wa Athithi, “Mwiiweke Thithi! Kinookumiha inusu yo nhakhu aka waavaha amashikini, ni yakhalhaka hawo ntu kanthurunlhe aka ittu, kinonhokolhoshera vacheshe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Lelho, inupa inyu ihoopolhiya, ukhalhawaya ulha ri uwaninyu ulha ri o iyari ya Aburahimu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mwaana a Ntu wiilhe waathotha ni woopolha attu apotenre.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho ni akarumiya khumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Attu vaamwiwelhelha aya, Yesu nkaathepa nkaahimeria wo malhikaaniho. Vavawo aari aatameriaka uphiya Uyerusalemu, ni attu yaanyiheraka vano wiira Imwene ya Nlhuku waanonia chitema. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkeera, “Ahaawo ntu o iyari ye Imwene aarweelhe nkwaha wo utayi apochere umwene, vanomalha awe ahokolhie. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vaari awe hinaya uthama, nkeehanacha akarumiya awe khumi ni waavaha kila mmoka nchurukhu wo ulhikaana ni umwiirelha, ‘Mpangelheke maronda mpaka vanohokolhia aka.’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nansho attu o uwannyawe yaari anvengaka, nkayaaruma akarumiya arwee aahimerie attu ammara nchina wiira, ‘Khaninaattuna ahivariye umwene.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Ntu uyo nkaavariya umwene nkaahokolhia uwani. Vaahokolhelhe awe, nkaalhehera eeraka wiira akarumiya aavanhe awe nchurukhu ayo ehaniye awe aalhakelha ifaida apantte aya. <verse number="16" style="v"/>O upacha nkaawa eeraka, ‘Pwiiya, kihopatta nchurukhu nkina mikwaha khumi wo nchurukhu mmoka mwaakivanhe inyu ulhe.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nkaakhulhiya, ‘Aye, anamitheko oombone inyu! Nhokhulhuvelhiya wo makani, kinouvahani vano ikuru yulhupalhe yo weemelhelha iwani khumi.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Karumiya o nayelhi nkaawa eeraka, ‘Pwiiya, kihopatta ifaida mikwaha nthanu vachulhu nchurukhu waakivanhe inyu.’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yoyo nkaakhulhiya eerelhiyaka, ‘Nnoweemelhelha iwani nthanu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Karumiya nkina nkaawa nkeera, ‘Pwiiya, nchurukhu wo idhahabu inyu ulha va, kahovitha vanlhutoni. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kaari kuwoovakani, ukhalhawaya inyu attu o urikarika. Nnokusha ittu ihiri yawinyu ni ukhungura vahaanlhe inyu.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yoyo aakhulhiye wiira, ‘Karumiya o uhilhoka uwe! Kinouhukumulhani wo nulhumo ninyu! Wahochuwelha wiira mii kiri ntu orikarika, kinokusha ittu ihiri yawaka ni ukhungura vahaanlhe aka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Aye, woonaka khawarweehilhe unoshungiya nchurukhu? Wowo kaanopatta ifaida yo wuncherera vanohalha aka urwa uhokolhoshani.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Paahi etu, nkeerelha attu yeemenlhe vavawo ayo, ‘Munthurulheke nchurukhu uyo, nkusheke nrweeke mwammaheke karumiya pantte ifaida mikwaha khumi uyo.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nansho attu ayo nkayeera, ‘Pwiiya woonaka hopatta ifaida mikwaha khumi upwaha nchurukhu waanvanhe inyu!’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nkayaakhulha, ‘Kinouhimeriani wiira attu arina ittu, anowunchereriya, nansho attu ahirina ittu, ata ikani irina aya iyo inookushiya <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ni vano kineera, attu anokivenga wiira kihivariye umwene ayo, mwaawiiheke vaa, eevakachiye vava koonaka kimwanene!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Upocheriya wo nkhito Uyerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoha 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu amalhiheke wulhumacha, nkaaholhelha urwaa Uyerusalemu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vaaphiya awe Ubetifage ni Ubethaniya uri Mwaako wo Mizeituni, ahaaruma owiittucha awe elhi anholhelhe <verse number="30" style="v"/>aalheheraka eeraka, “Nrweeke iwani iri uholho iyo, vanophiya inyu, nnokomphwanya mwaaphuta nattukelhelhiye hinaya weetihiya ni ntu. Mwanthaphulheke mwammwiiheke vaa.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="19:30">Mwaaphuta</figure> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ntu riyoothe okohakani woonaka nnonthaphulha, mwamwiirelheke wiira, Athithi anonthanana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nkayaarwaacha ni uphwanya kila ittu thoko chaahimeriye aya ni Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vanthaphulha aya mwaaphuta uyo, ashinene nkayaakoha, “Chani woonaka mwaatti nnonthaphulha mwaaphuta uyo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nkayaakhulha, “Athithi phi nonthanana.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nkayankusha mwaaphuta unrwehelha Yesu. Nkayaathalhacha ikuwo vanthanani ni ummwelhiha Yesu akhalhe vachulhu vawe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vaamweetiha awe, attu nkayaathalhacha ikuwo chaya mphironi nkaavira vachulhu ikuwo vawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vaatameria awe Uyerusalemu, iphiro yaakelha uri Mwaako wo Mizeituni, nlhoko mwinchi wa owiittucha awe nkawaachokholha untotopelha Nlhuku akhuwelhaka voona aya cho ushangiha chonkhaye choona aya, <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yaari akhuwelhaka, “Nlhuku ammahe ibarakha mwene nowa wo nchina no Athithi uyo! Mpuha ukhalhe wiirimu ni nthimicho wa Nlhuku wiirimu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Amafarisayo akina munlhokoni mmo nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Owiittuchiha, mwaamaalhiheke owiittucha inyu ayo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kinouhimeriani wiira, kaamaalhihaka, malhuku anoweemelha ni ukhuwelha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowunlhelha iwani yo Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nkaatameria iwani, ni vawo vonne awe, nkaamoriha miithori o nlhelhaka attu o Uyerusalemu, <verse number="42" style="v"/>eeraka, “Mwakaachuwenlhe lhelho chittu chimmwiiha mpuha! Nansho chihovithiya uwaninyu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya mahuku anoowa amalhaponi inyu vanohalha aya urukurerihani ntuto, othothokelhakani kila mpatta. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Anowa uunyikalhachani inyuva vamoka ni attu inyu nlhuwanini mwinyu, ahihalhihaka ata nlhuku nimoka vachulhu nlhuku nikina, wo nlhatu noohichuwelha nihuku Nlhuku naawilhe awe uwoopolhani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookelha Inupa ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mako 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoha 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarwa ni Inupa ya Nlhuku nkaachokholha woomolha vathe attu yaapanga maronda, <verse number="46" style="v"/>eerelhaka, “Iholhepiya, Nlhuku heera, ‘Inupa aka inohalha ukhalha inupa yo lhapelha attu.’ Nansho mwaattiva nhorukunusha ukhalha nikhuku no attu o uvara makhuche!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kila nihuku Yesu nkeettuchiha attu upuwani u Inupa ya Nlhuku. Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero, ni aholhelhi a attu yaari athananaka umwiiva, <verse number="48" style="v"/>nansho khayaari ni iphiro yo wiira ukhalhawaya attu onkhaye aari amwiiwelhelhaka, ahittunaka ukufia ata nlhove nimoka.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukohereriya ikuru ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mako 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nihuku nimoka Yesu veettuchiha awe u Inupa ya Nlhuku, ahimiachaka Malhove Orera, opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero, vamoka ni ashulhupalhe wahowiya, <verse number="2" style="v"/>nkayaamwiirelha, “Nnihimerie! Nnopanga chi chittu chi wo ikuru ya apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nkani ni mii kuukoheni nlhove. Nkakihimerieni etu, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ikuru i Nayohana yo waabatiiza attu yaakhumme wa Nlhuku wiirimu ama wa attu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nkayaachokholha ukohanacha ashineneru, “Nimwaakhulheke chani? Neeraka, ‘Wa Nlhuku wiirimu’ no wiira, ‘Chani woonaka khamwaarumelhenlhe Nayohana ayo?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neerakaru, ‘Yaakhumme wa attu,’ alha attu onkhaye alha anoonata malhuku, ukhalhawaya attu onkhaye yanrumelhelha wiira Nayohana aari anamilhohi a Nlhuku.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkayaakhulha wiira, “Hii khanichuwenlhe waakhumme aya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Ata mii akinouhimeriani kimpanga chii wo ikuru yo ukhuma vayi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nlhikaaniho no imata yo zabibu ni anamalhima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mako 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkaahimeria attu nna nlhikaaniho nna, “Ahaawo ntu mmoka aalhimme imata yo zabibu, nkaashimiha wa anamalhima, nkaarwa nkwaha wo utayi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nlhaalha waayeke, nkanruma karumiya arwee apochere mahalha o izabibu. Nansho anamalhima alhe nkayaamwata karumiya uyo, nkayanhokolhosha mathatharu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nkayanruma karumiya nkina, nansho anamalhima ayo nkayanruwanakacha, nkaahokolhia mathatharu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nkanruma tho karumiya o neraru, anamalhima ayo nkayanrakalhiha ni uyo, ni umwoomolha umatani. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yamalhekeru anene imata yo zabibu nkayeera, ‘Vano kiireke chani? Kinonruma mwaamwanaka kinonttuna aka, ulha anokonlhoha!’ <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nansho anamalhima vaamwonne aya, nkayeeracha ashineneru, ‘Ulha phi mwaamwanaya nohalha uhiyeriya nhakhu. Nngwee nimwiive, nhakhu awe uyo ukhalheke wawihu!’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Paahi etu nkayankakhelha uchereshere imata yo zabibu nkayaamwiiva.” Yesu nkaakoha, “Vano anene imata ayo, anohalha weeriha chani anamalhima alhe? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Anene imata ayo anowa weeva yayo anamalhima ayo, ni uwaashimiha attu akina imata aya iyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Attu veewilhe aya, nkayeera, “Mena ahiniphwanye hii yayo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nkaaweha nkaakoha, “Haya etu alha Malhove Matakatifu alha anohimiani?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Nlhuku nikhotiye ni atheki wiira khaninlhoka</para>
  <para style="q">nihokhalha vano nlhuku no nsingi no vakhoonani.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ntu riyoothe nohalha ukwakwathuwa nenno nlhuku nno nowunthakiacha, ni nno nammulhuwelhaka ntu, ninonhararia.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo ulhiva ikhodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mako 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Owiittuchiha Malhehero ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe nkayaalhikacha ummara Yesu vavawo, ukhalhawaya ahochuwelha wiira aahimiacha nenno nlhikaaniho nno aachaka, nansho nkayoova attu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Paahi nkayaavia ikatema yoombone. Nkayaahonga attu o wiipangapanga arwee yankohache chookohiya choonria. Vavawo apatte iphiro yo ummara ni unrweeha wa attu o ikuru yo utawara o Urumi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yayo attu yaarumiye ayo, nkayaamwiirelha, “Owiittuchiha, nihochuwelha wiira, nri o wiiraniha. Nihochuwelha wiira, khannomova ntu, nnohimiacha ikeekhene yo iphiro ya Nlhuku. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nnihimerieke etu, iri yo urera ama yo unanara hii waalhiva ikhodi Nakaisari?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu ahochuwelha nriankho aya uyo, nkeerelha, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nkakooniheni nikhobilhi no nchurukhu. Ilha ikhove ni nchina nna cha apani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaakhulha, “Chi Nakaisari.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Paahi Yesu nkeera, “Morera, paahi etu, mwaalhiveke Nakaisari iri ya Nakaisari, ni unlhiva Nlhuku iri ya Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nkayoochelha ummara wo nlhove niriyoothe vaattuni vawo, paahi nkayaamaalha athikhinaka chenre awe wo waakhulha.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo uhihimmwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Amasadukayo akina, attu yaakhota wiira attu akhwilhe kanhihimwa, nkayaawa wa Yesu unkohani, nkayeera, <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Owiittuchiha, ashinna Musa ahonilhehera wiira, ‘Nlhopwana akhwaakaru ni waahiya mahanu awe ahinayara, ahima awe akelheke manupa annyarelheke ashaana ntu khwilhe uyo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ahaawo ashilhoko saba o irukulhu imoka, olhupalhe ayo ahothelha nkaakhwa wo uhaahiya ashaana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>O nayelhi nkaakhelha manupa, <verse number="31" style="v"/>o neraru chiicho. Nkayeeriya chiichammo wa attu saba onkhaye nkayaakhwacha wo haahiya ashaana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wo umalhihera opani ayo nkayaakhwa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>vano etu, nihuku no uhihimushiya attu akhwilhe nno, apani anohalha ukhalha phi owannyaya athiyana alhe? Ukhalhawaya onkhaye saba ahaathelha.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Attu o ilha ilhapo ilha anoothelha ni uthelhiya, <verse number="35" style="v"/>nansho attu Nlhuku nohalha awe waahihimusha ikatema yo uhihimushiya attu, khanowa aathelha mena uthelhiya. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Anowa ukhalha thoko minepa mena khanowa aakhwa. Anowa ukhalha ashaana a Nlhuku ahihimushiye nnookhwani. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nansho ashinna Musa ahomalha uhimiecheshani wiira attu akhwilhe anoohihimushiya nnookhwani. Vari nlhako unohimiacha mwaha wo ithuphi yaapharelha, inohimia wiira, Athithi phi, ‘Nlhuku a Aburahimu ni Nlhuku a Naisaka ni Nlhuku a Nayakhobo.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Paahi etu ri Nlhuku a attu akumi, kahiwe a attu akhwilhe, ukhalhawaya uwannyawe khaawo nookhwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Owiittuchiha akina nkayeera, “Owiittuchiha, vavawo nhaakhulha rata!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>olhumanche chiicho ukhalhawaya khayaarina chookohiya chikina tho.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukohereriya mwaha wa Kuristo Moopolhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mako 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha, “Inooria chani wiira Kuristo thanlhiye ni Nlhuku, mwaana a Adaudi? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Adaudi anene nhina ichipo cho Izaburi aneera,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Athithi aheerelha Athithi,</para>
  <para style="q">Nkhalheke wiimonono waka</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>mpaka vanohalha aka waathalha amalhaponi inyu wuuthi inyaa chinyu wiira mwaakalhelhe.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yakhalhaka Adaudi ehanne yayo, ‘Athithi’, vano etu, ineeria chani Moopolhi ukhalha mwaana a Adaudi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaamuka Owiittuchiha Malhehero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mako 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye vaari aya amwiiwelhelhaka, Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Mwiichinanelheke ni owiittuchiha Malhehero, anottuna weetakacha anawanre ikuwo cho utalhiva ni uchivelhiya ukohachiya wo nthimicho vakittu vanopangachiya maronda, athanlhaka mapuro o nthimicho mmanupani mwo unlhapelha Nlhuku ni mmanupani munoterekhiya ikaramu, <verse number="47" style="v"/>anaathurulhacha anankhwelhi ni wiipanga attu o ulhapelha wo ulhapelha ikatema yinchi! Yayo anowa uhukumulhiya ntwarusho wo uweria chinene!”</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Isadaka ya anankhwelhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mako 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu nkaaweha rata, nkoona attu o nhakhu cheera aya wo ukumiha isadaka chaya mphacheni Inupa ya Nlhuku, <verse number="2" style="v"/>nkoona tho, opani ashikini amoka amorihaka isenti pilhi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nkeera, “Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira alha opani ashikini alha ahokumiha waapwaha attu onkhaye akuminhe muu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya attu o nhakhu ayo akuminhe isadaka inokhuma mu ifaida yo munhakhuni mwaya, nansho opani alha, ni ushikini urina aya, akuminhe ittu yaakhulhuvelha aya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noohimiacha uphomolhiya wa Inupa ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mako 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Owiittucha akina aari aarerihaka wi Inupa ya Nlhuku mwaha wo urera malhuku athekelhiye inupa ayo, vamoka ni isadaka chikumihiye wa Nlhuku. Yesu nkeera, <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Alha malhuku athekelhiye ishiri onkhaye nnona inyu alha, anoowa mahuku vanohalha aya uhihalha vaa ata nlhuku nimoka vachulhu nikina, kila ittu inoophomolhiya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uhuva ni uvelhavelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mako 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nkayankoha, “Owiittuchiha, yayo malhove ayo anowa ukhumelhelha iyaakhani? Ni ithikineha yaani inowa unichuwelhiha wiira ikatema ihaaya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nhiitialhe, nhiwe mwaathepiya. Attu enchi, anowa wiipanga phi mii, eeraka, ‘Miyaano phi Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku!’ Nkina eeraka, ‘Ikatema ihaaya!’ Nansho mwaattiva nhaatware. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nhiwe mwoova vanohalha inyu wiiwa mwaha wo ikhoto ni uthemwathemwa, yayo ahothananiya uwa, nansho kuhiwe phi umalha wo chittu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nkaahimeria tho, “Makosho anowa waatakana nimoka ni nikina, imwene chinowa chaatakana chineneru. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ilhapo inowa utikhinyia chinene ni ikuruna ni mareta. Unowa ukhumelhelha mwaha wo woopiha attu ni ithikineha chulhupalhe chikhumaka wiirimu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nansho yayo ahinaya, nnoowa mwaavariya, nkamwaatwarushiya ni urweehiya mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ni ujeerani, nnowa urweehiya wo mamwene ni attu o utawara wo nlhatu no nchina naka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yeyo phi ikatema inyu yo uhimiechesha Malhove Orera uwannyaya. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mirima chinyu chihiwe chaathemwa, mena woova wiira nnohalha wiira chani wo wiivaraanga, <verse number="15" style="v"/>ukhalhawaya kinoowa koovahani malhove ni irusho chihinooria uvaanyihiya ni amalhaponi inyu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nnoowa mwaapangelhiya ichimwa ni manyanaangoro inyu ni ashilhoko inyu ni manyampwana inyu, ni akina munlhokoni mwinyu eeviyaka. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kila ntu nowa uvengani wo nlhatu wo nchina naka. <verse number="18" style="v"/>nansho khiiwo ata ikharari imoka mmuruni mwinyu inohalha upotera. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wo uvilhelha winyu, nnowiichoopolha ukumi inyu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nohimiacha upohomolhiya iwani yo Uyerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mako 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Vanohalha inyu woona iwani yo Uyerusalemu inarukureriye ni amalhaponi, vavawo mmweeke mwaachuwelha wiira uhaaya wo uphomolhiya waya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vavawo etu attu arii Uyudea attawelheke umiakoni, attu arii vawani athamacheke, ni ayo ahiri vawani ayo ahihokolhie uwani. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya yayo mahuku ayo phi ‘Mahuku o ntwarusho’, Malhove Matakatifu atimirihiye. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ahothapana manyopani ari veruttuni ni ayo anaamwiha ashaana ashinkani yayo mahuku ayo! Ukhaalhawaya milhatu cho uhuva ni ntwarusho chinowa chaakhumelhelha velhaponi va, ni urushiya wa Nlhuku waawulhuwelhaka alha attu alha. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Attu akina anowa wiiviya wo uphanga, ni attu akina anowa ukushiya mateeka velhaponi vonkhaye, ni iwani yo Uyerusalemu inoowa yaanyikalhachiya ni attu ahiri Ayahudi, mpaka ikatema vanohalha aya utimira.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uwa wo Mwaana a Ntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mako 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Chinowa woonia ithikineha chinchi wo nchuwa ni mweeri ni ittotwa. Velhaponi, ilhapo chonkhaye chinowa uhuva, wo nipampa no woova nkhito wo iphioo cho mbaharini. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Attu anowa ukomwaa wo nlhatu no woova, awehereraka mwaha unohalha ukhumelhelha velhaponi, ukhalhawaya machiri o wiirimu anowa utikhinyiya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vavawo etu, mwaana a Ntu phi nowa awe, awaaka mmahuteni wo machiri ni nthimicho mwinchi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yayo vanohalha aya uchokholha, mweemelheke rata ni utheesha miuru chinyu wiirimu, ukhalhawaya Moopolhi inyu ri vakhiviru.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wiittucha wo mwiri wo nkhuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mako 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu nkaahimeria nlhikaaniho, “Nkoopuwelhani mwiri wo nkhuyu ni miri chikina chinchi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vanoona inyu miri chiphuwaka, phi nochuwelha inyu wiira mmalha iyaakha vano. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Chiichammo etu vanohalha inyu woona alha onkhaye alha apangiaka, nnowa mwaachuwelha wiira, Imwene ya Nlhuku ihaatameria.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Wo ikekhiaye muupuwelheke wiira, ilha iyari ilha khinovira yayo ahinaya ukhumelhelha. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Irimu ni ilhapo chinoovira, nansho malhove aka khanovira mena.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nshelhelhiheke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Nkhalheke miitho! Mirima chinyu chihiwe chaalhemelhiya ni nikakata no chittu cho velhaponi ni uhapalhiya ni nipampa no iphiro cho mwiilhaponi. Mweettialhaka nenno nihuku nno ninowa <verse number="35" style="v"/>noovarakani thoko nriankho. Ukhalhawaya ninoowa naaphwanya attu onkhaye velhaponi va. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nhiittialhe etu, nlhapelheke wo uhoochaa, mmwe mwaapatta machiri o uvira rata vanohalha aya uwa yayo malhove ayo, ni weemelha rata uholho wa Mwaana a Ntu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu nkaalhokelha yayo mahuku ayo eettuchihaka attu Inupa ya Nlhuku, ni nchuwa veelha aya, aarwaa ulhokelhani uhiyu waari Mwaako wo Mizeituni. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vaasha aya kila nihuku attu aari apeheriaka Inupa ya Nlhuku uumwiiwelhelhani.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Miruku cho umwiivelha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoha 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nihuku no isikuukuu yo mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure yo Pasaka naari ninaatamenrie. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero yaari yoovaka attu, paahi nkayaavia nipesha no unhelha Yesu mmachirini eeviye wo uhichuwania ni attu.</para>
  <para style="s">Nayuda anorumelhelha unthumiha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mako 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nakare nkaakelha Nayuda ehaniya Isikariote, mmoka aya owiittucha khumi ni elhi a Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Paahi etu Nayuda nkayaarwaa uupangani miruku ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni aholhelhi yeemelhelha Inupa ya Nlhuku chinohalha aya unthumiha Yesu uwannyaya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nkayaateelhiya nkayeewanana ummaha nchurukhu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nayuda nkayaarumelhelha, nkayaakhalha yaaviaka nipesha noombone no unrweeha Yesu attu ahichuwelhaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowiichesha tayari unlhia Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mako 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoha 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nihuku nkanaaphiya no mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure mwaakhondoro o Pasaka vaakumihiya awe isadaka. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu nkaaruma Napeturo ni Nayohana eeraka, “Nrweeke mwaterekheke ikaramu yo Pasaka niwe naalhia.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Owiittucha ayo nkayankoha, “Nnothanana nirweeke naterekhelheke uuyi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhulha, “Vanophiya inyu vawani, nnokomwoona ntu welhe mwaapu wo maashi. Mwanttwareke mpaka inupa inohalha awe ukelha, <verse number="11" style="v"/>mwamwiirelheke, ‘Owiittuchiha aneera, iri vayi ichuumba inohalha aka unlhelhia pasaka vamoka ni owiittucha aka?’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nokowonihani ichuumba yulhupalhe iri inupa yo nchulhu, imanlhe urerihiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nkayarwaacha ni uphwanya kila ittu inari thoko chaahimmie awe Yesu, nkayaaterekhacha cholhia cho Pasaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yolhia ya Athithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mako 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ako 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ikatema yaayeke, Yesu nkaakhalha ulhia yolhia vamoka ni akarumiya awe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nkeerelhacha, “Kaholhakelha chinene unlhia Pasaka ulha vamoka ni inyu mwaatti kihinaya uhuvihiya! <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kinouhimeriani wiira, Akinowa kanlhia tho mpaka nihuku vanohalha aya utimira wi Imweneni wa Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nkaawiaa ikikombe yo idivai, nkanshukuru Nlhuku, nkaavahacha eeraka, “Mmwieke nkawanacheke. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya kinohimia wiira, ukhuma nna akinowuria tho idivai yo zabibu mpaka Imwene ya Nlhuku vanohalha aya uwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nkaakusha nkatte, nkanshukuru Nlhuku, nkaamianiha, nkaavahacha, eeraka, “Ilha phi iruttu aka, nnovahiya inyu. Mpangeke chiicho wo ukuupuwelha.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Thoko chiichammo, nkaavahacha ikikombe vaamalhinhe aya ulhia, eeraka, “Ilha ikikombe ilha phi Malhehano o Naanano anohimiecheshiya ni iphome aka, inorihiaa wo nlhatu ninyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Nansho, mwooneke! Ntu nokithumiha rii vava, nolhia vamoka ni mii! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mwaana a Ntu nookhwa thoko Nlhuku chenre awe wo uhimia, nansho hothapana yoyo ntu nohalha unthumiha uyo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Paahi nkayaachokholha ukohanacha ashineneru, phi mpani yoyo nohalha wiira chommo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwaha wo ukohana mpani rii mulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nkawaakhumelhelha uvaanyihana munlhokoni mwa owiittucha wiira mpani rii mulhupalhe aya. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelha, “Amwene o velhaponi va anaatawara attu ahiri Ayahudi wo ikuru, ehaniyaka ‘Manyampwana a attu’. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nansho ihikhalhe chiicho uwaninyu mwaatti, ntu ri mulhupalhe munlhokoni mwinyu nophwanelhiya ukhalha mwankani waapwaha onkhaye munlhokoni mwinyu, ni nholhelhi akhalheke thoko namitheko. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Attu anaanyihera mulhupalhe phi mpani? Phi nokhalha uweherera aterekhelhiye ama naaterekhelha akina? Phi yoyo nokhalha ni uterekhelhiya. Nansho mii kiri va ukhalha namitheko inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nholhokelha ni mii ikatema yonkhaye yo ulhikachiya waka, <verse number="29" style="v"/>ni chiyo thoko chinre aya Athithi wo ukivaha mii Imwene, ni mii kinouvahani mwaatti Imwene iyo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nnowa mwaalhia ni uwuria vamoka ni mii wi Imwene aka, ni inyu nnowa ukhalhelha ihiche ye Imwene mwaahukumulhaka makosho khumi ni melhi o Uisraeli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noolhohera ukhotiya ni Napeturo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoha 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Nasimoni, Nasimoni! Nkeewani! Nakare naavia nipesha no ulhikachani onkhaye, no uveera imbeyu ni iphepuwa, thoko namalhima chinoveera awe mmuka. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nansho mii kihoulhapelhelhani, Nasimoni, wiira nrima winyu uhiwukuwe. Ni inyu vanohalha inyu ukihokolheelha, mmwe mwaahelha nrima ashilhoko inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayeera, “Thithi, Kiri tayari uttukiya ata ukhwa vamoka ni inyu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Napeturo kinouhimeriani wiira, nthupi uhinaya wiipa mapikoosha, nnowa mwaakiruna vararu wiira khankichuwenlhe mii.”</para>
  <para style="s">Nchako, Nrupa ni Uphanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha owiittucha awe, “Ikatema korumme akani wo hikusha nrupa wo nchurukhu mena nchako mena iraatu, chani mwahohuvelha ittu iriyoothe?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaakhulhacha, “Ata mena.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Nansho vano, ntu ri ni nrupa ama nchako wo nchurukhu akusheke, ni ntu hiri ni uphanga, athumiheke nikoti nawe athumeke. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Paahi kinouhimeriani wiira, Malhove Matakatifu aneera, ‘Aheeshiya nlhoko mmoka ni attu o uwonya,’ anootimira, ukhalhawaya nlhove ninokaacha mii ninootimirihiya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Owiittucha nkayeeracha, “Thithi, mmweheke! Vaa ahawo maphanga melhi!”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkaakhulha, “Haya etu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noolhapelha u Mwaako wo Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mako 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu nkaathama ni urwaa waari Mwaako wo Mizeituni, aattukanaka owiittucha awe thoko cheera awe. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vaaphilhe awe wowo, nkeerelhacha, “Nlhapelheke, nhiwe mwaawulhuwa muulhikachiyani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nkaahiyacha, nkaarwa vatayi vakani wo ntu uwonya nlhuku, nkaakhoroma ulhapelha. <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Thithi, mwattunaka nthamiheke ilha ikikombe ilha. Nansho kuhiwe thoko chinothanana aka nansho mattunelho inyu, atimirihiye.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nnepa wo wiirimu nkawaawa unhelha nrima. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ahuvaka chinene munrimani, nkaalhepelha wo machiri chinene, ntukutta thoko iphome nkanankhuma nkanaamora vathi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Amalhiheke ulhapelha, nkaahokolhelha owiittucha awe, nkaaphwanyacha anarumpe, ukhalhawaya yaari anakelhiye ihuzuni. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nkeerelhacha, “Chani woonaka nnorupa? Mweemelheke nlhapelheke wiira nhiwulhuwe muulhikachiyani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noovariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoha 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu aari bado olhumachaka, mphingo wa attu vaawilhe aya, aholhelhiyaka ni Nayuda, mmoka aya owiittucha khumi ni elhi. Nkaawa ni uthanana unkumbatira Yesu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Nayuda, nnothanana unthumiha Mwaana a Ntu wo unkumbatira?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Owiittucha awe yooneke, nkayeeracha, “Thithi, chani nikumiheke mialho?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Mmoka aya nkanthikilha karumiya a Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni unkwatulha nnyaru no wiimonono.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Nhiyeke, ilha ihothosha!” Nkankwakwanya nnyaru naakhapiye nno, nkaalhamiha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Paahi etu, Yesu nkeerelhacha opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni aholhelhi ni attu emelhelha Inupa ya Nlhuku ni ashulhupalhe yaawiilhe ummara ayo, “Chani woonaka mmweelhe mialho chulhupalhe ni indonga uwa uukivarani thoko nnowa ummara ntu o uvara makhuche? <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kaari ni inyu mwaatti kila nihuku keettuchihaka Inupa ya Nlhuku, nansho khamwakivanre. Nansho vano phi ikatema inyu yo upanga, phi ikatema yo ikuru yo mwiipiphini.”</para>
  <para style="s">Napeturo anonruna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mako 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoha 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Nkayammara Yesu ni unrweeha upuwani wa Opochera ishaani olhupalhe, Napeturo attwaraka utayiutayi. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Mooro waari unaparihelhiye variyari ipuwa, Napeturo nkayaakhalha wootta vamoka ni attu akina. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Karumiya mmoka nthiyana vonne aya anakhanlhe oottaka mooro, nkaaweha ni uhimia wiira, “Ulha ntu ulha chiicho aari vamoka ni Yesu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Nansho Napeturo nkayaaruna, “Uwe nthiyana, akinchuwenlhe mii yoyo ntu uyo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Katashi tho, ntu nkina nkoona Napeturo nkeera, “Inyu mwaari mmoka aya!”</para>
  <para style="p">Nansho Napeturo nkaakhulha, “Uwe, mii akihiwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yavireke isaa imoka, ntu nkina nkaamindelha, “Wo ikekhiaye, khiiwo yo ukhota, wiira ulha aari vamoka ni Yesu, ukhalhawaya ni uyo nokhuma Ugalilaya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Nansho Napeturo nkayaakhulha, “Uwena, akichuwenlhe unhimia awo!”</para>
  <para style="p">Vavawo vavawo, anari olhumachaka, nthupi nkaweepa. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Athithi nkayaarukunuwa ni waaweha Napeturo wiitho. Napeturo nkayoopuwelha cheerelhiye aya ni Athithi, “Nthupi uhinaya wiipa mapikoosha, nnoowa mwaakiruna mikwaha miraru wiira khankichuwenlhe.” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Napeturo nkayaakhuma vathe, nkayonlha chinene.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noheulhachiya ni waatiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mako 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Attu anlhitelhelha Yesu ayo, nkayaamwata ni unheulhacha. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Nkayanttuka ikuwo wiitho ni unkoha, “Nlhamulheke mpani owatilheni!” <verse number="65" style="v"/>Nkayanruwanakacha chinene.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu upuwani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mako 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoha 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Washeeke, ashulhupalhe ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna nkayaakumaana uwaamulhani, Yesu nkaawihiya upuwani. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Nkayeeracha, “Unihimerieke, Uweva phi Kuristo Moopolhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mii kahimiaka, mwaatti khannokirumelhelha, <verse number="68" style="v"/>ni vavawo kookohakani, khannokaakhulha. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Nansho uchokholhelha nna Mwaana a Ntu nowa ukhalha wiimonono wa Athithi Nlhuku o machiri.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye nkayeera, “Paahi niireke etu, uwe phi Mwaana a Nlhuku?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Inyu mwaatti nhohimia, wiira phi mii.” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Ni ayo nkayeeracha, “Chani uhawo uhimiechesha ukina tho! Ukhalhawaya hohimiacha wo malhaku awe mwanene ni inyu nheewacha!”</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorweehiya u Napilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mako 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoha 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nlhoko wonkhaye nkaweemelha ni unrweha Yesu mpaka u Napilato <verse number="2" style="v"/>waamwemenshe aya ni uchokholha uhimiacha milhatu, “Nahomwona ulha ntu ulha aapoterihaka attu o velhaponi, eerelhaka wiira ahilhive ikhodi wa Nakaisari ni wiichihana mwanene wiira, Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku mwene a Ayahudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Napilato nkayankoha Yesu, “Inyuva phi amwene a Ayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Thoko chinre inyu wo wulhumacha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Napilato nkayeerelha opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni attu wiira, “Akoonaka nlhatu uriwoothe wa ulha ntu ulha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nansho attu nkayaathepa ukuruvalhelha wo machiri chinene, “Nowaachopeacha ni weettuchiha attu apange injoove ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uyudea. Aachokhonlhe Ugalilaya vano rii vaa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noorweehiya u Naherode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Napilato veewilhe aya, nkayaakoha, “Kwani yolha ntu ulha nokhuma Ugalilaya?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vaachuwenlhe aya wiira aari ntu o ilhapo yo ikuru i Naherode, nkayanhokolhosha u Naherode uwo, aari yeyo ikatema iyo Uyerusalemu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Naherode nkayaateelhiya nrima umwoona Yesu, ukhalhawaya yaari amwiiwaka athananaka umwoona toka khalhayi. Akhulhuvelhaka umwoona Yesu apangaka cho ushangiha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Paahi etu Naherode nkayankoha Yesu chookohiya chinchi, nansho Yesu khaakhunlhe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero yaari miholho ahimiachaka milhatu chinchi choomwootheria Yesu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Naherode ni manyaaasikari aya nkayampangelha Yesu ncheche, nkayammwariha n'golole we imwene nkayanhokolhosha u Napilato. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Toka nenno nihuku nno, Napilato ni Naherode nkayaalhutanaacha umpwana, ukhalhawaya khalhayi vawo kila mmoka khaari ewananaka ni nkhunanawe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu noohukumulhiya wiiviya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mako 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoha 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Napilato nkayeehanacha opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni aholhelhi ni attu vamoka, <verse number="14" style="v"/>nkayeera, “Nhommwiiha yolha ntu ulha uwannyaka mwiiraka wiira aari aapoterihaka attu. Vano etu, kihonkohacha mwaatti mwiiwaka, ni mii akoonne nlhatu uriwoothe uhimianche inyu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Akihiwe mii vekha mena Naherode oonne nlhatu, phi nhokolhonshe aya uwanihu. Khuuwo nlhatu wo hii umwiiva. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Paahi mii kinomwaata ikopo ni unhiyerera.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kila nihuku no Pasaka, Napilato aari ni malhemalhelho o unhiyerera ntu mmoka ttukiye aathananiya ni attu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nlhoko wonkhaye nkawaakhuwelha, “Eeviye! Munhiyerereke Baraba!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Baraba uyo aattukiye wo nlhatu no injoove yaapangeelhe vawani ni nlhatu no weeva attu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Napilato aari athananaka unhiyerera Yesu, paahi nkayoolhumana attu tho. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nansho attu yaari akhuwelhachaka, “Munkhomelhelhe vansalaabani! Munkhomelhelhe vansalaabani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Napilato nkayeera tho vo neraru, “Nansho ttenkeni? Khuuwo nlhatu kinoona aka wo umwiiva! Kinoomwata ikopo ni unthaphulha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nansho attu nkayaathepa ukhuwelhacha avekelhaka wiira Yesu akhomelhelhiye, ni nlhove naya nkanaarumelhelhiya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Paahi etu Napilato nkayanhukumulha Yesu thoko chaalhepelha aya attu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nkayanthaphulha Baraba, ntu aattukiye wo nlhatu no injoove ni niiviho, nkayaavaha Yesu wiira ampangeke ittu yaathanana aya, thoko chaavekelha aya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookhomelhelhiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoha 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Manyaasikaari nkayanvelhelha Yesu, vaarwaa aya nkayankumaana ntu o Ukirene nchina nawe Simoni aawa akhumaka umatani. Nkayanchuchumiha, nkayanriaa nsalaaba, akushe anttwaraka Yesu utulhi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu nkawanttwara, akina aya yaari manyopani onlhacha umunlhelha. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu nkaarukunuwelha, nkeerelha, “Manyopani o Uyerusalemu! Nhikunlhelhe mii, nansho mwichunlhelheke mwaashinene ni achishaana inyu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ukhalhawaya mahuku anowa attu vanowa aya wiira, ‘Ahoreeriya manyaathiyana ahiyanre, ahaayanre ashaana mena ulhelha!’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema iyo, attu phi nowa aya wiirelha miako, ‘Nniwulhuwelheke! Nnivitheke!’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vavawo attu aneera chiicho wo mwiri nkithi, mwiri wo wuuma inohalha wiiria chani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Attu akina elhi, onkhaye o uwonya, yaari ni ayo arweehiyaka wiiviya vamoka ni Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vaaphilhe aya vakittu vaneehaniya “Nikhurukucha no muru,” nkayankhomelhelha Yesu vavawo, ni attu elhi o uwonya, mmoka wiimonono ni nkina wiimushi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu nkeera, “Thithi mwaalhevelheke! Ukhalhawaya khachuwenlhe impanga aya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaakawanacha ikuwo chawe wo woopelha ikhura. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Attu nkayeemelhacha aawehaka Aholhelhi a Ayahudi vampangelha aya ncheche, “Ahoopolha attu akina, haya etu echopolheke mwanene yakhalhaka uyo phi Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Manyaasikaari ni ayo nkayampangelha ncheche chiicho, nkayaawa nkayammaha isiki, <verse number="37" style="v"/>yiiraka, “Wiichopolheke umwanene wakhalhaka uwe phi mwene a Ayahudi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vachulhu nsalaaba nkayaakhomelhelha nipattu naalhempe aya malhove eera, “Ulha phi mwene a Ayahudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mmoka a attu yaakhomelhelhiye vamoka ni Yesu nkaachokholha unruwana Yesu, “Uwe kuhiwe phi Kuristo Moopolhi? Wiichoopolheke umwanene, unoopolheke ni hii!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nkina uyo nansho, nkanchachera nkhunanawe eeraka, “Uwe khunomoova Nlhuku? Ihukumu ipantte awo iyo phi pantte awe. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hii, ikekhiaye ihu iyo, phi niphwanenlhe, ukhalhawaya nihopochera malhivo o mitheko chihu, nansho uyo khawonnye ittu.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nkaamwiirelha Yesu, “Yesu wakuupuwelheke mii, vanohalha awo uwa unari Amwene vawo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Kinoolhelha wo ikekhiaye wiira lhelho nna, unowa waakhalha ni mii Uphiooni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukhwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoha 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yaari saa sita uthana nchuwa vaatiphiilhe aya, ipiphi nkayaawanelha ilhapo yonkhaye mpaka vaari aya saa tisa, <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nipaziya nulhupalhe naattukelhelhiye variyari u Inupa ya Nlhuku nkanaahuwa velhi. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakhuwelha, “Thithi! Kinoweesha nnepa aka mmathathani mwinyu!” Voolhumanche awe chiicho, nkaarihiaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nholhelhi a manyaasikari o Rumi nkoona cheeria, nkanthimicha Nlhuku, eeraka, “We ikekhiaye ulha aari ntu orera nrima!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Attu aathukumanne vavawo uweha chaapangiaa ahoona chikhumelhenlhe, nkayaathuruwa mmawani, echatakachaka ikhakacha wo wooniha ihuzuni. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Attu onkhaye anchuwenlhe Yesu, ikhalhaka vamoka ni manyopani antwanre ukhuma Ugalilaya, yaari aneemenlhe utayi awehaka.</para>
  <para style="s">Uvithiya wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoha 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ahokhalha attu amoka o rera nrima anenchi o Uarimathaya iwani yo Uyudea nchina naya Nayusufu. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yayo aari ntu o Uarimathaya, aapanga thoko Nlhuku chaathanana awe attuniyaka ni attu, awehereraka uwa wo Imwene ya Nlhuku. Inakhalhaka aari ntu o Ipuwa yulhupalhe ya Ayahudi, khaari arumelhelhaka ittu ipangiye. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yayo yahorwaa u Napilato nkayaavekelha avahiye iruttu ya Yesu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Nkayaakurusha iruttu iyo vathi, nkaavilhikelha ikuwo yo hariri, nkayaavitha nnihiyeni mwaahemiye vamwalhani, nihiye naari bado uvithiya ntu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Nenno naari nihuku no Ijumaa, Nihuku no Wiittuwa niwaaka meelho aya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Manyopani yantwanre Yesu ukhuma Ugalilaya nkayarwaa ni Nayusufu uwinnuwelhani nihiye nivithiye awe Yesu. Nkayoona vavithiye aya iruttu awe. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Nkayaahokolhiacha uwani nkayaakooroshacha makhura o unukhelha o uwa uuhikani iruttu ya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Nihuku no Wiittuwa nkayeettuwa thoko Malhehero chaalhehera aya.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Uhihimmwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mako 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoha 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mapikoosha o nihuku no Jumaapili manyopani yahorwaa unihiyeni, anakushilhe makhura o unukhelha aakoronshe aya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nkayaaphwanya nlhuku ninapirikishiye ni uthama vanlhakoni vawo,<figure style="fig" desc="" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="24:2">Nlhuku nihopirikishiya vanihiyeni</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>paahi etu nkayaakelhacha nhina, nansho khayaaphwannye iruttu ya Athithi Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkayeemelha ashangachaka yoyo mwaha uyo, wo uhikhulhuvelha, nkayaakhumelhelha attu elhi aawanre ikuwo chootelha chinene, eemelhaka waatameria. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Manyopani ayo yoovaka nkayaakhoromacha vathi, attu ayo veera aya, “Yeeshiyani umwaavia ntu nkumi mwa attu akhwilhe? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Khaawo vaa, hohihimwa. Muupuwelheke chenre awe wo uhimia vaari inyu Ugalilaya, <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Mwaana a Ntu hophwanelhiya uhelhiya mmathathani mwa attu o uwonya, akhomelhelhiye, ni nihuku no neraru ahihimmwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Manyopani nkayoopuwelha malhove awe, <verse number="9" style="v"/>nkayaakhuma nnihiyeni, nkayaahimiacha mwaha wonkhaye waahimiachera owiittucha khumi ni mmoka ahanlhe alhe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Manyopani ayo yaari Amariamu Magidalena ni Nayoana ni Amariamu anumwanaya Nayakhobo, yayo ni manyopani akina phi ahimianche wa akarumiya. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nansho akarumiya nkayoona yayo malhove ayo thoko ncheche, khayaarumelhenlhe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nansho Napeturo nkayaarwaa unihiyeni attimakachaka, nkayooroma, vaathurumenlhe aya nkayoona ikuworu. Paahi nkayaahokolhia uwani ashangaka mwaha ukhumelhenlhe.</para>
  <para style="s">Nkwaha wo Uemau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mako 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nenno nihuku, owiittucha elhi a Yesu yaari akelhaka iwani yeehaniya Uemau, imaili saba ukhuma Uyerusalemu, <verse number="14" style="v"/>arerihaka ashineneru mwaha wonkhaye upangeelhe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vaari aya eetaka arerihaka, Yesu mwanene nkaawa aatameriaka ni weeta vamoka ni ayo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>nkayaamwona, nansho ahinchuwelhaka. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu nkeerelhacha, “Nnoopa mwaha waani mwaashineneru uno mweetaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayeemelhacha, wiitho anachanre ihuzuni. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mmoka aya eehaniya Nakileopa nkankoha, “Kwani inyuva alheto va Yerusalemu va, vekha nhinochuwelha chittu chipangelhe alha mahuku vakani avinre alha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu nkaakoha, “Mwaha waani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nkayaamwaakhulha, “Mwaha umphwannye Yesu o Unazareti. Yoyo ntu uyo aari namilhohi a Nlhuku aari ni ikuru wa Nlhuku ni wa attu yo upanga chittu ni wiittuchiha. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni aholhelhi ihu yahonkumiha wiira ahukumulhiye, nkaakhomelhelhiya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nansho hii nahonkhulhuvelha wiira phi nowa woopolha attu o Israeli! Upwaha vavawo, lhelho nihuku no neraru toka vaapangeelhe aya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tho manyopani akina munlhokoni mwihu ahonithuthusha, yahorwaa unihiyeni lhelho wichishuru, <verse number="23" style="v"/>nansho khayoonne iruttu iyo. Nkayaahokolhia eeraka wiira ahoona minepa chaahimmie wiira hohihimmwa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Attu akina nkayaarwaa unihiyeni ni uphwanya thoko chaahimiye ni manyopani alhe, nansho khayamwonne.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vavawo etu Yesu nkeerelha, “Woonaka nhophupuwalha mwaatti ayi, wo mirima chimpicha urumelhelha malhove aahimiye ni anamilhohi a Nlhuku! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Chani, khawalhonke Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku uhuvihachiya, wiira akelhe rata munthimichoni mwawe?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nkaapatakulhelha chittu chonkhaye chaamwacha nhina Malhove Matakatifu uchokholha wa ashinna Musa mpaka wa anamilhohi onkhaye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vaatameria aya iwani yaalhukama aya, Yesu nkeepanga thoko noopwaha vavawo, <verse number="29" style="v"/>nansho yayo manyaattu ayo nkayampepecha, eeraka, “Nkhalheke ni hii, uheelha.” Paahi etu nkaarwa uwannyaya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nkaakhalha ulhia yolhia vamoka, nkaakusha nkatte, nkaalhapelhelha ibarakha, nkaamia, nkaavahacha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Miitho aya nkayaapatakulhiya nkayanchuwelha, nansho nkaapotera vamiithoni waya. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nkayeera ashineneru, “Chani mirima chihu khachaari chipharelhaka mooro volhumachawe unilhamulhelha Malhove Matakatifu mphironi mmwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yeyo ikatema nkayaathama nkayaahokolhia Uyerusalemu, nkayaaphwanyacha owiittucha khumi ni mmoka anathukumanne vamoka, <verse number="34" style="v"/>eerachaka wiira, “Wo ikekhiaye, Athithi ahohihimmwa! Ahaakhumelhelha Nasimoni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Owiittucha elhi nkayaahimiacha mwaha waakhumelhenlhe mphironi, ni chenre aya wo waachuwelha Athithi vaamianinhe aya nkatte wa Owiittucha aya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nowaakhumelhelha Owiittucha awe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoha 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mitk 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Akarumiya elhi ayo vaari aya ahimiachaka yoyo mwaha uyo, wo uhiweherera, Athithi anene nkayeemelha variyari aya eeraka, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nkayaathuthuwacha, yaanyiheraka wiira ahoona nshoka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nansho nkeerelhacha, “Nnoovani? Nnowelhiyani nipampa mu nrimani? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mmweheke mathatha ni mieto chaka, nkiweheke ni mii kimwanene. Nkikwakwanyeke, nnowoona wiira akiri nshoka, ukhalhawaya nshoka khanirina iruttu yo ithayi mena makhuva, thoko nnokoona inyu chi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nkeera chiicho oonihachaka mathatha awe ni mieto chawe. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Akarumiya vaari aya ahirumelhelhaka ittu yoona aya, uno athepaka wuumiya uwanoni wo uteelhiya, Yesu ahaakohacha, “Nhanaa ittu yo ulhia va?” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nkayammaha ihopa yo waaneelhiya, <verse number="43" style="v"/>nkaakusha nkaalhia amwoonaka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Paahi nkaahimeriacha wiira, “Chilha phi chittu chaahimilhe aka ikatema vaari aka ni inyu. Ikhalhe wiira, kila ittu ilhepiye ikaachaka nhina Malhehero a ashinna Musa, chilhepiye ni anamilhohi ni Izaburi chihotimira.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nkaapatakulha irusho chaya wiira achuwelhe Malhove Matakatifu <verse number="46" style="v"/>nkeerelhacha, “Phinre aya wo ulhepiya, Kuristo Moopolhi nowa uhuvihiya ni uhihimmwa nnookhwani aviraka nihuku no neraru, <verse number="47" style="v"/>ni wo nchina nawe nttenga wo uhiyereriya uwonya unohimiachiya mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye, ichokholhaka Uyerusalemu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Inyu phi o uhimiechesha chittu chonkhaye chi. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ni mii kinommwiiha alhehiye ni Athithi uwaninyu. Nansho nnothananiya uweherera nnari iwani yuulhupalhe mpaka machiri o wiirimu vanohalha aya uwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nookushiya wiirimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mako 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mitk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Paahi nkaaholhelha uthama vawani mpaka Ubethaniya, vaathenshe awe miono nkaavaha ibarakha. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Vaari awe aavahaka ibarakha, ahaahiya, nkaakushiya wiirimu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Nkayanthimicha ni uhokolhia Uyerusalemu, wo mpuha mwinchi, <verse number="53" style="v"/>nkayaalhokelhacha ikatema yonkhaye akhalhaka Inupa ya Nlhuku antotopelhaka Nlhuku.</para>
</usx>
